  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "{\n  \"manuscript_guide\": \"全文按\\\"临床关联证据—免疫机制—代谢物中介—外部干扰—主动干预—毒性管理—方法学与转化边界\\\"推进。引言与正文最终应实际引用至少150篇去重文献；引用必须参与论证，不为凑数机械平分到各章，也不把尚未写出的引言预先计入已完成指标。来源别名应统一处理：P0333与P0584、P0402与P0576、P0049与P0605等视为同一来源，避免重复计数；工具或检索导航标识不得充当正文文献编号。全篇反复出现的核心对象必须有明确主讲位置：Ch1负责观察性关联强度、队列异质性、方案修饰和证据阶梯入口；Ch2负责免疫机制链条并严格区分动物因果与人类关联；Ch3负责代谢物分子靶点、情境依赖和TME浓度缺口；Ch4负责抗生素、PPI、饮食和生活方式等外部暴露的时机、剂量、癌种背景与因果边界；Ch5负责FMT、定义菌群和活体生物药的临床转化、疗效异质性与证据等级；Ch6负责毒性预测、疗效/毒性耦合或解耦、供体与方案情境化安全管理；Ch7负责把前述瓶颈转为方法学设计原则。跨章承接要具体：Ch1让读者理解关联存在但不可普适，留下机制解释和干预验证问题；Ch2解释微生物如何进入先天和适应性免疫，但不解决代谢物浓度与外部扰动问题；Ch3把机制落到化学介质和受体通路，留下血浆与TME暴露脱节的问题；Ch4说明临床现实中的暴露如何重塑这些轴，留下主动干预是否可行；Ch5评估主动干预的疗效与边界，留下毒性管理问题；Ch6处理疗效与毒性如何耦合或解耦，留下预测和标准化难题；Ch7归纳为可执行研究设计。写作中不得使用同一种\\\"背景→机制→应用→局限\\\"模板套所有对象，也不得在每章结尾重复同一句证据不足。比较必须先明确维度：癌种、ICI方案、暴露时窗、基线/纵向、供体特征、宿主免疫状态、模型系统与人体证据、血浆/粪便与TME浓度。对可能性、条件性和阴性结果要保留原有限定：观察性关联不写成因果，动物模型不直接外推人类，血浆浓度不等同组织浓度，Phase II信号不写成Phase III确证，特定癌种或方案的结果不扩大为普适结论。关于P0593：该来源实际内容为别嘌醇通过嘌呤补救途径增加肌苷分泌、增强肿瘤免疫原性的机制研究（小鼠CT26模型+人类膀胱癌回顾性队列），并非TACITO试验。正文中不得将P0593作为TACITO d-FMT联合ICI治疗mRCC的来源引用。P0593应在Ch3肌苷部分作为非微生物来源肌苷增效的平行机制证据使用，或在Ch5作为非菌群代谢干预的对比案例。mRCC中FMT联合ICI的随机证据应引用P0090系统综述中汇总的Phase II RCT数据（FMT联合pembrolizumab+axitinib，1年PFS 66.7% vs 35.0%）。\\n\\n全文章节写作安排：\\n\\nCh1 — 实体瘤中肠道微生物组与 ICI 疗效的临床关联证据\\n本章先建立\\\"有信号但无通用标志物\\\"的判断，再解释为何不能外推。顺序为：跨癌种阳性信号与反例 → 队列异质性与功能趋同 → 治疗方案修饰 → 外部药物暴露作为修饰变量 → 基线快照局限与纵向动态 → 证据阶梯表。跨队列统计、肠型、SCRUM-Japan、mCRPC反例和菌株级方案依赖共同支撑无普适标志物；JCOG2007在此主讲方案特异性，后章只回指。抗生素和PPI只保留总体效应量、关键时间窗和校正必要，详细剂量反应、HCC阴性、PPI机制留给Ch4。FMT-LUMINate、MIMic、MITRIC在表中只保留阶段、人群、主要结局和关键限制，机制与试验比较留给Ch5。本章结尾应留下两个问题：这些关联通过什么免疫机制表达，以及主动干预能否跨越观察性关联。\\n\\nCh2 — 微生物调节 ICI 疗效的免疫学机制\\n本章以机制链条组织，不按菌种罗列。顺序为：先天识别与DC启动 → 适应性启动与T细胞亚群 → 屏障、易位与髓系重编程 → 肿瘤类型和模型差异。每个节点都要区分证据层级：小鼠或体外因果、人类宏基因组或伴随观察、肿瘤内微生物边界。六酰化LPS、CD103+ DC、PD-L2/RGMb主讲先天和DC启动；分子模拟主讲适应性启动；P0098的Treg动态只作短回指，主要免疫中介留给Ch6。屏障部分要说明屏障损伤与疗效增强可以分离，细菌易位要区分主动免疫转运与被动漏肠，髓系部分要说明同一易位信号可产生促炎或抑制后果。最后用表格比较肿瘤类型机制与证据类型，不重复Ch1的临床关联强度。\\n\\nCh3 — 微生物代谢物的中介作用与分子机制\\n本章按分子靶点和情境条件组织代谢物，不按来源菌列表。先写SCFAs的双向性：PD-1背景下增强CD8+ T细胞和记忆，CTLA-4背景下可能促Treg或抑制DC共刺激；再写缺氧、葡萄糖剥夺和浓度阈值造成的效应反转。肌苷部分必须分开两条机制：肿瘤内在UBA6抑制与T细胞A2AR或碳源作用；临床只保留血浆关联和早期随机信号，并明确人体TME实测浓度缺失。胆汁酸与色氨酸代谢物围绕TGR5/FXR、AhR/RORγt等受体网络写局部与系统差异。功能通路部分由Ch2回指，但主讲放在本章，用于说明功能特征优于分类学。最后的TME浓度缺口要具体说明其阻碍剂量优化、因果推断和临床给药设计。P0593（别嘌醇/肌苷研究）在本章作为非微生物来源肌苷增效的平行证据使用：别嘌醇通过抑制XDH增加肌苷分泌→上调MHC-I和PD-L1→增强CD8+ T细胞杀伤，在CT26模型中联合抗PD-1实现4/6完全清除，人类膀胱癌回顾性队列（n=50）中抗痛风药使用者OS显著优于未使用者。此案例说明肌苷通路可被非菌群手段激活，但不能替代菌群来源肌苷的生理浓度讨论；其人类证据仅为小样本回顾性关联，不升级为因果。\\n\\nCh4 — 外部因素对微生物 - 免疫轴的干扰\\n本章主讲外部暴露如何改变微生物-免疫轴，并与Ch1的修饰变量概览分工：Ch1只给出效应量和时间窗入口，本章展开时机、剂量、药物类别、肿瘤背景和因果边界。抗生素按时间窗和疗程组织，加入HCC阴性结果与PD-L1分层，防止单一负面模型。PPI部分从流行病学关联转到口腔化易位、多样性下降和近期化疗修饰，并用H2B对照提出降级建议。饮食和生活方式部分区分食物基质、定义菌株补充剂和非标准化益生菌，避免把益生菌统一写成有益或有害。所有推断都要标注观察性证据和适应症偏倚，不能把药物暴露与疗效下降直接写成菌群因果链。\\n\\nCh5 — 微生物干预策略的临床转化现状\\n本章是主动干预的临床转化主轴。顺序为：初治人群信号 → 耐药人群边界 → 定义菌群和活体生物药 → 安全性边界 → 证据等级与标准化。FMT-LUMINate的疗效与\\\"有害菌丢失而非供体定植\\\"机制在此主讲；MIMic的定植动力学和生存数据也在此展开；MITRIC主讲阴性原因。Ch1的证据阶梯表只作为入口，本章不重复列表式介绍，而解释异质性来源。关于mRCC中FMT联合ICI的随机证据：细纲原将TACITO数据归于P0593，但P0593实际内容为别嘌醇/肌苷机制研究，不包含TACITO试验数据。本章mRCC FMT随机证据应引用P0090系统综述中汇总的Phase II RCT数据：FMT联合pembrolizumab+axitinib，1年PFS 66.7% vs 35.0%（p=0.036），ORR 54% vs 28%，未增加≥3级不良事件。此数据来自会议摘要级别的II期RCT，应标注证据等级为早期随机、小样本。不得在正文中引用不存在的TACITO具体数值（如12个月PFS 70% vs 41%、中位PFS 24.0 vs 9.0个月、P=0.053），除非后续获得独立来源确认。安全性部分与Ch6分工：本章保留干预安全边界和试验设计含义，毒性预测、耦合或解耦和管理策略留给Ch6。\\n\\nCh6 — 微生物组与免疫治疗毒性的关联\\n本章从毒性表型出发，不按药物列表。顺序为：结肠炎最强证据与因果验证 → 器官特异性和预测模型困境 → 疗效与毒性耦合或解耦 → 干预相关毒性的情境依赖 → 分子机制。Ch5已讲干预疗效与总体安全边界，本章新增的是毒性预测标志物、供体-方案交互和管理含义。FMT-LUMINate的Cluster B、Prevotella和Segatella copri数据在此主讲毒性情境，不再重述完整试验设计；P0284的屏障和代谢双重机制只保留与毒性相关的部分，详细机制回指Ch2。非结肠炎毒性必须明确样本量不足，不能把结肠炎结论外推到心肌炎或神经毒性。\\n\\nCh7 — 方法学挑战与未来研究方向\\n本章不是再次总结各章局限，而是把瓶颈转为可操作设计原则。顺序为：技术与标准化 → 观察性因果推断 → 临床证据与人群表征 → 未来方法。技术部分用标准化重分析和培养组学说明噪音与真实信号并存；因果部分强调反向因果、药物、饮食、年龄等混杂和孟德尔随机化边界；临床部分强调Phase III缺席、年龄、儿科、种族和TME浓度缺口；未来部分提出功能导向、多组学、AI、类器官或芯片和供体制剂标准化。引用应服务设计原则，不重复前文具体数值，也不把每个已知缺口写成全文唯一主线。\",\n  \"chapter_assignment\": {\n    \"chapter_id\": \"Ch6\",\n    \"title\": \"微生物组与免疫治疗毒性的关联\",\n    \"writing_arrangement\": \"本章从毒性表型出发，不按药物列表。顺序为：结肠炎最强证据与因果验证 → 器官特异性和预测模型困境 → 疗效与毒性耦合或解耦 → 干预相关毒性的情境依赖 → 分子机制。Ch5已讲干预疗效与总体安全边界，本章新增的是毒性预测标志物、供体-方案交互和管理含义。FMT-LUMINate的Cluster B、Prevotella和Segatella copri数据在此主讲毒性情境，不再重述完整试验设计；P0284的屏障和代谢双重机制只保留与毒性相关的部分，详细机制回指Ch2。非结肠炎毒性必须明确样本量不足，不能把结肠炎结论外推到心肌炎或神经毒性。\",\n    \"required_content\": [\n      \"保留结肠炎微生物指纹和动物FMT因果证据，包括产丁酸菌下降、肠球菌富集或类似表型。\",\n      \"保留非结肠炎irAEs样本量不足、多重检验校正后不稳定和模型泛化受限。\",\n      \"保留疗效与毒性耦合的例子，如Akkermansia muciniphila与疗效和irAE风险并存。\",\n      \"保留疗效与毒性解耦的例子，如Eubacterium siraeum或SCFA产生菌与有效且低毒性状态的关联。\",\n      \"保留供体聚类与ICI方案交互表，明确Prevotella富集Cluster B与双ICI背景下严重毒性的关联。\",\n      \"保留屏障受损、代谢物失衡、分子模拟、MyD88和TNF/TNFR2等机制，同时标注多数机制来自模型或体外证据。\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"materials\": {\n    \"schema_version\": \"optomind.guided_body_materials.v1\",\n    \"evidence_atoms\": [\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::dc0a2ccc128ec1b70b351ed9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"abstract\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7b4744c7ad19ef68380c907c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0650dc0b918fba639db74764\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用“临床观察+动物因果验证”的两阶段设计。第一阶段为横断面观察：收集32例irAE患者粪便，通过16S rDNA测序分析菌群组成（PCoA, LEfSe）及功能预测，对比结肠炎型（n=8）与非结肠炎型（n=24）患者的差异。第二阶段为体内因果实验：建立抗生素清除小鼠肠道菌群模型，分别移植结肠炎型和非结肠炎型患者的粪便菌群，随后给予双免疫检查点阻断（抗PD-1 + 抗CTLA-4）治疗，监测小鼠体重、疾病活动指数（DAI）、组织学评分及免疫细胞浸润情况，以评估供体菌群对受体结肠炎发生的影响。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::66d76f5eb5b3514b53450f1c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了ICIs相关结肠炎患者与健康对照（非结肠炎irAE）之间肠道菌群特征的详细图谱，识别出特定的风险菌群标志物（如低拟杆菌/双歧杆菌，高肠球菌）和功能改变（产丁酸菌减少）。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给摘要未交代人类队列的基线特征匹配情况、测序深度细节及多重检验校正方法；小鼠实验仅报告了部分死亡个体的极端数据，未提供所有个体的完整分布统计，且样本量较小（每组9只），可能限制结果的稳健性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1f06e9ea92ea153bace4387c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"通过FMT实验在动物模型中建立了肠道菌群与ICIs诱导结肠炎之间的因果联系，表明特定的人类菌群具有致结肠炎潜力。\",\n          \"limits\": \"动物模型无法完全模拟人类复杂的免疫系统和肿瘤微环境；FMT实验仅使用了单一时间点的供体菌群，未考虑菌群动态变化；摘要未说明是否排除了其他宿主因素（如基因背景、饮食）对结果的干扰。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::768a0afe5a7442dbc6d309fa\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"人类队列比较：8例结肠炎型irAE vs 24例非结肠炎型irAE患者\",\n          \"finding\": \"菌群组成存在显著差异（Adonis P=0.003）。结肠炎型患者中拟杆菌门（Bacteroidota）和双歧杆菌属（Bifidobacterium）丰度较低，而变形菌门（Proteobacteria）和肠球菌属（Enterococcus）丰度较高。主要产丁酸菌总丰度在结肠炎型患者中显著降低（P=0.018）。功能预测显示环境信息处理、遗传信息处理及代谢通路存在差异。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bff31da88cca7e46ed16f5f7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"小鼠FMT实验：抗生素预处理小鼠接受结肠炎型（Colitic-irAE-FMT）或非结肠炎型（Non-irAE-FMT）患者菌群移植，随后联合抗PD-1/抗CTLA-4治疗\",\n          \"finding\": \"9只Colitic-irAE-FMT小鼠中有3只发展为致命性严重结肠炎，而9只Non-irAE-FMT小鼠全部存活且无结肠炎（P=0.052）。死亡小鼠表现出更快的体重下降和更高的DAI评分。组织学评分显示，死亡小鼠（14分）显著高于非结肠炎组（3.89 ± 1.17）和存活结肠炎组（3.67 ± 1.03）。免疫组化显示死亡小鼠CD8+、CD4+和CD20+细胞浸润较高，支持免疫介导的结肠炎发生。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fd96b7055d5fee07ab697ea2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0cb9249a1bedc5d665819a64\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管已知肠道微生物群影响ICIs的疗效，但其如何影响免疫相关不良事件（irAEs），特别是ICIs相关结肠炎的发生机制尚不清楚。本研究试图明确肠道微生物组与ICIs相关结肠炎之间的关联性及因果联系。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::794e1f1d3aff4d81c94882d9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"研究对象为接受抗PD-1治疗的晚期恶性肿瘤患者及其衍生模型。研究聚焦于免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）引发的免疫相关不良事件（irAEs），具体限定在结肠炎型irAE（colitic irAE）与非结肠炎型irAE之间的差异，以及肠道微生物组在其中的作用。样本包括32例人类粪便样本和通过粪菌移植（FMT）构建的小鼠模型。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::23279ff6e33de3360f4f34ab\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在探索肠道微生物组与ICIs相关结肠炎之间的关联及因果关系。研究首先收集了32名在接受抗PD-1治疗后出现irAE的晚期肿瘤患者的粪便样本，利用Illumina MiSeq平台进行16S rDNA扩增子测序。通过比较8名结肠炎型irAE患者与24名非结肠炎型irAE患者的菌群特征，发现两者在门、属水平及功能通路上的显著差异。随后，研究将来自结肠炎型和非结肠炎型患者的粪便样本分别移植给抗生素处理过的小鼠，并联合使用抗PD-1和抗CTLA-4抗体进行治疗。结果显示，接受结肠炎型患者菌群移植的小鼠出现了严重的致死性结肠炎，而非结肠炎型患者菌群移植的小鼠均存活且无结肠炎症状，从而在动物模型中验证了特定肠道菌群对ICIs相关结肠炎的致病潜力。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fd8e86eda99541c73ae9e6c6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅针对结肠炎这一特定irAE类型，不直接回答菌群对肿瘤缩小（efficacy）的直接调节机制，需结合其他研究综合判断。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了肠道菌群失调与ICIs疗效/安全性关联的具体表型证据。指出结肠炎型患者特有的菌群特征（低拟杆菌/双歧杆菌，高肠球菌），可作为评估ICIs治疗风险的生物标志物参考。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::06c366e630e21e39d4a70148\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"机制推断基于功能预测和表型观察，未直接验证具体分子通路（如丁酸受体信号或特定炎症因子轴），属于假设性机制，需与其他机制研究相互印证。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了菌群介导ICIs相关结肠炎的因果机制线索。通过FMT实验证明特定菌群可直接导致结肠炎，并提示产丁酸菌减少和代谢通路改变可能是潜在机制。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7a6cd00af868b9c5e36a2921\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"明确了肠道微生物组不仅是ICIs疗效的影响因素，也是irAEs（特别是结肠炎）的关键驱动因素，拓展了对ICIs副作用机制的理解。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7a5d958d2312aac42bf92dae\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"展示了从人类观察到动物因果验证的研究范式，以及特定菌群（如肠球菌）在病理状态下的正向作用与保护性菌群（如拟杆菌）负向作用的对比。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f6cf5ac2e26a12b4f9c3e387\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究聚焦于结肠炎型irAE，其发现的菌群特征可能不适用于其他类型的irAEs（如肺炎、肝炎等）。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c2e07bb62ea1771f63f9503b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"小鼠FMT实验中的致死性结肠炎是极端表型，不代表所有接受结肠炎型菌群移植的患者都会发病，需谨慎外推至临床风险预测。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c3bf71e8312f13b2c658b804\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"功能预测基于16S rDNA数据，分辨率有限，实际机制需宏基因组或代谢组学进一步验证。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f00adc5887ecf0a203fed018\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"identity\",\n              \"reason\": \"source identity was not independently verified\",\n              \"status\": \"input_attributed\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"no complete research body was indexed\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"local source was absent or unreadable\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"abstract_only\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::293eb3790a6ab7b71a0f7938\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ac4a925240c145b25c1cbb1a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7b5fdca1762c4a1844c7341f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用混合研究设计：1. 临床观察性研究：前瞻性收集93份来自37名抗PD-1治疗肺癌患者的粪便样本，以及61份来自33名发生irAEs的多癌种患者样本。使用16S rDNA扩增子测序进行微生物组分析，计算α/β多样性，使用LEfSe识别差异菌属，并通过随机森林算法构建irAE预测模型。2. 动物因果验证：将C57BL/6小鼠经抗生素鸡尾酒处理清除原有菌群后，分别移植来自有结肠炎型irAE患者和无irAE患者的粪便菌群。随后给予抗PD-1和抗CTLA-4单抗诱导免疫反应，评估结肠炎发生率、疾病活动指数、组织病理学及炎症因子表达。3. 功能机制推测：基于16S数据使用Tax4fun和KEGG数据库预测微生物功能通路，重点关注短链脂肪酸（如丁酸）产生菌丰度及代谢途径差异。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::56a251bb4bf2e70d9046ac70\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了在非黑色素瘤实体瘤（主要是肺癌）背景下，肠道微生物群与irAEs发生的关联证据；区分了结肠炎型与非结肠炎型irAEs的微生物特征差异；通过人源化小鼠FMT实验提供了微生物群导致免疫性结肠炎的因果证据；识别出丁酸产生菌丰度降低可能与irAEs发生有关。\",\n          \"limits\": \"样本量较小（最终纳入分析的无irAE组34人，irAE组32人），可能导致统计效力不足或过拟合风险；仅使用16S rDNA测序进行功能预测，缺乏宏基因组或代谢组学的直接验证；基线前ICI治疗前的粪便样本获取困难，限制了基线状态的全面分析；无法完全排除irAEs本身对微生物群的扰动影响（尽管FMT支持因果方向）；预测模型需外部独立队列验证。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::370e1997ec04811460303373\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"抗PD-1治疗后出现irAEs的患者 vs 未出现irAEs的患者\",\n          \"finding\": \"微生物组成显著不同（P=0.001）。irAE患者中双歧杆菌（Bifidobacterium）、粪杆菌属（Faecalibacterium）和阿加索细菌属（Agathobacter）丰度较低，而红球菌属（Erysipelatoclostridium）丰度较高。主要丁酸产生菌总丰度在irAE患者中更低（P=0.007）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f62b887d1b251fb36e63bda9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"结肠炎型irAE患者 vs 非结肠炎型irAE患者\",\n          \"finding\": \"微生物组成显著不同（P=0.003）。结肠炎型患者中拟杆菌属（Bacteroides）和双歧杆菌丰度较低，肠球菌属（Enterococcus）丰度较高。主要丁酸产生菌丰度也较低（P=0.018）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5d30a37ab62a73ee8b4c7454\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"小鼠FMT实验（结肠炎型irAE供体 vs 无irAE供体）+ 抗PD-1/CTLA-4治疗\",\n          \"finding\": \"结肠炎型irAE-FMT组小鼠中3/9发展为致命性严重结肠炎，而非irAE-FMT组0/9发病。结肠炎小鼠表现为体重下降更快、DAI评分更高、结肠缩短、组织损伤更重，且结肠组织中Il6和Tnf mRNA水平升高。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::10c3dff98fb8682a1dccf79f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"irAE预测模型构建\",\n          \"finding\": \"基于10个主要差异菌属（以Gemella, Dubosiella, Atopobium为主）的随机森林模型在训练集AUC为86.4%，测试集AUC为91.7%。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3ae97f7b7005bd50f7ba304f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::684b173aec03df76f4198b59\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管已知肠道微生物群影响ICI疗效，但其作为irAEs发生和严重程度的角色及其因果关系尚未确立。特别是针对除黑色素瘤以外的其他癌症类型（如肺癌），以及不同器官受累的irAEs，微生物群的差异特征和作用机制尚不明确。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5f0274b3487f40b29fe60c92\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"研究对象为接受抗PD-1治疗的晚期胸廓恶性肿瘤（主要为肺癌）患者，以及发生免疫相关不良反应（irAEs）的多种实体瘤患者。研究情境包括临床队列观察和基于人类粪便微生物移植（FMT）的小鼠实验。范围涵盖不同严重程度和器官类型的irAEs，重点聚焦于结肠炎型irAEs。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f157d433e5f5ba636b80c1ac\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在探讨肠道微生物群与免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗引发的免疫相关不良反应（irAEs）之间的关联及因果关系。研究首先通过16S rDNA测序分析了接受抗PD-1治疗的肺癌患者及发生irAEs的其他癌症患者的粪便样本，比较了有无irAEs、不同严重程度（1-2级 vs 3-4级）以及不同部位（结肠炎型 vs 非结肠炎型）患者间的微生物组成差异，并构建了预测模型。随后，通过抗生素预处理小鼠并进行来自不同患者组的FMT，结合抗PD-1/CTLA-4抗体治疗，验证微生物群对免疫性结肠炎的因果作用。最后，利用功能预测分析探讨了潜在的代谢机制。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d89e4d7c6b3d84ae3a62e9b4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"样本局限于晚期胸廓肿瘤和多癌种irAE患者，结果可能不适用于所有ICI药物（如抗CTLA-4单药）或早期癌症人群。预测模型未经外部验证。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了肠道微生物群组成与ICI治疗安全性（irAEs发生）的直接关联数据。具体显示irAE患者中特定有益菌（双歧杆菌、粪杆菌、阿加索细菌）减少，有害菌（红球菌属）增加。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::65232b9dd11887f7c3c947ee\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"小鼠模型使用了抗生素预处理和联合抗体治疗，与人体的生理状态存在差异。功能分析仅为基于16S的预测，非直接代谢物测量。并非所有接受FMT的小鼠都发病，表明其他宿主因素也参与。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"通过FMT小鼠实验证明了来自irAE患者的微生物群能够因果性地诱导免疫性结肠炎。同时指出丁酸产生菌丰度降低和特定代谢通路（如氨基酸、维生素代谢）的差异，提示代谢机制可能在介导irAEs中起作用。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::57b8483e9f9cd672d266dba2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"论文引言部分回顾了微生物群在ICI疗效中的作用，并指出目前研究多集中于黑色素瘤，强调本研究扩展至肺癌等其他实体瘤的重要性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::97d2a1c8337589808f154b48\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"论文讨论了Faecalibacterium在不同研究中的矛盾结果（有的报道保护，有的报道促炎），并归因于情境依赖性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8a0a5e2ac2060afd26a3d218\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究的因果证据仅限于小鼠模型中的结肠炎表型，不能直接外推至人体所有irAEs的发生机制。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f23786cce1eeced11074defa\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"预测模型的AUC值基于内部验证，可能存在过拟合，实际临床应用价值需进一步确认。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::821df0a3c6305c95bb399a78\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"功能预测基于16S数据，准确性低于宏基因组测序，代谢通路的差异仅为推测，需代谢组学验证。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::68071cd7d3b466b520eab039\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"样本量较小，特别是严重irAEs亚组分析可能缺乏统计效力。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::43b7ecec9c980646e0f0b9dc\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"supplement_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"auxiliary_material\": \"研究建立了 irAE 预测模型（训练集 AUC 86.4%，测试集 91.7%），但该模型针对的是广义 irAE 发生，未针对特定器官毒性进行验证。小鼠 FMT 实验证实了来自结肠炎 irAE 患者的微生物群可因果性诱导小鼠免疫性结肠炎，但未涉及非结肠炎表型的因果验证。功能预测显示丁酸产生菌在 irAE 患者中丰度降低，提示代谢机制可能参与，但这基于 16S 预测而非直接代谢组测量。\",\n          \"evidence\": [],\n          \"gap_id\": \"Ch6_gap_5\",\n          \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\body_full_staged_acceptance_20261004_40cny\\\\planning\\\\chapters\\\\external\\\\N4452dfb25f491e9335fe-5a6b848383c152a3\\\\round_1\\\\supplements\\\\Ch6_gap_5\\\\attempt-fc662a0y\\\\source_units\\\\SU03_search_candidate_cef6ae84bc\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n          \"limitations\": [],\n          \"material_ready\": true,\n          \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n          \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n          \"remaining_gap\": \"目前仍缺乏针对特定非结肠炎 irAEs（如心肌炎、神经毒性）的大规模微生物组关联研究。现有研究（包括本研究）通常将非结肠炎 irAEs 合并分析，或因特定类型病例数过少（如本研究仅 3 例心肌炎）而无法得出具有统计效力的结论，无法充分验证或解决 P0051 和 P0530 中提到的证据不足问题。\",\n          \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n          \"status\": \"unmet\",\n          \"useful_material\": \"该研究纳入了 32 名发生 irAEs 的患者进行微生物组分析，其中非结肠炎 irAEs 被归为一组进行分析。在具体 irAE 类型分布中，38 例 irAE 事件包含 3 例心肌炎（myocarditis），但未对心肌炎或神经毒性等特定非结肠炎类型进行独立的微生物组关联分析。作者在讨论部分明确指出，由于样本量相对较小且 irAE 发生率总体较低，亚组分析（如比较不同类型 irAE 患者的微生物组）可能缺乏统计效力或无法进行（'subgroup analyses may have lacked statistical power or were not possible, for instance for comparing the microbiota of patients with different types of irAE'）。该研究证实了结肠炎与非结肠炎 irAEs 之间的微生物组存在整体差异，但未能提供针对特定非结肠炎 irAEs（如心肌炎）的大规模独立数据。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0ae65bd0a736c1c537cf2b1c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"supplement_materials\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": [\n          {\n            \"auxiliary_material\": \"研究建立了 irAE 预测模型（训练集 AUC 86.4%，测试集 91.7%），但该模型针对的是广义 irAE 发生，未针对特定器官毒性进行验证。小鼠 FMT 实验证实了来自结肠炎 irAE 患者的微生物群可因果性诱导小鼠免疫性结肠炎，但未涉及非结肠炎表型的因果验证。功能预测显示丁酸产生菌在 irAE 患者中丰度降低，提示代谢机制可能参与，但这基于 16S 预测而非直接代谢组测量。\",\n            \"evidence\": [],\n            \"gap_id\": \"Ch6_gap_5\",\n            \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\body_full_staged_acceptance_20261004_40cny\\\\planning\\\\chapters\\\\external\\\\N4452dfb25f491e9335fe-5a6b848383c152a3\\\\round_1\\\\supplements\\\\Ch6_gap_5\\\\attempt-fc662a0y\\\\source_units\\\\SU03_search_candidate_cef6ae84bc\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n            \"limitations\": [],\n            \"material_ready\": true,\n            \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n            \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"remaining_gap\": \"目前仍缺乏针对特定非结肠炎 irAEs（如心肌炎、神经毒性）的大规模微生物组关联研究。现有研究（包括本研究）通常将非结肠炎 irAEs 合并分析，或因特定类型病例数过少（如本研究仅 3 例心肌炎）而无法得出具有统计效力的结论，无法充分验证或解决 P0051 和 P0530 中提到的证据不足问题。\",\n            \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"status\": \"unmet\",\n            \"useful_material\": \"该研究纳入了 32 名发生 irAEs 的患者进行微生物组分析，其中非结肠炎 irAEs 被归为一组进行分析。在具体 irAE 类型分布中，38 例 irAE 事件包含 3 例心肌炎（myocarditis），但未对心肌炎或神经毒性等特定非结肠炎类型进行独立的微生物组关联分析。作者在讨论部分明确指出，由于样本量相对较小且 irAE 发生率总体较低，亚组分析（如比较不同类型 irAE 患者的微生物组）可能缺乏统计效力或无法进行（'subgroup analyses may have lacked statistical power or were not possible, for instance for comparing the microbiota of patients with different types of irAE'）。该研究证实了结肠炎与非结肠炎 irAEs 之间的微生物组存在整体差异，但未能提供针对特定非结肠炎 irAEs（如心肌炎）的大规模独立数据。\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::41536b078798585a9f6cf46f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::73a2d408717e6398f3fd9093\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e39394a998d94b0e9c10cc2e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::94d50912fa44c41d58ffaf18\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"前瞻性队列研究设计。纳入95例接受PD-1/PD-L1抑制剂（单药或联合CTLA-4抑制剂）治疗的GI癌症患者。收集基线粪便样本进行宏基因组鸟枪法测序。使用MaAsLin2进行差异物种和通路分析，PERMANOVA评估混杂因素，Wilcoxon秩和检验比较组间差异。按irAE严重程度（轻症vs重症）、癌症类型（食管/胃/结肠）及特定器官毒性（皮肤/血液/内分泌/肝脏）进行分层分析。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8e654486045065fb54b27c79\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了胃肠道癌症（食管、胃、结肠）背景下，基线肠道微生物组与irAEs发生及严重程度的具体关联谱，包括特定菌种（如R. callidus, B. xylanisolvens）和代谢通路（尿素循环）。揭示了不同癌症类型和器官特异性毒性具有独特的微生物特征。\",\n          \"limits\": \"样本量较小（n=95），缺乏外部验证队列。未进行因果机制的实验验证（如动物模型或体外实验）。结果主要基于相关性分析，无法确立因果关系。不同癌症类型的异质性可能导致微生物标志物的特异性较强，通用性受限。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::53bef823014e951415c37a47\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"所有GI癌症患者总体比较（有vs无irAEs）\",\n          \"finding\": \"整体α和β多样性无显著差异。Clostridium hathewayi, Ruminococcus torques等富集于无irAEs组；Bifidobacterium dentium, Rothia mucilaginosa等富集于irAEs组。尿素循环（PWY-4984）和瓜氨酸生物合成通路富集于无irAEs组。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d43d4aced5ec8f4e8c1052fe\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"irAEs严重程度比较（轻症Grade 1-2 vs 重症Grade ≥3）\",\n          \"finding\": \"Ruminococcus callidus和Bacteroides xylanisolvens在无重症irAEs患者中显著富集，有助于区分重症人群。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0e0d6cd2fb9007d7666a16f8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"不同癌症类型分层\",\n          \"finding\": \"食管癌：R. torques富集于无irAEs组，Dialister invisus富集于高irAE组；谷氨酰胺生物合成通路在高irAE组富集。胃癌：乳酸杆菌科、双歧杆菌科等益生菌及丁酸产生菌富集于无/低irAE组。结肠癌：Bacteroides stercoris富集于高irAE组；精氨酸生物合成通路在低irAE组富集。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f913c3f2f3b926febe78b1c5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"特定器官毒性比较\",\n          \"finding\": \"皮肤毒性：甘油降解和尿素循环通路富集于无皮肤irAEs组。血液毒性：尿素循环和瓜氨酸生物合成通路富集于无血液irAEs组。内分泌毒性：肠铁菌素生物合成通路富集于无内分泌irAEs组。肝脏毒性：尿素循环和瓜氨酸生物合成通路富集于无肝毒性irAEs组。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f85690019a26dd19cc3fcb35\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c965085c365ae58f031b3902\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"探究肠道微生物组是否以及如何与胃肠道癌症患者接受免疫检查点抑制剂治疗后发生的免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）相关联，识别潜在的预测性生物标志物和代谢机制。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::addc034e2e5b3e12e9cdb012\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"95例接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的晚期/不可切除胃肠道癌症（食管癌、胃癌、结直肠癌）患者；基线粪便样本宏基因组测序；分析肠道微生物组与免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）的关联。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::af989328995494c8922ca744\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究是一项前瞻性观察研究，旨在探讨肠道微生物组与胃肠道癌症患者接受免疫治疗引发的免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）之间的关联。研究纳入了95名完成基线粪便采样且仅接受单一或联合PD-1/PD-L1抑制剂治疗的患者，通过宏基因组测序分析其基线微生物组成及代谢通路。结果显示，整体微生物多样性在有无irAEs患者间无显著差异，但特定菌种和代谢通路存在差异：Ruminococcus callidus和Bacteroides xylanisolvens在无严重irAEs患者中富集，而某些致病菌或条件致病菌在irAEs患者中升高。此外，尿素循环及相关氨基酸合成通路与irAEs发生有关，且不同癌症类型和特定器官毒性（如皮肤、血液、内分泌、肝脏）表现出不同的微生物特征。该研究为理解irAEs的微生物机制提供了基础数据，但缺乏外部验证队列和实验验证。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e386fd22d8c544b9c1efcca4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅限于相关性，不能证明因果。样本来自单一中心，可能存在选择偏倚。未涵盖所有类型的固体瘤。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了胃肠道癌症患者中，基线微生物组成与irAEs发生风险的关联证据。具体指出Ruminococcus callidus和Bacteroides xylanisolvens的富集与较低的重症irAEs风险相关，而某些细菌（如B. dentium, R. mucilaginosa）的升高与irAEs发生相关。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4f793f32a90597b4a0d249f5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"代谢通路的富集是观察性结果，作者承认缺乏实验验证来确认这些通路直接导致或保护免受irAEs。引用的机制多来自其他疾病模型或癌种，需注明外推的不确定性。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提出了微生物代谢功能可能介导irAEs的线索。发现尿素循环（urea cycle）及瓜氨酸/精氨酸生物合成通路在无irAEs或低毒性患者中富集。讨论了精氨酸代谢在免疫调节中的潜在作用，并引用了其他研究中益生菌（如乳酸杆菌、双歧杆菌）通过调节Treg细胞或IL-10缓解炎症的机制。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5aee41876112ff2a057ab15f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"研究发现不同癌症类型（食管、胃、结肠）的irAEs具有截然不同的微生物特征。例如，胃癌中益生菌（乳酸杆菌、双歧杆菌）富集与低毒性相关，而结肠癌中Bacteroides stercoris与高毒性相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2f42765cef9e604f49119b34\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"作者指出既往黑色素瘤研究中发现的多样性降低现象在本研究中未观察到，并推测可能与测序方法、队列特征或治疗方案差异有关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::53e25ff0f999e6004f67b148\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究仅涉及胃肠道癌症，其发现的微生物标志物（如R. callidus的保护作用）可能不适用于黑色素瘤、肺癌等其他实体瘤，需谨慎外推。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ad9eb949fb4daac44d9fc828\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"所有发现均为基线微生物组与irAEs的相关性，未建立因果链条。代谢通路的结论仅为假设，需实验验证。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::76c9481a976505f7c9ecab68\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"样本量有限（n=95），且排除了联合抗生素治疗或未能提供基线样本的患者，可能存在选择偏倚。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e3a1705b198b0cca49beb1c6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"irAEs的定义和分级依据CTCAE v4.03，需注意与其他研究使用的标准可能存在的细微差异。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::674c199cb19bd8a62ce5a60b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-4dcc7c19ae5301df5638\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-5c752c0f8036d5742e42\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-76494e52e6aac1a4278f\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-a7194a689f46f19f0fc9\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-5f82ba52a99d38e52a55\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"assets\",\n              \"reason\": \"supplementaryFiles_fetch_transport_TimeoutError\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::35edca5bdc58a12eb6042045\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bcfeb64c2b546944ce14831a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::873653225ac3d94f9fee6560\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用多阶段混合方法：1) 数据整合与预处理：从公共数据库提取7项研究的16S数据，结合内部收集的16S和宏基因组数据；使用MMUPHin算法对“研究”这一主要混杂因素进行批次校正。2) 差异分析与特征筛选：使用阻塞Wilcoxon秩和检验识别差异物种，排除与疗效（response）重叠的特征，保留irAEs特异性特征。3) 机器学习建模：使用随机森林（Random Forest）算法，通过迭代特征消除（IFE）优化，筛选出最具判别力的14个微生物特征构建RF14分类器。4) 模型评估：通过分层十折交叉验证、留一法验证（LOSO）及两个独立外部队列（SH和JS队列）评估模型性能（AUC、敏感性、特异性等）。5) 机制探索：利用PICRUSt2预测功能，结合宏基因组数据验证关键基因（menH, menC）表达，并通过qRT-PCR和HPLC-MS/MS定量粪便样本中的基因丰度和血清中的甲萘醌水平；最后结合结肠组织转录组数据进行GSEA分析以推断炎症通路机制。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::24339fdba7a3beeae5bb9d0b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了一个经过严格外部验证的、基于14种微生物的irAEs预测模型（RF14），解决了既往研究结果不一致的问题，并指出了特定微生物（如乳酸杆菌）作为潜在生物标志物的价值。\",\n          \"limits\": \"机制部分主要基于观察性数据的关联分析和文献推导，缺乏直接的体内或体外实验证实甲萘醌对irAEs的具体因果作用；样本量虽经整合但仍有限，且未完全控制所有临床混杂因素（如抗生素使用细节、具体肿瘤类型差异等）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6e3aea46111b008f2e807480\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"整合3项大规模anti-PD-1/PD-L1队列（n=190）进行训练\",\n          \"finding\": \"识别出14种微生物特征构成的RF14分类器，区分irAEs与非irAEs的平均AUC为0.88；其中Lactobacillus salivarius为排名最高的生物标志物。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0c8da7cfe4b7d6b35e1263aa\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"两个独立外部队列验证（SH队列N=65，JS队列N=50）\",\n          \"finding\": \"RF14分类器在两个独立队列中均显示出显著的判别能力，证明了模型的跨队列泛化性和稳健性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::df9a4cb408e8af81702d5567\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"功能分析与代谢物检测\",\n          \"finding\": \"非irAEs患者肠道微生物中甲萘醌（Menaquinone/Vitamin K2）生物合成途径显著富集，关键限速酶menH和menC表达升高；血清中甲萘醌水平在非irAEs患者中显著高于irAEs患者。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b1e8085158f4858a558996ef\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"机制推断（结合转录组数据）\",\n          \"finding\": \"低RF评分（高风险irAEs）组患者结肠组织中促炎通路（如NF-κB信号通路）显著激活；文献支持甲萘醌可抑制NF-κB通路，提示微生物来源的甲萘醌可能通过抗炎机制保护宿主免受irAEs损伤。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cf3ef56f614496fc53563362\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f284a3f55120c4d9be9d82b8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管已知肠道微生物组影响ICIs引发的irAEs，但不同研究报道的微生物关联存在不一致性，缺乏高鲁棒性的预测生物标志物及明确的机制解释。本研究试图回答：能否从整合数据中识别出稳定预测anti-PD-1/PD-L1治疗相关irAEs的微生物特征？这些微生物特征背后的功能机制是什么？\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9f268b67ab84227a5bde91fa\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"接受抗PD-1/PD-L1免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）治疗的实体瘤患者；研究聚焦于基线肠道微生物组与免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）发生风险之间的关联，以及潜在的代谢机制。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6a632fec1bedc7f321c9802b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在解决现有研究中肠道微生物组与irAEs关联不一致的问题，通过整合公开数据与内部队列，构建基于机器学习的微生物预测模型并探索其生物学机制。研究团队收集了来自7项已发表研究的317名患者的16S rRNA测序数据，以及来自上海和徐州两家医院的115名患者的内部队列数据（包括16S和宏基因组）。首先，通过元分析校正“研究”带来的批次效应，识别出区分irAEs与非irAEs的特异性微生物特征。随后，利用随机森林算法筛选出14种关键微生物物种，构建了RF14分类器，在训练集上达到0.88的AUC，并在两个独立外部队列中验证了其稳健性。此外，研究结合转录组与宏基因组数据，发现非irAEs患者肠道中维生素K2（甲萘醌/menaquinone）的生物合成途径及关键酶（menH, menC）表达显著升高，且血清中甲萘醌水平更高。机制推测表明，微生物来源的甲萘醌可能通过抑制NF-κB等促炎信号通路来减轻irAEs的发生。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3f5d7b9532842831db5ba214\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"该模型主要针对anti-PD-1/PD-L1治疗，对于anti-CTLA-4或其他联合疗法的适用性需参考文中提到的其他数据集或保持谨慎外推。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了基于14种微生物特征的irAEs预测模型（RF14），显示非irAEs患者中特定菌属（如Lactobacillus, Parabacteroides）富集。这直接回应了微生物组如何影响ICIs安全性（毒性）的问题，表明特定的微生物组成可以作为风险分层工具。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bac4dadcab9216e74454e8af\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"机制证据主要为相关性（微生物丰度、基因表达、血清代谢物与临床表型的关联）和文献支持的通路推断，尚未通过干预实验确证因果关系。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"揭示了微生物组影响irAEs的潜在机制：非irAEs患者中甲萘醌（Vitamin K2）生物合成增强，且血清中甲萘醌水平更高；关联分析提示甲萘醌可能通过抑制NF-κB促炎通路发挥作用。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3571b0e723fd78824b65d9db\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"文中指出既往研究因样本量小、治疗策略差异导致微生物关联结果不一致，本研究通过大样本整合和批次校正解决了这一问题。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5a8fd506671133aadd947532\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"文中提到irAEs患者往往有更好的生存获益，因此预防irAEs而不影响疗效是临床难题；提出补充甲萘醌可能是一种选择性治疗策略。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::eeb73bd49837d90afbda3f95\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究重点在于irAEs（毒性）而非肿瘤疗效（efficacy），虽然提到了排除与疗效重叠的特征，但其核心贡献是预测毒性风险。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::89ee0ec6e1e7c0f00b3e09fd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"机制部分（甲萘醌-NF-κB）是基于观察性数据和文献引用的推断，不能直接视为已证实的因果机制，需在综述中明确其假设性质。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5bb58ef19cd0981fada89e44\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"模型验证使用了独立的16S和宏基因组队列，但未包含所有类型的ICI药物（如单药抗CTLA-4仅用于初步比较，模型主要针对PD-1/PD-L1）。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3d73946efd2865bc1e459d0a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::aaf98f91add3d9c5573cff59\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"structured_partial\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::95fe68848db0177e2d9044c2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6448e9e5b0208bc6be940ba3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"作为一篇综述，本研究采用文献综述的方法，对已发表的关于ICIs诱导的irAEs预测生物标志物的研究进行系统性整理和归纳。具体路线包括：1. 将潜在生物标志物按类别进行分类（血液细胞计数/表面标记、血清蛋白、自身抗体、细胞因子/趋化因子、遗传变异/基因表达、HLA基因型、microRNAs、肠道微生物组及其他如BMI）。2. 针对每一类，提取并总结代表性研究的设计类型（回顾性或前瞻性）、样本量、肿瘤类型、具体的生物标志物指标、观察到的关联方向（正相关或负相关）以及统计学显著性。3. 对比不同研究间结果的异同，特别关注矛盾发现。4. 综合讨论各类标志物的临床可行性、特异性问题（如受癌症本身炎症影响）及机制解释。5. 基于现有证据的整体质量，评估其向临床转化所需的条件（如需要更多前瞻性验证）。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::eb2b8fbc4af35b9b2c9ca1f2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了关于ICIs诱导irAEs预测生物标志物的全面分类综述，涵盖了从常规实验室检测到前沿分子特征的广泛领域。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给摘要未交代具体的文献检索策略、纳入排除标准及偏倚风险评估方法，仅呈现了作者的归纳观点。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::05791142a284303824abe255\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"明确指出了当前生物标志物研究的主要局限性：结果不一致、缺乏特异性（受肿瘤炎症干扰）、多为回顾性研究、以及缺乏临床实用性的验证。\",\n          \"limits\": \"作为综述，其结论依赖于所引用的原始研究的质量和设计，无法提供新的实证数据。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ac0eba0a8b72df7ef1d376ab\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提出了生物标志物可能同时预测irAE风险和抗肿瘤疗效的假设，为未来研究方向提供了思路。\",\n          \"limits\": \"该假设尚需更多研究证实，目前仅是基于个别研究的推测。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9c2ff752cd56f38240a96868\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"血液细胞计数与比率（回顾性为主，多肿瘤类型）\",\n          \"finding\": \"多项回顾性研究显示基线或治疗期间的白细胞、中性粒细胞、淋巴细胞、嗜酸性粒细胞、单核细胞及其比值（如NLR, PLR）与irAEs风险存在关联，但结果高度不一致。例如，部分研究发现低基线淋巴细胞计数预示高风险，而其他研究则发现高计数或治疗后升高与风险相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c55bb20d1969796d60d640a6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"血清蛋白（CRP, LDH, Albumin等）\",\n          \"finding\": \"C反应蛋白（CRP）的研究结果矛盾：有的显示irAE发作时短暂升高，有的显示基线低水平与irAE发生独立相关。其他蛋白如LDH和白蛋白也显示出不一致的结果。器官特异性蛋白（如心肌酶谱、甲状腺激素）在特定irAEs中显示出较好的相关性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9d3d6d15e8c760a46b53e081\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"自身抗体（ANA, 甲状腺抗体等）\",\n          \"finding\": \"基线存在自身抗体（如ANA、抗甲状腺抗体）可能与某些irAEs（如内分泌功能障碍）的风险增加有关，但也有一些研究未发现这种关联，甚至发现基线抗体滴度较低者反而风险更高。自身抗体可能更多反映预先存在的自身免疫倾向而非直接预测新发irAEs。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f4e705878e96a2a175972cf1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"细胞因子/趋化因子（IL-1, IL-6, IL-10, CXCL9等）\",\n          \"finding\": \"多种促炎和抗炎细胞因子与irAEs相关，但方向不一。例如，IL-6基线高水平在某些研究中是风险因素，而在另一项黑色素瘤研究中低风险与高irAE发生率相关。CXCL9/CXCL10等趋化因子在治疗后升高与irAEs发生相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9202f18ba63842bbe31e8043\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"基因变异与表达（SNPs, HLA, miRNAs）\",\n          \"finding\": \"特定基因多态性（如PDCD1, SYK, IL7）和HLA基因型（如HLA-DRB1*11:01与瘙痒，HLA-DQB1*03:01与结肠炎）与特定irAEs风险相关，但不同研究间存在冲突（如HLA-DQB1*03:01对结肠炎的保护或易感作用）。miRNA（如miR-146a）在严重irAEs中表达降低，但研究数量较少。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ad2193d5428b989ee801e640\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"肠道微生物组\",\n          \"finding\": \"肠道菌群组成与irAEs有关联，但结果不一致且难以复现。例如，Agathobacter丰度降低在某些研究中与irAEs相关，而在另一些研究中与更严重的irAEs相关。粪便样本采集困难限制了其广泛应用。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f4ee43ed31aa893dc3ef1d24\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a05eb717b269685717335fe6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"当前ICIs治疗中，由于irAEs的发生具有多样性、不可预测性和严重性，且可能影响治疗连续性和患者生活质量，临床急需有效的预测生物标志物以实现早期识别和干预。然而，现有研究中提出的众多潜在生物标志物结果不一致，且缺乏临床实用性。因此，本研究旨在回答：目前有哪些潜在的生物标志物被提出用于预测irAEs？它们的证据强度如何？存在哪些主要局限性和不一致性？\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::874ec0197cd7611fd1abbf91\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）治疗的癌症患者，重点关注预测和管理免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）的生物标志物。涵盖多种肿瘤类型（如黑色素瘤、非小细胞肺癌、肾细胞癌等），涉及血液学指标、血清蛋白、自身抗体、细胞因子/趋化因子、基因变异、基因表达谱、HLA基因型、microRNAs及肠道微生物组等多个维度的潜在生物标志物。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::647e35c3c5f2baefcc16e580\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本文是一篇综述，旨在系统梳理和评估目前用于预测和管理ICIs治疗期间发生的irAEs的各种潜在生物标志物。文章首先介绍了irAEs的临床背景及其对治疗的影响，随后分类详细讨论了各类生物标志物的研究现状、关联发现及局限性。作者指出，尽管已有大量研究探索了从常规血液检测到复杂分子特征的多种标志物，但由于研究结果的不一致性、缺乏特异性以及多为回顾性研究的局限，目前尚无经过充分验证并可用于常规临床实践的单一或组合生物标志物。文章最后强调了未来需要大规模前瞻性研究来验证这些标志物的效力，并探讨了生物标志物在同时预测irAE风险和抗肿瘤疗效方面的潜力。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c48d388bf7a8a44d386d7518\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"该综述并未深入探讨微生物组调节ICIs疗效的具体分子机制，也未专门聚焦于实体瘤中微生物组与药物疗效的直接因果链条，而是将其置于irAEs预测的 broader context 中。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了肠道微生物组作为irAEs预测生物标志物的现状概述，包括具体菌属（如Agathobacter）与irAEs关联的矛盾发现，以及粪便样本采集的挑战。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e837fdef16698a71a14bf2b4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"不能直接从本综述中提取微生物组调节免疫的具体机制细节，只能获得宏观层面的免疫参与线索。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"虽然没有直接阐述微生物组的机制，但综述中提到的其他生物标志物（如T细胞受体多样性、细胞因子网络、HLA基因型）揭示了宿主免疫系统在irAEs发生中的核心作用。这间接提示，如果微生物组要影响irAEs，很可能也是通过调制宿主免疫反应（如T细胞激活、细胞因子释放）来实现的。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5afddce1617492b7a7f0caf0\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"综述指出目前无确立的生物标志物，原因包括结果不一致、回顾性研究为主、缺乏特异性等。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f6ad7f2c394e73289b4dcfb1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"综述比较了血液检测（简便但特异性低）、分子特征（昂贵但可能更特异）等不同类别标志物的特点。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a6b5a8c48a505a5d0340d2b5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"综述提到irAEs的发生通常与更好的治疗效果相关，且某些生物标志物可能同时预测两者。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e02fc654b2294aa8dd4c70bc\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该综述主要关注irAEs的预测，而非ICIs疗效的直接预测，尽管二者有联系。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a88a24166742d3e4a45d6f52\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"文中关于微生物组的描述较为简略，且强调结果不一致，不应将其视为对微生物组作用的定论。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6d4d646a7541b6b8783730db\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"综述中的许多发现来自回顾性研究，因果推断需谨慎。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3de57eb0f4d3a295576a2da6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"不同肿瘤类型和ICI药物可能导致生物标志物表现不同，应用时需考虑情境依赖性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9222fc126fbbb5572476924f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"html\",\n              \"reason\": \"html_challenge_or_login\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"html\",\n              \"known_losses\": [\n                \"headings/tables/math/image pixels are not preserved by this plain HTML projection\"\n              ],\n              \"reason\": \"body converted to structured material; headings/tables/math/image pixels may be lost\",\n              \"status\": \"derived\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"structured_partial\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a206a96a782032cc169d8b1d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::830348bc4ff460e98754073d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::34fba25ca01d8cc9a99d4b85\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用前瞻性队列设计。收集接受ICI治疗的癌症患者粪便样本。使用16S rRNA测序和MGS进行微生物组分析。定义七个基于文献的预设细菌组（包括致病菌组和Ruminococcaceae等）。使用多种统计工具（ANCOM-BC, LinDA, MaAsLin2, ALDEx2）进行差异丰度分析，以寻找跨工具一致的结果。通过逻辑回归和线性混合效应模型评估细菌组与严重irAE的关联，并校正ICI类型。比较有/无严重irAE患者在基线、治疗早期、irAE发作时及免疫抑制后的微生物组特征。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::81d1197be7aa905b288e7880\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了大样本（195例）前瞻性数据，证实了Ruminococcaceae科的动态减少与严重irAE的相关性，特别是在irAE发作时的显著降低。\",\n          \"limits\": \"基线致病菌组的高RA关联在多重检验校正后不显著；部分低丰度菌群的差异结果需谨慎解读；无法区分菌株特异性效应；样本量对于解析复杂的多重交互作用仍显不足。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c2a3cf5d3e5f4ec9f74e46c7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"基线（ICI治疗前）\",\n          \"finding\": \"发生严重irAE的患者中，预设的致病菌组（pathobionts）平均RA显著高于未发生者（8.2% vs 4.8%; OR 1.40; 95%CI 1.07-1.87），但该关联在多重检验校正后失去统计学显著性（校正p=0.059）。Ruminococcaceae科在两组间基线RA无显著差异。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::945c11493df532310035578f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"治疗早期（从基线到第2周期）\",\n          \"finding\": \"发生严重irAE的患者中，Ruminococcaceae科的RA下降幅度显著大于未发生者（交互作用粗p=0.018，校正p=0.123）。然而，发生组内的下降本身未达到统计学显著性（粗p=0.078）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4a8e73e66868ae4bfdc82e5a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"严重irAE发作时\",\n          \"finding\": \"与所有其他时间点相比，发生严重irAE的患者中Ruminococcaceae科、Ruminococcus属以及R. bromii和R. callidus物种的RA显著降低。Haemophilus属及其种H. parainfluenzae在irAE发作时的RA显著升高。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a7ef9c7e8453fccfc36f88ca\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::be70156d57df0f79b02acfcc\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管已知肠道微生物组可能影响ICI疗效，但其与严重irAEs的关联尚不明确，且既往研究结果存在冲突。本研究试图确定基线微生物特征或治疗期间的动态变化是否能预测严重irAEs，并探索潜在的病理生理机制。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6ead9f1dbcba31cf6e1fc85d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"荷兰乌得勒支大学医学中心进行的UNI-CIT前瞻性生物库研究中的癌症患者。研究对象为接受一线抗PD-1单药或抗PD-1联合抗CTLA-4治疗的实体瘤患者（主要为黑色素瘤和非小细胞肺癌）。样本包括治疗前基线、治疗早期（第2-3周期）、严重irAE发作时及免疫抑制治疗后的粪便样本。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::68f4a1a3b76d7493fee0802b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在评估肠道微生物组在免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗开始时的组成及其在治疗过程中的变化，是否与随后发生的严重免疫相关不良事件（irAEs，≥3级）相关。通过对195名患者的497个粪便样本进行16S rRNA基因测序和宏基因组鸟枪法测序（MGS），分析α/β多样性、特定分类群相对丰度（RA）及预设细菌组的差异。研究发现，虽然基线时致病菌组（pathobionts）的RA较高与严重irAE风险增加有关（但在多重检验校正后不再显著），但Ruminococcaceae科在发生严重irAE的患者中表现出更显著的下降趋势，且在irAE发作时其RA显著低于其他时间点。这表明以Ruminococcaceae减少为特征的微生物组失调可能预示严重irAE的发生。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c252b5474d64d364cd7f3860\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅观察性关联，非因果证明；主要关注毒性而非直接疗效指标（如ORR/PFS）；结果受多重检验校正影响。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了肠道微生物组组成变化与ICI疗效/毒性关联的观察性证据。具体发现Ruminococcaceae科的减少与严重irAEs相关，提示微生物组状态可能调节宿主对ICI的反应谱（不仅限于抗肿瘤疗效，还包括毒性）。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4b929c4295eb40cb9ab14192\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"机制推断为主，缺乏直接的分子机制验证（如代谢物测量或动物实验验证）；F. prausnitzii的具体作用在该研究中未得到明确支持（基线无差异）。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"探讨了可能的机制线索：致病菌组富集和有益菌（Ruminococcaceae）减少导致的菌群失调（dysbiosis）可能促进炎症反应，从而引发irAEs。特别讨论了F. prausnitzii（产丁酸菌）在不同研究中的矛盾结果，暗示菌株特异性的重要性。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c9e0c551a9d37a02eb4f0f53\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"基线致病菌组高RA与irAE风险的初步关联（虽校正后不显著，但趋势一致），以及H. parainfluenzae在irAE发作时的升高。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::502a1b75a3903dd2b24ac4cc\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"对F. prausnitzii在既往研究中矛盾结果的详细讨论。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::11ce7c664c3b850176ec33d3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"基线致病菌组与irAE的关联在多重检验校正后不显著，不能视为确证的保护/风险因素，仅为趋势。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::814cd23e6d1aeafff2edd99d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Ruminococcaceae的减少是观察到的关联，不等于因果关系；可能是irAE的前驱标志或伴随现象。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ed2d9a5123e9b1e366665fa1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"低丰度菌群（如Marvinbryantia, Haemophilus）的差异结果可能存在技术噪音，需谨慎引用。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6f03e8ddcc9115afe6c4f8b2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"研究未直接测量ICI疗效（如肿瘤缩小），因此不能直接推断微生物组对疗效的影响，仅能推断对毒性的影响。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::351ab644a30b7b8ea00dbb02\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"supplement_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"auxiliary_material\": \"The study employed a robust methodological framework useful for review methodology discussions, including longitudinal sampling (baseline, during treatment, at irAE onset, post-immunosuppression), both 16S rRNA and metagenomic shotgun sequencing, and multiple differential abundance tools (ANCOM-BC, LinDA, MaAsLin2, ALDEx2) to ensure consistency. The authors discuss limitations regarding sample size for specific taxa and the need for correction for multiple testing, which resulted in some baseline associations (e.g., pathobionts) losing significance after correction.\",\n          \"evidence\": [],\n          \"gap_id\": \"Ch6_gap_5\",\n          \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\body_full_staged_acceptance_20261004_40cny\\\\planning\\\\chapters\\\\external\\\\N4452dfb25f491e9335fe-5a6b848383c152a3\\\\round_3\\\\supplements\\\\Ch6_gap_5\\\\attempt-hpbnytrx\\\\source_units\\\\SU01_search_candidate_4736138316\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n          \"limitations\": [],\n          \"material_ready\": true,\n          \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n          \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n          \"remaining_gap\": \"The gap question asks for large-scale microbiome association studies specifically targeting non-colitis irAEs (e.g., myocarditis, neurotoxicity) to verify evidence insufficiency. This study does not fulfill that requirement because it aggregates all severe irAEs into one group; the specific counts for non-colitis irAEs like myocarditis (n=2) and meningitis (n=2) are too small for independent large-scale association analysis. Thus, the existence of a dedicated large-scale study for non-colitis irAE microbiome signatures remains unconfirmed by this material.\",\n          \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n          \"status\": \"unmet\",\n          \"useful_material\": \"This prospective cohort study (Verheijden et al., 2025) analyzed 497 stool samples from 195 cancer patients treated with immune checkpoint inhibitors (ICI) to assess gut microbiome associations with severe immune-related adverse events (irAEs). The study included various irAE types listed in Table 1, such as myocarditis (n=2 total), meningitis (n=2 total), pneumonitis (n=4 total), and colitis (n=6 total), but aggregated them into a single 'severe irAE' endpoint for analysis due to low incidence of individual types. Key findings indicated that a higher baseline relative abundance of a prespecified pathobiont group and a stronger decrease in Ruminococcaceae during treatment were associated with developing severe irAEs. At irAE onset, Ruminococcaceae and specific species (R. bromii, R. callidus) were significantly lower, while Haemophilus parainfluenzae was higher compared to other time points. The authors explicitly note in Section 3.6 that only 17 patients provided samples at severe irAE onset, with diverse irAE types (8 colitis, 3 pancreatitis/diabetes, 2 meningitis, 4 others), limiting subtype-specific analysis.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::60b3d7f50c0db0e4655bf040\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-b5c2e925a4132b88eff6\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-7f937d5566b4c12030ce\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-a96686bee2f7be7a8dd8\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-724817b1ad2fa81c8182\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-ba354d40740f64366cbf\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-403bce67afb0fdb07c1f\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b16d054e681e54f8a54f2fd2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c4a19a0d9b7f5acaad003b10\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6b3c39236af481f48796c5a5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"As a narrative review, the authors synthesized existing literature on ICI-induced irAEs. The structure follows a logical progression: first, elucidating core immunopathological mechanisms (T-cell, B-cell, cytokine, monocyte axes); second, analyzing multidimensional risk factors (host, environment, treatment, tumor, genetics); third, detailing clinical features, grading, and management strategies for irAEs across major organ systems; and fourth, proposing future research directions focusing on shared mechanisms, predictive models, and optimized intervention strategies. The approach relies on summarizing clinical studies, experimental data, and meta-analyses cited in the references.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b674d56e73dd08f9bbfecb45\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"Provides a comprehensive, up-to-date synthesis of the multifaceted mechanisms (cellular and molecular) underlying irAEs, integrating T-cell, B-cell, cytokine, and monocyte pathways.\",\n          \"limits\": \"As a review, it does not present new primary experimental data or validate predictive biomarkers clinically; it summarizes existing evidence which may be heterogeneous.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e03a2182581575edeadacd6c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"Offers a detailed, organ-system-based classification of irAEs with specific incidence rates, grading criteria, and tiered management strategies, serving as a practical clinical reference.\",\n          \"limits\": \"Management recommendations are largely based on expert consensus and existing guidelines rather than novel randomized controlled trials presented in this paper.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4394b63dfe98f3127580588e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"Identifies and categorizes diverse risk factors, highlighting the role of gut microbiota and genetic polymorphisms, pointing towards precision medicine approaches.\",\n          \"limits\": \"Many identified risk factors (e.g., specific microbial strains, genetic variants) are noted as having 'promising' but 'not yet universally validated' predictive value; the paper acknowledges the lack of reliable clinical biomarkers.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fe1b12ddfb220879142c6003\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"ICI therapy (anti-CTLA-4, anti-PD-1/PD-L1)\",\n          \"finding\": \"Core mechanisms involve Treg exhaustion, Teff overactivation/cross-reactivity, B-cell autoantibody production, cytokine network imbalance, and monocyte/macrophage inflammatory cascades.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ead3e8fc0c45a6993b000063\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Risk factors analysis\",\n          \"finding\": \"Risk is influenced by host factors (age, sex, BMI, comorbidities), gut microbiota dysbiosis (e.g., Akkermansia muciniphila abundance), treatment regimen (combination therapy increases severity, dose-dependency), tumor type/histology (high TMB/high burden), and genetic factors (HLA polymorphisms like HLA-DR4).\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6798e317fab01f72ee02f0e6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Organ-specific irAEs\",\n          \"finding\": \"Different organs have distinct incidence and severity profiles; e.g., anti-CTLA-4 is linked to colitis/hypophysitis, while anti-PD-1/PD-L1 is linked to pneumonitis/thyroid dysfunction. Rare but fatal events include myocarditis and myasthenia gravis.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::913dc3cf94d1412f8a58d6ea\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Correlation with efficacy\",\n          \"finding\": \"There is a partial statistical correlation between certain irAEs (e.g., vitiligo) and anti-tumor efficacy, suggesting shared antigenic targets, but excessive immunosuppression may diminish efficacy.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8a675abe54cac9b7e7d6cc86\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3080cc085a00ab0269bfdf5e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The review addresses the critical challenge that while ICIs significantly improve cancer survival, they cause severe, multi-organ irAEs due to disrupted immune tolerance. Key problems include the lack of reliable predictive biomarkers, incomplete understanding of molecular pathophysiology (especially for rare/fatal irAEs), complex toxicity profiles from combination therapies, and the controversial correlation between irAEs and anti-tumor efficacy. The goal is to provide a systematic framework for clinicians to understand, predict, and manage these toxicities.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::862ed7699d67d89644832217\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The review focuses on immune checkpoint inhibitors (ICIs) used in cancer therapy, specifically examining the mechanisms, risk factors, and clinical management of immune-related adverse events (irAEs). It covers various organ systems (skin, gastrointestinal, endocrine, cardiovascular, etc.) and discusses future research directions. The scope includes solid tumors generally, with specific mentions of melanoma, lung cancer, renal cell carcinoma, and hepatocellular carcinoma.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::dc846e4ef365893a676fab0b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"This is a comprehensive review article published in 2025 that systematically summarizes the pathophysiology, risk stratification, and clinical management of irAEs associated with ICIs. It details how ICIs disrupt immune homeostasis through T-cell dysfunction, B-cell autoantibody production, cytokine dysregulation, and monocyte-mediated inflammation. The paper categorizes irAEs by organ system, providing incidence rates, grading criteria, and treatment guidelines. It also identifies multiple risk factors including host characteristics, gut microbiota, genetic polymorphisms, and treatment regimens. Finally, it outlines future strategies for prediction, prevention, and targeted intervention to balance anti-tumor efficacy with safety.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::10c4da75004fc002b1e4e2e2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"The association is observational/correlational in the cited studies. The paper emphasizes the *dual effect*: these same microbes may also increase irAE risk. It does not provide mechanistic depth on *how* exactly the microbiome modulates efficacy beyond general immune activation.\",\n          \"contribution\": \"Mentions that high abundance of Akkermansia muciniphila (>4.8%) is associated with prolonged overall survival in NSCLC patients receiving ICIs, attributing this to enhanced CD8+ T lymphocyte activation and IFN-γ secretion. Also notes that other microbes can enhance antitumor immunity.\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::309fa2b34a73f9b249924c60\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"The mechanistic details provided are largely inferred from general immunology or cited animal/experimental studies. The paper explicitly states that the molecular interaction networks require further investigation. It does not detail specific microbial metabolites or precise signaling pathways linking microbiota directly to tumor antigen presentation or T-cell priming for efficacy.\",\n          \"contribution\": \"Describes mechanisms where gut microbiota influence T-cell subsets (e.g., Th17 differentiation and function). Dysbiosis may disrupt Th17 homeostasis, leading to hyperfunction and pro-inflammatory cytokine release. It also mentions that specific probiotics/prebiotics can alleviate irAE symptoms, implying a regulatory role.\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f8ea0c7f877777d642503dc8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Discussion of Akkermansia muciniphila having a 'dual effect' (enhancing survival but increasing irAE risk); mention of gut microbiota regulating Th17 cells.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9cd0d7630fcef01909adb663\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Statement that despite many potential biomarkers (including microbiota-related ones), there is currently no universally acknowledged reliable biomarker for predicting irAE risk.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d68a0a45b28262f047176315\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The paper's primary focus is on *adverse events* (irAEs), not efficacy. Any claims about efficacy modulation are secondary mentions or part of the discussion on shared mechanisms/toxicity risks.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::45538ddfc2fb94b27b1abfa3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The link between gut microbiota and efficacy is described as correlational (e.g., abundance levels associated with survival) rather than definitively causal or mechanistically fully elucidated in this text.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7fb4e1dd9b8b2e79cb3e9d81\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Specific microbial species mentioned (e.g., Akkermansia) are linked to outcomes in specific contexts (NSCLC), and results may not be generalizable to all solid tumors or all ICI types without further verification.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::56536e998c235c8881061947\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Mechanisms involving gut microbiota are often summarized broadly (e.g., 'regulating T-cell subsets') without detailed molecular pathways, requiring caution when inferring specific causal chains.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::53339ce4b7ad243f4de96c8b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-b5c2e925a4132b88eff6\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-7f937d5566b4c12030ce\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-a96686bee2f7be7a8dd8\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-724817b1ad2fa81c8182\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-ba354d40740f64366cbf\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-403bce67afb0fdb07c1f\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e6be6ecb5a21f27c0138909a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"abstract\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::959196775c9d1a3315640917\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::971b4d6832cb71174bf1acc8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"前瞻性观察性队列研究。对象为俄亥俄州立大学皮肤癌诊所收治的>18岁ICI治疗黑色素瘤患者（排除基线使用皮质类固醇者）。数据收集包括：1. 临床终点：每12周通过RECIST v1.1评估客观缓解率（ORR），记录12个月无进展生存期（PFS）；通过CTCAE v5.0评估irAEs。2. 生物样本：在基线、irAE发生后2天内（医生图表审查确认）、治疗12周时收集粪便样本。3. 实验室分析：Illumina NovaSeq 6000进行宏基因组全基因组鸟枪法测序，使用HUMAnN3进行分类。4. 统计分析：使用R包glmm对微生物相对丰度与irAEs的影响进行逻辑回归建模，并校正错误发现率（FDR）。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c4a2c53e2690a84e1e092162\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了纵向微生物组数据，识别出能区分不同临床表型（响应/非响应、有/无irAE）的具体细菌和噬菌体标志物。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给摘要未交代因果机制验证结果；仅观察到关联性，作者明确指出未来分析需分配因果角色。样本量较小（n=32可评估响应），且为单中心观察性研究，外推性受限。未涵盖真菌的作用细节（仅提及无关联）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::dfac6126f2e15d75dc95ae48\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"总体响应 vs 非响应（基于ORR）\",\n          \"finding\": \"响应者中富集Bacteroides dorei (FDR p=9.5E-07) 和 Blautia species CAG:257 (padj=0.001)；非响应者中富集 Prevotella Stercorea (padj=1.1E-07) 和一种靶向沙门氏菌的噬菌体 (padj=8.3E-09)。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7211c1c99a88d8c48939669c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"有irAE的响应者 vs 无irAE的响应者\",\n          \"finding\": \"有irAE的响应者富集 Bacteroides plebeius (padj=4.2E-13) 和 Bacteroides coprophilus (padj=0.0002)；无irAE的响应者富集 Eubacterium siraeum (padj=7.2E-05)。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b9a6a65235d29e1700adcfc1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"整体微生物组特征与毒性/响应的关联\",\n          \"finding\": \"未发现真菌与响应或毒性显著相关。Bacteroides属的高丰度与irAEs显著相关，也与ICI响应一致。富含Bacteroides且缺乏Prevotella的微生物组特征与ICI响应相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a5c666c5f616d2a23da568a3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a6b817380c5901818a136666\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"既往研究表明irAE的发生与治疗响应相关，但二者往往难以解耦。本研究试图解决的核心问题是：肠道微生物组是否能在不同时间点（基线、irAE发生时、12周）独立预测ICI治疗的响应或毒性？特别是能否找到能区分“有效但有副作用”与“有效且无副作用”患者的微生物特征，从而为临床管理提供潜在的生物标志物。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::74f9995c67b241b47c1c563d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"转移性黑色素瘤患者，接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗；研究聚焦于肠道微生物组在基线、irAE发生期间及12周时的动态变化与临床结局（响应/毒性）的关联。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::979c21845a0e3c516f0051d0\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在确定转移性黑色素瘤患者在ICI治疗过程中，肠道微生物组的组成能否预测治疗响应或免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）。研究纳入了88名患者，其中48名为转移性疾病患者，32名可评估响应。通过纵向采集粪便样本并进行宏基因组鸟枪法测序，分析特定微生物丰度与ORR、PFS及irAEs之间的关联。研究发现某些细菌和噬菌体与响应或非响应显著相关，且存在能够区分“有irAE的响应者”与“无irAE的响应者”的特异性微生物标志物。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::162f1683c7d1f23ac12fadad\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅为观察性关联，不能证明因果关系。样本局限于黑色素瘤，可能不适用于所有实体瘤。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了具体的微生物物种水平证据，表明特定菌群（如Bacteroides, Blautia）与ICI响应正相关，而Prevotella与无响应相关。同时指出了Bacteroides丰度与irAEs的正相关性。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0ac17c8e6efb31e00f2e8705\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"摘要未提供具体的分子机制解释（如抗原模拟、代谢产物等），仅停留在相关性层面。需要结合其他文献补充机制细节。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提出了通过微生物组特征区分‘有效且有副作用’与‘有效且无副作用’的可能性（例如Eubacterium siraeum与无irAE响应相关）。这暗示了微生物组可能在调节疗效与毒性平衡中起中介作用。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7db3f5a0d510f33fe389eaef\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"研究设计采用了纵向和事件驱动的样本采集策略（基线、irAE发生时、12周），并使用宏基因组测序而非16S rRNA。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1b84ff28178816f733acb2da\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"发现噬菌体（phage）与无响应相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1e518a51f26908558e338268\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究结果为观察性关联，严禁将其解读为因果证据或已验证的治疗建议。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ea8e4e551b0e56fc1dff43c2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"结论主要基于黑色素瘤数据，应用于其他实体瘤时需保持谨慎，除非有其他证据支持跨癌种一致性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2824b3f22e827bf8f32fedf2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"‘解耦’一词在标题中是目标描述，实际结果仅显示统计关联，尚未证实可通过干预微生物组来主动解耦。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1cceaea08601a36b1c2fd402\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"样本量有限，p值虽显著但需注意多重比较校正后的效力，避免过度解读单个物种的效应大小。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::14b2d784889f9995695c35d3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"identity\",\n              \"reason\": \"source identity was not independently verified\",\n              \"status\": \"input_attributed\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"no complete research body was indexed\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"only abstract or non-title snippets were available\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"abstract_only\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6a2f8b93f81009c30ad72353\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"abstract\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::57719c927849bb7bcef3ee18\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1d645134099167f58e18c62c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用回顾性队列设计。首先从机构粪便生物库中识别90名接受ICI治疗的晚期黑色素瘤患者，要求有≥1个治疗前或治疗中的粪便样本进行16S rRNA扩增子测序。其次，根据临床反应将患者分为三个亚组：响应者（R，无进展）、原发耐药（pR，起始后<6个月进展）和获得性耐药（aR，起始后≥6个月进展）。统计分析包括：使用Kaplan-Meier和Cox比例风险模型分析临床协变量与生存的关系；使用Alpha和Beta多样性指标比较微生物特征；在各分类水平上使用Wilcoxon秩和检验进行成对比较。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b2277c2461af6ea75b8774cd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了基线肠道微生物组特征与ICI疗效亚型及irAEs关联的具体实证数据，特别是指出了SCFA产生菌（如F. prausnitzii）在响应者中高丰度的现象。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给摘要未交代具体的统计校正细节（除p adj外）、微生物鉴定的具体分辨率（种/属水平）、以及样本量较小（n=90）带来的统计效力限制。结论仅为相关性提示，未证实因果机制。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bb3f7102f49193abc788f9d8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"比较不同响应亚组（R, pR, aR）及irAE发生情况\",\n          \"finding\": \"基线α多样性在各亚组间无显著差异；β多样性呈现差异趋势（p=0.084），但未达统计学显著性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f0b8e61a52a394046017b826\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"比较响应者与不同耐药亚组的特定菌属\",\n          \"finding\": \"产丁酸菌Faecalibacterium prausnitzii在响应者（R）中的丰度显著高于原发耐药者（pR）和获得性耐药者（aR）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::85b4e9e2d1247881ba3aa6b7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"比较其他SCFA产生菌\",\n          \"finding\": \"其他短链脂肪酸（SCFA）产生菌，如Coprococcus comes, Dorea longicatena, Blautia glucerasea，在响应者中丰度显著更高，且在未发生irAEs的患者中丰度也更高。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0ea9066988d1b4879225dd90\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"irAEs与生存期的关联\",\n          \"finding\": \"发生irAEs的患者进展无病生存期（PFS）显著长于未发生irAEs的患者（中位PFS 1412天 vs. 106天，p=0.026）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::193f09bdf0baa896c2e581b4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fd353b433a82204e73c91fe6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管已知肠道微生物组可能作为ICI疗效的生物标志物，但尚不清楚基线微生物组组成能否预测特定的ICI耐药亚型（原发vs.获得性）或irAEs的发生。本研究试图定义与这些临床结果相关的基线微生物组特征。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9bb4eec23552d85fa4d9b99e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"研究对象为接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的晚期黑色素瘤患者。研究情境基于机构内的粪便生物库，纳入90名具有治疗前或治疗中粪便样本的患者。范围限定于基线肠道微生物组特征与ICI疗效亚型（原发耐药、获得性耐药、响应者）及免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）之间的关联分析。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::73df25717fa171314a35e42e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在探讨基线肠道微生物组组成是否能预测特定类型的ICI耐药性或irAEs的发生。研究团队从生物库中筛选出90名晚期黑色素瘤患者，根据疾病进展时间将其分为三组：响应者（R）、原发耐药者（pR）和获得性耐药者（aR）。通过16S rRNA扩增子测序分析基线微生物特征，并结合临床数据评估其与生存结局及irAEs的相关性。结果显示，虽然各组间α多样性无显著差异，但短链脂肪酸（SCFA）产生菌丰度在响应者中显著更高，且这些菌群也与不出现irAEs相关，提示SCFAs可能在介导ICI疗效和保护免受irAEs方面发挥作用。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e6d5db0be949bca0b0eea954\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅针对晚期黑色素瘤；样本量有限；主要基于相关性而非功能性验证。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了特定微生物类群（SCFA产生菌）与ICI疗效正相关的实证数据。发现响应者中F. prausnitzii及其他SCFA产生菌丰度显著高于耐药者。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cf29a57e65e341bf6850f872\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"机制假说性质强，缺乏直接的代谢物测量或功能实验验证；观察性研究无法确立因果链条。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提出了SCFAs（特别是丁酸）可能作为介导ICI疗效和防止irAEs的潜在机制分子。发现高丰度SCFA产生菌既与响应相关，也与不发生irAEs相关。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6d059ff00cd7f4bcb25d5a88\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"研究区分了原发耐药和获得性耐药，发现基线α多样性无差异，但β多样性有趋势差异，说明整体群落结构可能不如特定功能菌群重要。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6945839f4545f0881ada1e60\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"数据显示irAEs发生与更长PFS相关，且SCFA产生菌在未发生irAEs者中更高，这似乎与直觉相悖（通常认为irAEs预示更好疗效），提示微生物组可能通过复杂途径同时影响疗效和毒性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::db2c61045e7d2552ab68d06d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究为观察性关联，不能证明SCFA产生菌直接导致更好的疗效或更少的irAEs。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5f8b333342de0d627dda2a0c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"样本来自单一机构，可能存在选择偏倚或人群特异性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4783dce0790965c0e23d02e7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"16S rRNA测序仅提供分类学信息，未提供功能基因或代谢物水平的直接证据，机制解释为作者推测。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a30fb11fb35f764bc48fc75e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"“未发生irAEs”与“高SCFA产生菌”的正相关可能与“发生irAEs”与“好疗效”的正相关存在复杂的交互作用，需谨慎解读。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3954d7d48795dd4abc4a6e8c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"identity\",\n              \"reason\": \"source identity was not independently verified\",\n              \"status\": \"input_attributed\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"no complete research body was indexed\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"only abstract or non-title snippets were available\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"abstract_only\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5a58b310d6a1fcbf644a7861\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::16d1dbf3fbc16c9c8b51b5c7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::23a2e83f16cac9e170ef380d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"设计为单中心、前瞻性观察性队列研究。纳入标准：≥18岁转移性黑色素瘤患者，计划接受ICI治疗；排除标准：除生理替代外使用皮质类固醇者。样本收集：基线（ICI开始前10天内）、irAE发生时（CTCAE v5.0分级≥1级）、12周时采集粪便和血液样本。临床评估：每12周通过RECIST v1.1评估肿瘤反应和无进展生存期（PFS）。微生物分析：采用Illumina NovaSeq 6000进行宏基因组鸟枪法测序，使用MetaPhlAn4/HUMAnN3进行分类和谱系分析，使用ANCOM-BC2进行差异丰度分析以识别响应者/非响应者及irAE发生/未发生组间的显著差异分类群。统计显著性设定为q-value < 0.05。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cd3b02229ef600929713fd51\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了在单中心转移性黑色素瘤队列中，基线肠道微生物组特征与ICI治疗反应及irAEs发生的具体关联数据；识别出可能与“高疗效低毒性”相关的特定微生物（如Blautia luti）；验证了Lachnospiraceae家族在ICI反应中的普遍关联性。\",\n          \"limits\": \"样本量较小（n=41可评估反应，n=11发生>1级irAEs），限制了发现的普遍性和统计效力；单中心研究，人群多样性有限；观察性设计无法确立因果关系；未控制饮食等生活方式因素；基线采样窗口较宽（10天），可能引入变异；排除基线使用皮质类固醇的患者可能引入选择偏倚。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8c7b4bbbb48579d13f510dc7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"基线微生物组，转移性黑色素瘤患者（n=41可评估），ICI治疗\",\n          \"finding\": \"响应者（R）中Intestinimonas butyriciproducens (q=0.002)和Longicatena caecimuris (q=0.003)富集；非响应者（NR）中Tenericutes (q=0.001)和Lachnospira sp.NSJ 43 (q=0.002)富集。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::617e0a79c10627a1d064c820\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"基线微生物组，ICI治疗反应与irAEs关联\",\n          \"finding\": \"Blautia luti及其他Lachnospiraceae成员与“既有反应又无irAE”的状态相关（反应q=0.02，无irAE q=0.02）。在该队列中，治疗反应与irAEs之间未观察到统计学关系（P=0.368）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bf625e1cc90095b79b75f482\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"irAEs发生情况，基线微生物组\",\n          \"finding\": \"未发生irAEs组中Lachnospiraceae（包括Anaerotignum和Enterocloster物种）较多；发生irAEs组中Bifidobacterium较多。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3c98465b886a8558c857e9fd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::97ec4ce12791278224a63208\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"主要问题：在转移性黑色素瘤中，基线肠道微生物组能否预测ICI的治疗反应和免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）？动机：仅约半数患者对ICI有反应，且10-40%经历irAEs；理解这些因素的底层机制有助于改善预后并减少毒性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::97564157202dd84268e8d014\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"研究对象为接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的转移性黑色素瘤患者。研究情境为俄亥俄州立大学综合癌症中心皮肤癌诊所的单中心前瞻性观察队列。范围限定于基线肠道微生物组对ICI治疗反应（RECIST v1.1标准）及免疫相关不良事件（irAEs，CTCAE v5.0标准）的预测关联。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a3f36979553a1fc466731d77\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在确定治疗前的肠道微生物组是否能预测转移性黑色素瘤患者对ICI的反应或毒性。研究纳入88名计划接受ICI治疗的患者，其中41名具有完整数据和转移性疾病信息。通过宏基因组鸟枪法测序分析基线粪便样本，比较响应者（R）与非响应者（NR），以及发生irAEs与未发生irAEs患者之间的微生物组成差异。研究发现，特定微生物丰度与治疗反应显著相关，且部分微生物同时与良好反应和低毒性风险相关，提示微生物组可能作为生物标志物或治疗靶点，但研究未确立因果关系。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::60cbb55146f3b016f0b780fe\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅限转移性黑色素瘤患者；单中心数据；观察性关联，非因果证明；样本量小，特别是irAE亚组；未控制混杂因素如饮食。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了基线肠道微生物组成分与ICI治疗反应（RECIST标准）及irAEs发生（CTCAE标准）的具体关联列表。例如，Intestinimonas butyriciproducens和Longicatena caecimuris与响应正相关，而Tenericutes与非响应正相关。Blautia luti与“响应且无irAE”状态相关。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::78ca6ea9f3f192072fcca79e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"机制多为基于文献的综合推测和本研究的关联提示，本研究本身未直接验证这些机制；具体机制（如肉碱依赖）引用自其他模型系统研究；作者承认机制尚未完全阐明。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"讨论了Lachnospiraceae可能的作用机制，包括代谢（膳食纤维、异生物质、胆汁酸）、免疫调节（短链脂肪酸产生）和生态位排斥。提及Blautia spp.可能与肉碱依赖机制有关。指出抗原模拟、TLR激活和小分子分泌是潜在的通用机制。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6a0027622e6f44d6fc753ec0\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"仅约半数患者对ICI有反应，10-40%经历irAEs；irAEs可能影响生活质量甚至导致死亡；目前缺乏指导irAEs预防或管理的科学证据。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9e2019c10f89947651eeef8e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"研究发现某些微生物（如Blautia luti）与“响应且无irAE”相关，表明反应和毒性可能在微生物组层面被解耦，存在优化疗效同时降低毒性的可能性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::932980f8923d6981889f3af2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"使用宏基因组鸟枪法测序结合ANCOM-BC2进行差异丰度分析；前瞻性纵向样本收集设计。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::16173882fcc6dbf32009b761\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究为观察性关联，不能推断因果关系。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a01bcc8eb444669407a53eaa\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"结果仅限于转移性黑色素瘤，外推至其他固体肿瘤类型需谨慎。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::315a2fecd5209e56a3f3256e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"样本量较小，特别是irAEs亚组，可能导致假阴性或效应量估计不准确。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cbf95136c2a6588e03cbc6a5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"未控制饮食等关键混杂因素，可能影响微生物组结果的解读。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::758c878055143ed5909fb5bf\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"基线采样时间窗较宽，可能掩盖短期动态变化。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9a8a340ab740f858307a0f44\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"排除基线使用皮质类固醇的患者，可能限制结果在更广泛临床人群中的适用性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1fee5b66ec78aababda36306\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-b5c2e925a4132b88eff6\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-7f937d5566b4c12030ce\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-a96686bee2f7be7a8dd8\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-724817b1ad2fa81c8182\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-ba354d40740f64366cbf\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b67c869eee5a32d72d756c1f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"abstract\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::905a16b1317dae09553557fb\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4fc1b23aa9738aec8d869909\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"纵向队列研究设计。收集III期黑色素瘤患者在联合ICI治疗前（基线）和治疗后第6周的配对粪便样本（n=126）和外周血PBMC样本（n=71）。使用16S rRNA基因测序分析肠道微生物组成，使用质谱流式细胞术全面 profiling 循环免疫细胞亚群。比较基线与第6周的微生物和免疫指标变化，并分析其与临床应答状态及irAEs严重程度的关联。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ddc7133862b1e98dee7bbcc4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了纵向证据，表明肠道微生物组（特别是拟杆菌属和瘤胃球菌科）与ICI治疗期间的免疫细胞动态（特别是Tregs）及临床结局（应答和irAEs）存在关联。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给摘要未交代具体的统计校正方法（如多重检验校正）、微生物功能推断细节、以及是否控制了其他混杂因素（如抗生素使用、饮食等）。此外，作为会议摘要，缺乏完整的实验细节和长期随访数据。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5ced063ef4d895bb2527ef3c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"ICI治疗前后对比\",\n          \"finding\": \"治疗导致循环中CD8+效应记忆T细胞（Tem）频率增加（P=0.0096）和调节性T细胞（Tregs）频率减少（P=0.0029）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::df0c22db80cc042e49db6078\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"根据临床应答分类\",\n          \"finding\": \"Tregs的减少主要在应答者中观察到（P=0.0016），而在非应答者中无显著变化（P=0.9515）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::155a4a53fa9c96215b2c32fe\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"根据irAEs严重程度分类\",\n          \"finding\": \"发生严重irAEs的患者在第6周时Tregs显著缺乏（P=0.0293），相比无或轻度毒性患者。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4dd917c890edeb09e25c7941\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"基线微生物与免疫变化的关联\",\n          \"finding\": \"在循环Tregs减少的患者中，Tregs减少的程度与基线拟杆菌属（Bacteroides）相对丰度呈正相关（P<0.0001）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::43564e4cabb74c63d54ecf12\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"基线微生物与临床结局的关联\",\n          \"finding\": \"较高的基线拟杆菌属丰度与更严重的irAEs发展（P=0.0472）及第6周前更高的类固醇使用率（P=0.0345）相关。相反，较高的瘤胃球菌科（Ruminococcaceae）丰度具有保护作用，且瘤胃球菌科主导的微生物组患者中应答者比例更高。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::13b30b98ec45be93bfcf01d5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b52da9c89aaeaaa5b0749b6e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管已知肠道微生物组影响ICI疗效，但具体机制不明。本研究试图解决：肠道微生物如何与免疫系统相互作用以影响ICI的成功或irAEs的发生？特别是特定细菌类群（如拟杆菌属和瘤胃球菌科）与免疫细胞亚群变化及临床结局之间的关联。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::15613d5b09de0b9d50378597\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"III期黑色素瘤患者，接受新辅助联合抗PD-1/抗CTLA-4免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗；涉及澳大利亚和荷兰队列（n=126），其中71名患者有匹配的PBMC数据。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::35e128a47c0a17f95654887c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究旨在阐明肠道微生物组与免疫系统在ICI治疗中的纵向动态关系及其对疗效和免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）的影响。通过对126名患者的基线和第6周粪便样本进行16S rRNA基因测序，并对71名患者的外周血单个核细胞（PBMCs）进行质谱流式细胞术分析，研究发现ICI治疗导致循环中CD8+效应记忆T细胞增加和调节性T细胞（Tregs）减少。Tregs的减少主要见于应答者，但在发生严重irAEs的患者中也观察到显著缺乏。基线拟杆菌属（Bacteroides）丰度与Tregs减少程度及严重irAEs风险正相关，而瘤胃球菌科（Ruminococcaceae）高丰度则具有保护作用并关联更好的应答。结论指出肠道微生物组可能通过影响免疫平衡的“临界点”来塑造ICI的治疗结果。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::46fff116fb877592fe07c91f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅针对III期黑色素瘤患者，且为新辅助联合ICI治疗情境；不能直接外推至其他肿瘤类型或单药ICI治疗。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了特定细菌类群（拟杆菌属、瘤胃球菌科）与ICI疗效（客观缓解）及毒性（irAEs严重程度）的具体关联方向和数据支持。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5ba5a4a521ab5b76c9cdd393\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这是基于观察性关联提出的假设性机制（'suggests that...'），并非经过功能验证的因果机制；需结合其他研究确认其普遍性。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提出了一个潜在的机制线索：肠道微生物组可能通过影响基线免疫稳态（特别是Tregs的水平）来设定免疫反应的‘阈值’或‘临界点’，从而影响抗肿瘤免疫和irAEs的发生。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bed1c5a92a1c909e5a7e55ec\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"摘要中提到‘how gut microbes interact with the immune system... remains unclear’，反映了该领域的知识空白和研究动机。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5fb91d23ecba19c99dc65b1b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"拟杆菌属既与Treg减少（通常关联疗效）相关，又与严重irAEs相关；而瘤胃球菌科则显示保护性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::561b8cc96f7980e0b68fb9a2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究为会议摘要，详细的方法学细节（如测序深度、生物信息学流程、流式抗体面板、统计分析模型）未在摘要中提供，需谨慎引用具体数值和方法论细节。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e79b3405bb023182accfa755\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"研究对象仅限于III期黑色素瘤患者，且接受的是新辅助联合ICI治疗，结果可能不适用于晚期转移性黑色素瘤或其他实体瘤的单药ICI治疗。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fee2de282937a619aa2bdca1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"关联不等于因果：观察到的微生物与免疫细胞及临床结局的关联可能是由其他未测量的混杂因素驱动的，或反映的是反向因果关系。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7929958b24e5e4211328f19b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"‘拟杆菌属’是一个属水平的分类单元，其内部物种可能存在功能差异，摘要未提供更精细的分类或功能信息。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8e1908b8bbd498777e918ecb\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"identity\",\n              \"reason\": \"source identity was not independently verified\",\n              \"status\": \"input_attributed\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"no complete research body was indexed\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"only abstract or non-title snippets were available\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"abstract_only\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::113e9e24698e48b617801ee8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::13d62ece3687ca3ff02b6c26\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ccd742ea527af43296074069\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"研究设计为前瞻性、多中心、单臂II期临床试验。入组标准包括：NSCLC患者需PD-L1 TPS ≥50%且无一线可操作基因改变；黑色素瘤患者不限BRAF状态。所有患者在开始ICI治疗前一周内接受来自健康供体的单次FMT（口服胶囊）。主要终点是NSCLC队列的ORR。次要终点包括黑色素瘤ORR、1年无进展生存期（PFS）、总生存期（OS）、疾病控制率（DCR）及安全性。微生物组分析采用鸟枪法宏基因组测序，结合定量PCR和高通量培养组学验证细菌变化。此外，通过血浆代谢组学和流式细胞术分析免疫代谢景观，并在抗生素处理的荷瘤小鼠模型中通过回输“丢失”的细菌混合物来验证因果机制。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1876e77f5afb8193a6a5257e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了FMT联合ICI在NSCLC和黑色素瘤一线治疗中的临床活性证据，证实FMT可提高ORR。识别出“基线有害菌清除”作为潜在的药效学生物标志物，并揭示了其与色氨酸代谢抑制及CD8+ T细胞扩增的关联。\",\n          \"limits\": \"研究为单臂设计，缺乏安慰剂对照，难以完全排除自然病程或其他混杂因素。样本量较小（每队列20人），限制了亚组分析和统计效力。黑色素瘤队列中观察到的严重毒性信号（如心肌炎）需要更大规模的随机试验进一步确认。供体选择对毒性的影响提示个体化差异，但具体筛选标准尚未确立。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::999c7dbb4eb04f853f51ce68\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"NSCLC患者接受FMT+抗PD-1\",\n          \"finding\": \"ORR达到80%（16/20），满足主要终点；1年OS为100%；未观察到3级及以上与治疗相关的不良事件。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ef45091c05d3c80087467567\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"黑色素瘤患者接受FMT+抗PD-1+抗CTLA-4\",\n          \"finding\": \"ORR为75%（15/20）；观察到较文献报道更早发生的严重免疫相关不良反应（irAEs），包括心肌炎；部分严重AEs与富含Prevotella的供体有关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0c4539dfe7511b5ee26afddc\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"微生物组分析与临床响应关联\",\n          \"finding\": \"响应者（R）与非响应者（NR）相比，在FMT后表现出显著更高的基线细菌物种丢失幅度。这种丢失主要由有害菌（如Enterocloster, Clostridium, Streptococcus）构成，而非供体菌株的定植。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f77d7a57b1c5af196e7ec273\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"机制验证（动物实验）\",\n          \"finding\": \"在抗生素处理的小鼠中，将FMT响应者基线样本中丢失的有害细菌混合物重新引入，抵消了FMT联合ICI的抗肿瘤效应，证实消除有害菌是治疗获益的必要条件。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c5bc8bb178fbe4aff2844625\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::48e81723cf1694edffb2648d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管免疫检查点抑制剂改善了NSCLC和黑色素瘤的预后，但超过半数的患者存在原发性耐药。目前尚不清楚健康供体FMT联合抗PD-1（NSCLC）或抗PD-1联合抗CTLA-4（黑色素瘤）在一线治疗中的临床活性和安全性，以及FMT增强ICI疗效的人类机制。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f10ae71e3af0e5426782b275\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究针对晚期非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）和皮肤黑色素瘤患者，评估健康供体粪便微生物群移植（FMT）联合一线免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的临床疗效、安全性及机制。NSCLC队列接受抗PD-1单药治疗，黑色素瘤队列接受抗PD-1联合抗CTLA-4双免疫检查点抑制治疗。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bfc280fdf99afe8f46ce98b5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"这是一项多中心、开放标签的II期临床试验（FMT-LUMINate），旨在评估单次口服胶囊FMT在启动ICI治疗前对原发性耐药患者的影响。研究纳入20名NSCLC患者和20名黑色素瘤患者。主要终点为NSCLC队列的客观缓解率（ORR）。结果显示，NSCLC队列ORR为80%，超过预设阈值；黑色素瘤队列ORR为75%。安全性方面，NSCLC组无3级及以上不良事件，而黑色素瘤组出现较早发的严重免疫相关不良反应（irAEs），特别是心肌炎，且与特定供体菌群有关。机制研究发现，响应者并非通过获得特定的供体菌株定植获益，而是通过显著清除基线存在的有害细菌物种（如Enterocloster和Clostridium属），从而降低色氨酸代谢途径活性并改善全身免疫微环境。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ada46cc65142f66137be5912\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅适用于未经过ICI治疗的原发性耐药患者；NSCLC结果基于高PD-L1表达人群；黑色素瘤结果包含不同BRAF状态。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了FMT联合ICI在NSCLC（抗PD-1）和黑色素瘤（抗PD-1/CTLA-4）中的具体ORR数据（分别为80%和75%），证明了其在一线治疗中提高临床活性的能力。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1440b6c81c7ea354a5c0604d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"机制主要在人类队列中通过相关性分析发现，并通过小鼠模型进行功能验证；不同肿瘤类型中富集的有益菌种类有限重叠，但有害菌清除模式一致。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"阐明了FMT起效的潜在机制：响应者的获益主要依赖于基线有害细菌物种（如Enterocloster, Clostridium）的大量丢失，而非供体菌株的成功定植。这种丢失与血浆中色氨酸代谢产物（喹啉酸、犬尿氨酸）水平的降低以及效应性CD8+ T细胞的增加相关。动物实验证实，重新引入这些丢失的有害菌会阻断ICI疗效。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8d56ff3d1c73603487584373\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅在黑色素瘤双免疫治疗队列中观察到显著的毒性信号；在NSCLC单药治疗或未使用双免疫治疗的既往研究中未观察到相同程度的毒性。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"揭示了特定供体菌群特征（富含Prevotella spp.）与双免疫检查点抑制（抗PD-1/CTLA-4）背景下严重免疫相关不良反应（如心肌炎、早期发作的3级以上AEs）之间的关联。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2631f5b2da9f5640b19f7f49\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"研究指出FMT疗效不依赖于供体-宿主相似性或菌株水平定植，而是依赖于基线微生物组的整体重塑和有害菌清除。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5a5656eba7a625dd6b12644d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"提到TACITO试验也观察到类似的结果，即在FMT组中观察到基线物种的消除，而在安慰剂组中没有。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f453542c412b162f0e6a8104\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究的机制结论（有害菌清除导致疗效）是基于观察性关联和小鼠功能验证，需谨慎推断其在所有FMT场景下的普适性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f5dfc4aabe5eadd2a5f8c90b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"黑色素瘤队列中的严重毒性信号可能与双免疫检查点抑制的背景有关，不能直接外推至单药ICI治疗。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b12e17c00b7f89529c4a3847\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"供体选择对毒性的影响提示个体化差异，但本研究未建立标准化的供体筛选算法，仅作为警示。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::78071e0f85770a550546484c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"NSCLC队列的高ORR可能受限于高PD-L1表达人群的预后较好，需注意人群特异性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0223323bb5c9771bfce68f11\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"deep_read_material\",\n          \"current_question_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"attribution\": \"本研究\",\n              \"conditions\": \"研究对象为FMT-LUMINate试验中的非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC, n=20）和黑色素瘤（n=20）患者。黑色素瘤患者接受FMT联合抗PD-1（nivolumab）和抗CTLA-4（ipilimumab）治疗；NSCLC患者接受FMT联合抗PD-1（pembrolizumab）治疗。供体聚类基于41个来自9名供体的样本进行Bray-Curtis不相似度分析。AEs分级依据CTCAE v5.0。\",\n              \"finding\": \"在黑色素瘤队列中，19名患者（95%）出现任何级别的与治疗相关的不良事件（AEs），其中12名（60%）出现3级或更高级别的AEs，1名出现4级AEs。最常见的3级或以上AE是腹泻或结肠炎（20%的患者）。有3名患者（15%）发生心肌炎，这高于文献报道的<1%的发生率。严重毒性的中位发作时间为开始抗PD-1和抗CTLA-4治疗后的40天，早于文献报告的60天。独立数据和安全监测委员会（DSMC）认为这些严重AEs比既往文献报道的发作更早。在NSCLC队列中，没有患者出现3级或更高级别的AEs。通过非监督聚类分析，健康供体的肠道微生物组被分为两个截然不同的簇（P = 0.001）。B簇（包含供体5和供体11）以高丰度的Prevotella spp.为特征。差异丰度分析证实，P. sp. Marseille-P4119、P. stercorea和Prevotellaceae GGB1146 SGB1472在接受双免疫检查点抑制剂治疗的黑色素瘤患者中，若发生3级或以上AEs则显著富集。后FMT定植的P. sp. Marseille-P4119、P. stercorea和Prevotellaceae SGB1472与3级或以上AEs显著相关（P < 0.001, P = 0.023, P < 0.001）。供体5提供的粪便在所有接受双ICI治疗的黑色素瘤患者中均导致3级或以上AEs，且两名发生快速发作心肌炎的患者均接受了来自供体5的FMT。然而，当仅使用抗PD-1单药治疗时（如之前的MIMIC试验中的供体5数据或本研究的NSCLC队列），来自Cluster B的供体并未引起毒性。综合所有经历3级或以上AEs的患者（包括当前研究和之前的MIMIC试验），来自Cluster B供体的粪便仅在联合PD-1和CTLA-4阻断的患者中引起毒性（P = 0.051）。\",\n              \"reference_ids\": [],\n              \"use_in_review\": \"提供FMT-LUMINate试验中关于安全性数据的具体统计结果、毒性事件临床特征（特别是心肌炎和腹泻/结肠炎的发作时间），以及供体微生物组聚类分析与免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）关联的详细机制证据。\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"explanation\": \"本研究揭示了FMT结合不同免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）背景下的安全性差异及其潜在的微生物机制。首先，FMT联合抗PD-1在NSCLC中表现出良好的安全性，无3级或以上AEs；而在联合抗PD-1和抗CTLA-4的黑色素瘤中，虽然总体安全性被DSMC判定为可接受，但出现了加速发作的严重免疫相关不良事件（irAEs），特别是心肌炎和中位发作时间提前至40天。其次，供体微生物组的组成决定了这种毒性风险。通过非监督聚类，供体被分为富含Prevotella spp.的Cluster B和其他Cluster A。Cluster B供体（特别是供体5）与严重的irAEs（包括心肌炎）密切相关，但这种关联具有严格的上下文依赖性：它仅在抗CTLA-4存在的情况下显现，而在抗PD-1单药治疗背景下不引发毒性。这表明特定的微生物类群（如Prevotella spp.）与ICI骨架之间存在情境依赖性的相互作用，可能驱动了双重阻断下的过度免疫反应。因此，供体选择对于未来FMT试验的安全性至关重要，特别是当联合使用抗CTLA-4时。\",\n          \"question_id\": \"Q01\",\n          \"remaining_points\": [\n            \"心肌炎的具体病理生理机制尚需进一步探索，尽管观察到其与特定菌属定植及CD4+ T细胞亚群变化的关联。\",\n            \"供体筛选标准如何具体量化以避免Cluster B供体，目前仅指出需排除此类供体。\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::456d19e731aeafe092b5f494\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"deep_read_material\",\n          \"paper_title\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Fecal microbiota transplantation plus immunotherapy in non-small cell lung cancer and melanoma: the phase 2 FMT-LUMINate trial\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6edcdf66c26215bc9744d2b6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"deep_read_material\",\n          \"plain_text\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6daa66dcd75ef6a88df089e5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"deep_read_material\",\n          \"prior_question_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"attribution\": \"本研究\",\n              \"conditions\": \"研究人群：NSCLC队列（n=20，一线治疗，PD-L1 TPS ≥ 50%，无既往抗PD-1暴露）；黑色素瘤队列（n=20，一线治疗，允许既往辅助抗PD-1但需停药>6个月）。干预措施：单次健康供体粪便微生物移植（FMT，口服胶囊）后紧接着启动ICI治疗。NSCLC组使用帕博利珠单抗（pembrolizumab）单药；黑色素瘤组使用纳武利尤单抗（nivolumab）联合伊匹木单抗（ipilimumab）。\",\n              \"finding\": \"在NSCLC队列中，FMT联合抗PD-1治疗的客观缓解率（ORR）为80%（16/20），超过了预设的64%主要终点阈值。在黑色素瘤队列中，FMT联合抗PD-1加抗CTLA-4（双ICI）治疗的ORR为75%（15/20）。关于毒性信号，在黑色素瘤双ICI组中观察到严重不良事件（AEs）的发生率较高且起病更早：13名患者（65%）经历了3级或更高级别的AEs，其中腹泻或结肠炎是最常见的3级及以上AE（20%的患者），另有15%的患者出现心肌炎。严重毒性的中位起病时间为开始抗PD-1和抗CTLA-4治疗后40天，早于文献报道的60天。相比之下，NSCLC单药抗PD-1组无3级或以上AEs发生。\",\n              \"reference_ids\": [],\n              \"use_in_review\": \"提供FMT联合免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）在非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）和黑色素瘤中的具体客观缓解率（ORR），以及双免疫检查点抑制剂（dual ICI）治疗下的毒性信号特征。\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"explanation\": \"该研究通过FMT-LUMINate II期临床试验评估了FMT联合ICI在两种不同癌症背景下的临床活性与安全性。结果显示，FMT显著提高了NSCLC患者对单药抗PD-1治疗的反应率（80%），并改善了黑色素瘤患者对双免疫检查点阻断（抗PD-1+抗CTLA-4）的反应率（75%）。然而，在黑色素瘤双ICI背景下，FMT联合治疗伴随着更高的免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）风险，特别是心肌炎和早期发作的严重毒性。这种毒性信号与特定供体来源的微生物群（富含Prevotella spp.）有关，且仅在双ICI背景下出现，而在单药抗PD-1背景下未观察到类似毒性。这表明FMT的安全性与特定的ICI治疗方案及供体微生物特征存在交互作用。\",\n          \"question_id\": \"Q01\",\n          \"remaining_points\": []\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::497b875e9b14be91a0c84f61\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"deep_read_material\",\n          \"prior_question_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"attribution\": \"本研究\",\n              \"conditions\": \"研究对象为FMT-LUMINate试验中的NSCLC（n=20）和黑色素瘤（n=20）患者。NSCLC组接受单药抗PD-1（pembrolizumab），黑色素瘤组接受双免疫检查点抑制剂（nivolumab + ipilimumab）。供体聚类基于 shotgun metagenomic sequencing 数据，使用 Bray-Curtis 指数进行无监督聚类，并通过 PERMANOVA 评估组间差异。AEs分级依据 CTCAE v5.0。\",\n              \"finding\": \"在NSCLC队列中，接受FMT联合抗PD-1治疗的患者未出现3级或更高不良事件（AEs），仅15%患者因2级AE使用皮质类固醇；而在黑色素瘤队列中，65%患者经历3级或更高AEs，其中腹泻/结肠炎占20%，心肌炎发生率为15%（3例），显著高于文献报道的<1%。独立数据和安全监测委员会（DSMC）判定该组合总体安全，但指出黑色素瘤队列中的严重AEs起病更早（中位40天 vs 文献60天）。聚类分析显示，来自富含普雷沃菌属（Prevotella spp.）的供体（特别是供体5）与3级及以上AEs的发生密切相关：所有由供体5提供的粪便导致黑色素瘤患者出现3级+ AEs，且2/3例心肌炎患者接受了供体5的FMT。这些毒性仅在双免疫检查点抑制剂（anti-PD-1 + anti-CTLA-4）背景下观察到，而在单药抗PD-1治疗中未出现。\",\n              \"reference_ids\": [],\n              \"use_in_review\": \"提供FMT-LUMINate试验中安全性数据的详细统计结果、毒性事件的具体临床特征（如心肌炎发生率、起病时间）以及与供体微生物组相关的因果关联分析，作为核心证据支持关于FMT安全性的讨论。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"attribution\": \"本研究\",\n              \"conditions\": \"分析对象包括FMT-LUMINate黑色素瘤队列及之前发表的MIMIC试验（Phase 1, melanoma, anti-PD-1 monotherapy）数据。统计方法包括 Fisher's exact test 比较组间差异，LEfSe 进行线性判别分析效应大小，以及 Spearman's r 相关性分析微生物定植与免疫细胞频率的关系。\",\n              \"finding\": \"通过无监督聚类分析，健康供体的肠道微生物组被分为两个 distinct clusters (P = 0.001)。Cluster B（包含供体5和11）以高丰度的普雷沃菌属（如 Segatella copri, Prevotella sp. Marseille-P4119, P. stercorea）为特征。在黑色素瘤患者中，接受 Cluster B 供体FMT后，出现3级+ AEs的患者中这些菌属显著富集（LDA score > 2, P < 0.05）。进一步分析显示，在接受双免疫检查点抑制剂治疗的患者中，S. copri 的定植与外周血中 CD4+ T细胞亚群比例增加相关（P = 0.026），而这种关联在单药抗PD-1治疗中不存在。这表明普雷沃菌属的定植是双免疫检查点抑制背景下毒性增加的驱动因素。\",\n              \"reference_ids\": [\n                \"R23\"\n              ],\n              \"use_in_review\": \"展示供体微生物组特征与免疫相关不良反应（irAEs）之间的机制性联系，特别是普雷沃菌属定植与特定T细胞亚群变化的关联，用于解释为何某些供体会增加毒性风险。\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"explanation\": \"本研究揭示了FMT联合ICI治疗的安全性与供体微生物组特征及ICI治疗方案之间的复杂相互作用。首先，FMT本身在NSCLC（单药抗PD-1）中表现出良好的耐受性，无3级以上AEs。然而，在黑色素瘤（双药抗PD-1/CTLA-4）中，虽然总体安全性被DSMC认可，但出现了加速发作的严重AEs，特别是心肌炎。这种毒性信号并非随机分布，而是与特定的供体微生物组特征紧密相关。通过供体聚类分析，研究发现富含普雷沃菌属（Prevotella spp.）的供体（Cluster B）与3级以上AEs的发生显著相关。机制上，这种关联依赖于ICI的治疗背景：普雷沃菌属的定植及其引发的CD4+ T细胞变化仅在双免疫检查点抑制（anti-PD-1 + anti-CTLA-4）条件下导致毒性，而在单药抗PD-1条件下不表现。这提示普雷沃菌属可能是双免疫检查点抑制背景下免疫相关不良反应的潜在驱动因子，强调了根据ICI方案选择合适供体的重要性。\",\n          \"question_id\": \"Q01\",\n          \"remaining_points\": [\n            \"心肌炎的具体病理生理机制尚需进一步探索，尽管已将其列为特殊关注AE。\",\n            \"供体筛选标准如何具体量化‘普雷沃菌属丰富度’阈值以排除高风险供体，文中未给出明确操作指南。\",\n            \"长期随访中，这些早期AEs对最终肿瘤疗效是否有负面影响，文中提到数值上有关联但统计不显著，需更大样本验证。\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e34ebbbb34ba3c89d1c553df\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"deep_read_material\",\n          \"question_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"attribution\": \"本研究\",\n              \"conditions\": \"研究人群：NSCLC队列（n=20，一线治疗，PD-L1 TPS ≥ 50%，无既往抗PD-1暴露）；黑色素瘤队列（n=20，一线治疗，允许既往辅助抗PD-1但需停药>6个月）。干预措施：单次健康供体粪便微生物移植（FMT，口服胶囊）后紧接着启动ICI治疗。NSCLC组使用帕博利珠单抗（pembrolizumab）单药；黑色素瘤组使用纳武利尤单抗（nivolumab）联合伊匹木单抗（ipilimumab）。\",\n              \"finding\": \"在NSCLC队列中，FMT联合抗PD-1治疗的客观缓解率（ORR）为80%（16/20），超过了预设的64%主要终点阈值。在黑色素瘤队列中，FMT联合抗PD-1加抗CTLA-4（双ICI）治疗的ORR为75%（15/20）。关于毒性信号，在黑色素瘤双ICI组中观察到严重不良事件（AEs）的发生率较高且起病更早：13名患者（65%）经历了3级或更高级别的AEs，其中腹泻或结肠炎是最常见的3级及以上AE（20%的患者），另有15%的患者出现心肌炎。严重毒性的中位起病时间为开始抗PD-1和抗CTLA-4治疗后40天，早于文献报道的60天。相比之下，NSCLC单药抗PD-1组无3级或以上AEs发生。\",\n              \"reference_ids\": [],\n              \"use_in_review\": \"提供FMT联合免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）在非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）和黑色素瘤中的具体客观缓解率（ORR），以及双免疫检查点抑制剂（dual ICI）治疗下的毒性信号特征。\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"explanation\": \"该研究通过FMT-LUMINate II期临床试验评估了FMT联合ICI在两种不同癌症背景下的临床活性与安全性。结果显示，FMT显著提高了NSCLC患者对单药抗PD-1治疗的反应率（80%），并改善了黑色素瘤患者对双免疫检查点阻断（抗PD-1+抗CTLA-4）的反应率（75%）。然而，在黑色素瘤双ICI背景下，FMT联合治疗伴随着更高的免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）风险，特别是心肌炎和早期发作的严重毒性。这种毒性信号与特定供体来源的微生物群（富含Prevotella spp.）有关，且仅在双ICI背景下出现，而在单药抗PD-1背景下未观察到类似毒性。这表明FMT的安全性与特定的ICI治疗方案及供体微生物特征存在交互作用。\",\n          \"question_id\": \"Q01\",\n          \"remaining_points\": []\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::436fcf7aa325545c7b4b35ba\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"deep_read_material\",\n          \"question_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"attribution\": \"本研究\",\n              \"conditions\": \"研究对象为FMT-LUMINate试验中的NSCLC（n=20）和黑色素瘤（n=20）患者。NSCLC组接受单药抗PD-1（pembrolizumab），黑色素瘤组接受双免疫检查点抑制剂（nivolumab + ipilimumab）。供体聚类基于 shotgun metagenomic sequencing 数据，使用 Bray-Curtis 指数进行无监督聚类，并通过 PERMANOVA 评估组间差异。AEs分级依据 CTCAE v5.0。\",\n              \"finding\": \"在NSCLC队列中，接受FMT联合抗PD-1治疗的患者未出现3级或更高不良事件（AEs），仅15%患者因2级AE使用皮质类固醇；而在黑色素瘤队列中，65%患者经历3级或更高AEs，其中腹泻/结肠炎占20%，心肌炎发生率为15%（3例），显著高于文献报道的<1%。独立数据和安全监测委员会（DSMC）判定该组合总体安全，但指出黑色素瘤队列中的严重AEs起病更早（中位40天 vs 文献60天）。聚类分析显示，来自富含普雷沃菌属（Prevotella spp.）的供体（特别是供体5）与3级及以上AEs的发生密切相关：所有由供体5提供的粪便导致黑色素瘤患者出现3级+ AEs，且2/3例心肌炎患者接受了供体5的FMT。这些毒性仅在双免疫检查点抑制剂（anti-PD-1 + anti-CTLA-4）背景下观察到，而在单药抗PD-1治疗中未出现。\",\n              \"reference_ids\": [],\n              \"use_in_review\": \"提供FMT-LUMINate试验中安全性数据的详细统计结果、毒性事件的具体临床特征（如心肌炎发生率、起病时间）以及与供体微生物组相关的因果关联分析，作为核心证据支持关于FMT安全性的讨论。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"attribution\": \"本研究\",\n              \"conditions\": \"分析对象包括FMT-LUMINate黑色素瘤队列及之前发表的MIMIC试验（Phase 1, melanoma, anti-PD-1 monotherapy）数据。统计方法包括 Fisher's exact test 比较组间差异，LEfSe 进行线性判别分析效应大小，以及 Spearman's r 相关性分析微生物定植与免疫细胞频率的关系。\",\n              \"finding\": \"通过无监督聚类分析，健康供体的肠道微生物组被分为两个 distinct clusters (P = 0.001)。Cluster B（包含供体5和11）以高丰度的普雷沃菌属（如 Segatella copri, Prevotella sp. Marseille-P4119, P. stercorea）为特征。在黑色素瘤患者中，接受 Cluster B 供体FMT后，出现3级+ AEs的患者中这些菌属显著富集（LDA score > 2, P < 0.05）。进一步分析显示，在接受双免疫检查点抑制剂治疗的患者中，S. copri 的定植与外周血中 CD4+ T细胞亚群比例增加相关（P = 0.026），而这种关联在单药抗PD-1治疗中不存在。这表明普雷沃菌属的定植是双免疫检查点抑制背景下毒性增加的驱动因素。\",\n              \"reference_ids\": [\n                \"R23\"\n              ],\n              \"use_in_review\": \"展示供体微生物组特征与免疫相关不良反应（irAEs）之间的机制性联系，特别是普雷沃菌属定植与特定T细胞亚群变化的关联，用于解释为何某些供体会增加毒性风险。\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"explanation\": \"本研究揭示了FMT联合ICI治疗的安全性与供体微生物组特征及ICI治疗方案之间的复杂相互作用。首先，FMT本身在NSCLC（单药抗PD-1）中表现出良好的耐受性，无3级以上AEs。然而，在黑色素瘤（双药抗PD-1/CTLA-4）中，虽然总体安全性被DSMC认可，但出现了加速发作的严重AEs，特别是心肌炎。这种毒性信号并非随机分布，而是与特定的供体微生物组特征紧密相关。通过供体聚类分析，研究发现富含普雷沃菌属（Prevotella spp.）的供体（Cluster B）与3级以上AEs的发生显著相关。机制上，这种关联依赖于ICI的治疗背景：普雷沃菌属的定植及其引发的CD4+ T细胞变化仅在双免疫检查点抑制（anti-PD-1 + anti-CTLA-4）条件下导致毒性，而在单药抗PD-1条件下不表现。这提示普雷沃菌属可能是双免疫检查点抑制背景下免疫相关不良反应的潜在驱动因子，强调了根据ICI方案选择合适供体的重要性。\",\n          \"question_id\": \"Q01\",\n          \"remaining_points\": [\n            \"心肌炎的具体病理生理机制尚需进一步探索，尽管已将其列为特殊关注AE。\",\n            \"供体筛选标准如何具体量化‘普雷沃菌属丰富度’阈值以排除高风险供体，文中未给出明确操作指南。\",\n            \"长期随访中，这些早期AEs对最终肿瘤疗效是否有负面影响，文中提到数值上有关联但统计不显著，需更大样本验证。\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1e65c84abaf39bc948ae4e34\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"deep_read_material\",\n          \"question_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"attribution\": \"本研究\",\n              \"conditions\": \"研究对象为FMT-LUMINate试验中的非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC, n=20）和黑色素瘤（n=20）患者。黑色素瘤患者接受FMT联合抗PD-1（nivolumab）和抗CTLA-4（ipilimumab）治疗；NSCLC患者接受FMT联合抗PD-1（pembrolizumab）治疗。供体聚类基于41个来自9名供体的样本进行Bray-Curtis不相似度分析。AEs分级依据CTCAE v5.0。\",\n              \"finding\": \"在黑色素瘤队列中，19名患者（95%）出现任何级别的与治疗相关的不良事件（AEs），其中12名（60%）出现3级或更高级别的AEs，1名出现4级AEs。最常见的3级或以上AE是腹泻或结肠炎（20%的患者）。有3名患者（15%）发生心肌炎，这高于文献报道的<1%的发生率。严重毒性的中位发作时间为开始抗PD-1和抗CTLA-4治疗后的40天，早于文献报告的60天。独立数据和安全监测委员会（DSMC）认为这些严重AEs比既往文献报道的发作更早。在NSCLC队列中，没有患者出现3级或更高级别的AEs。通过非监督聚类分析，健康供体的肠道微生物组被分为两个截然不同的簇（P = 0.001）。B簇（包含供体5和供体11）以高丰度的Prevotella spp.为特征。差异丰度分析证实，P. sp. Marseille-P4119、P. stercorea和Prevotellaceae GGB1146 SGB1472在接受双免疫检查点抑制剂治疗的黑色素瘤患者中，若发生3级或以上AEs则显著富集。后FMT定植的P. sp. Marseille-P4119、P. stercorea和Prevotellaceae SGB1472与3级或以上AEs显著相关（P < 0.001, P = 0.023, P < 0.001）。供体5提供的粪便在所有接受双ICI治疗的黑色素瘤患者中均导致3级或以上AEs，且两名发生快速发作心肌炎的患者均接受了来自供体5的FMT。然而，当仅使用抗PD-1单药治疗时（如之前的MIMIC试验中的供体5数据或本研究的NSCLC队列），来自Cluster B的供体并未引起毒性。综合所有经历3级或以上AEs的患者（包括当前研究和之前的MIMIC试验），来自Cluster B供体的粪便仅在联合PD-1和CTLA-4阻断的患者中引起毒性（P = 0.051）。\",\n              \"reference_ids\": [],\n              \"use_in_review\": \"提供FMT-LUMINate试验中关于安全性数据的具体统计结果、毒性事件临床特征（特别是心肌炎和腹泻/结肠炎的发作时间），以及供体微生物组聚类分析与免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）关联的详细机制证据。\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"explanation\": \"本研究揭示了FMT结合不同免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）背景下的安全性差异及其潜在的微生物机制。首先，FMT联合抗PD-1在NSCLC中表现出良好的安全性，无3级或以上AEs；而在联合抗PD-1和抗CTLA-4的黑色素瘤中，虽然总体安全性被DSMC判定为可接受，但出现了加速发作的严重免疫相关不良事件（irAEs），特别是心肌炎和中位发作时间提前至40天。其次，供体微生物组的组成决定了这种毒性风险。通过非监督聚类，供体被分为富含Prevotella spp.的Cluster B和其他Cluster A。Cluster B供体（特别是供体5）与严重的irAEs（包括心肌炎）密切相关，但这种关联具有严格的上下文依赖性：它仅在抗CTLA-4存在的情况下显现，而在抗PD-1单药治疗背景下不引发毒性。这表明特定的微生物类群（如Prevotella spp.）与ICI骨架之间存在情境依赖性的相互作用，可能驱动了双重阻断下的过度免疫反应。因此，供体选择对于未来FMT试验的安全性至关重要，特别是当联合使用抗CTLA-4时。\",\n          \"question_id\": \"Q01\",\n          \"remaining_points\": [\n            \"心肌炎的具体病理生理机制尚需进一步探索，尽管观察到其与特定菌属定植及CD4+ T细胞亚群变化的关联。\",\n            \"供体筛选标准如何具体量化以避免Cluster B供体，目前仅指出需排除此类供体。\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b581c9a20631821c53f134ac\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"deep_read_material\",\n          \"questions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"gap_key\": \"FMT-LUMINate 试验的详细安全性数据及供体聚类分析是本章核心证据，需深入解读其统计方法及毒性事件的具体临床特征。\",\n          \"purpose\": \"Supply a concrete, attributed case for the coordinated review.\",\n          \"question\": \"FMT-LUMINate 试验的详细安全性数据及供体聚类分析是本章核心证据，需深入解读其统计方法及毒性事件的具体临床特征。\",\n          \"question_id\": \"Q01\",\n          \"required_output_ids\": [\n            \"O01\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bdf06d41fae85cb4002eea7d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"supplement_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"auxiliary_material\": \"The authors explicitly state that this is a phase 2 trial, not a phase 3 trial. They mention that the findings will be assessed as part of the CanBiome2 randomized trial (NCT06623461), which is described as a randomized trial evaluating FMT in combination with ICI in 128 patients, but the current paper does not report the results of this phase 3 trial. The study design was open-label and single-arm for the cohorts reported here, lacking the randomization required for a phase 3 RCT status.\",\n          \"evidence\": [],\n          \"gap_id\": \"case_E_phase3_rct\",\n          \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\progressive_review_plan\\\\20260926_adaptive_retrieval\\\\03_external_closure\\\\runs\\\\case_E_phase3_rct\\\\source_units\\\\SU01_search_candidate_dcbe39b3d2\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n          \"limitations\": [],\n          \"material_ready\": true,\n          \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n          \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n          \"remaining_gap\": \"The gap requires evidence of a completed large randomised phase III trial. This material provides only a phase 2 trial. While the authors reference an ongoing/forthcoming phase 3 trial (CanBiome2), they do not provide its results or confirm its completion within this text.\",\n          \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n          \"status\": \"unmet\",\n          \"useful_material\": \"This study reports the results of FMT-LUMINate, a multicenter, open-label, phase 2 trial evaluating healthy donor fecal microbiota transplantation (FMT) combined with immune checkpoint inhibitors (ICI) in patients with non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC) or melanoma. The trial enrolled 40 patients (20 NSCLC, 20 melanoma). In the NSCLC cohort receiving anti-PD-1 monotherapy, the objective response rate (ORR) was 80%. In the melanoma cohort receiving dual anti-PD-1 and anti-CTLA-4 therapy, the ORR was 75%. The study found that clinical response was associated with the loss of baseline deleterious bacterial species rather than the engraftment of donor-specific strains. Safety data indicated no grade 3+ adverse events in the NSCLC cohort, but a higher incidence of severe immune-related adverse events (including myocarditis) in the melanoma cohort, particularly among recipients of donors rich in Prevotella spp.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e56bf9725ffb96585d3b26d8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"supplement_materials\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": [\n          {\n            \"auxiliary_material\": \"The authors explicitly state that this is a phase 2 trial, not a phase 3 trial. They mention that the findings will be assessed as part of the CanBiome2 randomized trial (NCT06623461), which is described as a randomized trial evaluating FMT in combination with ICI in 128 patients, but the current paper does not report the results of this phase 3 trial. The study design was open-label and single-arm for the cohorts reported here, lacking the randomization required for a phase 3 RCT status.\",\n            \"evidence\": [],\n            \"gap_id\": \"case_E_phase3_rct\",\n            \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\progressive_review_plan\\\\20260926_adaptive_retrieval\\\\03_external_closure\\\\runs\\\\case_E_phase3_rct\\\\source_units\\\\SU01_search_candidate_dcbe39b3d2\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n            \"limitations\": [],\n            \"material_ready\": true,\n            \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n            \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"remaining_gap\": \"The gap requires evidence of a completed large randomised phase III trial. This material provides only a phase 2 trial. While the authors reference an ongoing/forthcoming phase 3 trial (CanBiome2), they do not provide its results or confirm its completion within this text.\",\n            \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"status\": \"unmet\",\n            \"useful_material\": \"This study reports the results of FMT-LUMINate, a multicenter, open-label, phase 2 trial evaluating healthy donor fecal microbiota transplantation (FMT) combined with immune checkpoint inhibitors (ICI) in patients with non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC) or melanoma. The trial enrolled 40 patients (20 NSCLC, 20 melanoma). In the NSCLC cohort receiving anti-PD-1 monotherapy, the objective response rate (ORR) was 80%. In the melanoma cohort receiving dual anti-PD-1 and anti-CTLA-4 therapy, the ORR was 75%. The study found that clinical response was associated with the loss of baseline deleterious bacterial species rather than the engraftment of donor-specific strains. Safety data indicated no grade 3+ adverse events in the NSCLC cohort, but a higher incidence of severe immune-related adverse events (including myocarditis) in the melanoma cohort, particularly among recipients of donors rich in Prevotella spp.\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ffe022f4ac7a2eb8241e5388\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-a91f0ed643887e9f1b1d\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-ef95a97dcd7bd8c151c4\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-501f35983c2f020a5c71\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-81ec1ef0c2a046851171\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-d46f32b2af56fa1c47e2\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-02757a568956f4b210b5\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-47775c7896730e2260bc\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-b08d87be9985923039c9\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-4d651eaa044aee02c8ec\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-1294ef6fcf50c0be4a42\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-6e217865835c2f670e17\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-b1f79ce65e003459f3ed\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-786845b1cd45dd24fdc8\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-f0ebbdf389d42cf46d30\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"assets\",\n              \"reason\": \"supplementaryFiles_fetch_transport_TimeoutError\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::11e07541ccca87380640aaae\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"tool_supplement_materials\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": [\n          {\n            \"allowed_use\": [],\n            \"conditions\": [],\n            \"limits\": [],\n            \"question\": \"FMT-LUMINate 试验中 FMT 联合 ICI 的 ORR 数据是多少？供体菌群特征（如 Prevotella）与毒性（心肌炎）的关联机制是什么？\",\n            \"sources\": [\n              {\n                \"doi\": \"10.1038/s41591-025-04186-5\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"071823eff68d7dbea395490dd4643170131b5f6a\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n                \"title\": \"Fecal microbiota transplantation plus immunotherapy in non-small cell lung cancer and melanoma: the phase 2 FMT-LUMINate trial\",\n                \"year\": \"2026\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"still_missing\": \"FMT-LUMINate 试验中 FMT 联合 ICI 的 ORR 数据是多少？供体菌群特征（如 Prevotella）与毒性（心肌炎）的关联机制是什么？\",\n            \"usable_content\": \"{\\\"question_material\\\": [{\\\"question_id\\\": \\\"Q01\\\", \\\"examples\\\": [{\\\"attribution\\\": \\\"本研究\\\", \\\"use_in_review\\\": \\\"提供FMT联合ICI在NSCLC和黑色素瘤一线治疗中的客观缓解率（ORR）具体数据，以及安全性特征。\\\", \\\"finding\\\": \\\"在FMT-LUMINate试验中，接受健康供体FMT联合抗PD-1单药治疗的非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者（n=20），其客观缓解率（ORR）为80%（16/20），超过了预设的64%主要终点阈值。在黑色素瘤队列中，接受FMT联合抗PD-1加抗CTLA-4双免疫检查点抑制剂治疗的患者（n=20），ORR为75%（15/20）。\\\", \\\"conditions\\\": \\\"NSCLC队列：一线治疗，无驱动基因突变，PD-L1 TPS ≥ 50%，使用帕博利珠单抗（pembrolizumab）。黑色素瘤队列：一线或既往辅助治疗后复发>6个月，使用纳武利尤单抗（nivolumab）联合伊匹木单抗（ipilimumab）。\\\", \\\"reference_ids\\\": []}, {\\\"attribution\\\": \\\"本研究\\\", \\\"use_in_review\\\": \\\"揭示供体菌群特征（Prevotella富集）与特定毒性（心肌炎、3级及以上AEs）的关联机制，强调治疗背景（双免疫抑制 vs 单药）的关键调节作用。\\\", \\\"finding\\\": \\\"供体微生物组聚类显示，Cluster B（包含供体5和11）以高丰度的普雷沃菌属（Prevotella spp.，如Segatella copri, Prevotella sp. Marseille-P4119, P. stercorea）为特征。在黑色素瘤队列中，接受Cluster B供体（特别是供体5）FMT的患者发生了严重的免疫相关不良事件（irAEs），包括3例心肌炎（发生率15%），且发病时间显著提前（中位40天，而文献报道通常为60天）。其中2例心肌炎患者均接受了供体5的FMT，发病迅速（分别为第22天和第25天）。统计分析显示，Cluster B供体的粪便仅在双PD-1和CTLA-4阻断背景下导致毒性（P=0.051），而在抗PD-1单药治疗背景下未观察到此类毒性。此外，S. copri的定植与这些严重AEs患者外周血中CD4+ T细胞亚群增加相关。\\\", \\\"conditions\\\": \\\"比较对象：接受不同供体FMT的患者；治疗背景对比：黑色素瘤队列（双ICI）vs NSCLC队列及既往MIMIC试验（均为抗PD-1单药）。供体5在MIMIC试验（抗PD-1单药）中提供的7次FMT均未导致3级及以上AEs，而在本试验黑色素瘤队列中导致的FMT均伴随严重AEs。\\\", \\\"reference_ids\\\": []}], \\\"explanation\\\": \\\"该研究阐明了FMT增强ICI疗效的机制并非主要依赖于供体菌株的定植或供主微生物组的相似度，而是取决于患者基线有害菌群的清除。具体来说，响应者（Responders）在接受FMT后表现出比非响应者更显著的基线细菌物种丢失（SGB loss），特别是那些已知与ICI耐药相关的有害菌属（如Enterocloster, Clostridium, Streptococcus等）。这种有害菌的消除导致了色氨酸代谢途径的减弱，降低了血浆中喹啉酸（quinolinic acid）和犬尿氨酸（kynurenine）的水平，从而改善了免疫代谢微环境（增加效应CD8+ T细胞，减少调节性T细胞）。关于毒性机制，研究发现特定的供体菌群特征（富含Prevotella spp.）与双免疫检查点抑制剂（抗PD-1 + 抗CTLA-4）背景下的严重免疫相关不良事件（如心肌炎）存在情境依赖性关联。这种毒性风险在单药抗PD-1治疗中并未出现，提示供体选择需根据具体的ICI治疗方案进行优化。\\\", \\\"remaining_points\\\": [\\\"Prevotella spp. 诱导心肌炎的具体分子机制（如通过何种抗原或代谢物激活特定T细胞亚群）在本研究中仅表现为相关性，未深入解析其下游信号通路。\\\", \\\"虽然发现了基线有害菌丢失是疗效的关键预测因子，但哪些特定的丢失菌种组合对疗效贡献最大，以及是否可以通过定向清除而非全菌群移植来实现这一效果，仍需进一步研究。\\\"]}], \\\"plain_text\\\": \\\"\\\"}\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"allowed_use\": [],\n            \"conditions\": [],\n            \"limits\": [],\n            \"question\": \"FMT-LUMINate 试验的详细安全性数据及供体聚类分析是 Ch5/Ch6 核心证据，需深入解读其统计方法及毒性事件的具体临床特征。\",\n            \"sources\": [\n              {\n                \"doi\": \"10.1038/s41591-025-04186-5\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"071823eff68d7dbea395490dd4643170131b5f6a\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n                \"title\": \"Fecal microbiota transplantation plus immunotherapy in non-small cell lung cancer and melanoma: the phase 2 FMT-LUMINate trial\",\n                \"year\": \"2026\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"still_missing\": \"FMT-LUMINate 试验的详细安全性数据及供体聚类分析是 Ch5/Ch6 核心证据，需深入解读其统计方法及毒性事件的具体临床特征。\",\n            \"usable_content\": \"{\\\"question_material\\\": [{\\\"question_id\\\": \\\"Q01\\\", \\\"examples\\\": [{\\\"attribution\\\": \\\"本研究\\\", \\\"use_in_review\\\": \\\"提供FMT-LUMINate试验中安全性数据的详细统计结果、毒性事件的具体临床特征（如心肌炎发生率、起病时间）以及与供体微生物组相关的因果关联分析，作为核心证据支持关于FMT安全性的讨论。\\\", \\\"finding\\\": \\\"在NSCLC队列中，接受FMT联合抗PD-1治疗的患者未出现3级或更高不良事件（AEs），仅15%患者因2级AE使用皮质类固醇；而在黑色素瘤队列中，65%患者经历3级或更高AEs，其中腹泻/结肠炎占20%，心肌炎发生率为15%（3例），显著高于文献报道的<1%。独立数据和安全监测委员会（DSMC）判定该组合总体安全，但指出黑色素瘤队列中的严重AEs起病更早（中位40天 vs 文献60天）。聚类分析显示，来自富含普雷沃菌属（Prevotella spp.）的供体（特别是供体5）与3级及以上AEs的发生密切相关：所有由供体5提供的粪便导致黑色素瘤患者出现3级+ AEs，且2/3例心肌炎患者接受了供体5的FMT。这些毒性仅在双免疫检查点抑制剂（anti-PD-1 + anti-CTLA-4）背景下观察到，而在单药抗PD-1治疗中未出现。\\\", \\\"conditions\\\": \\\"研究对象为FMT-LUMINate试验中的NSCLC（n=20）和黑色素瘤（n=20）患者。NSCLC组接受单药抗PD-1（pembrolizumab），黑色素瘤组接受双免疫检查点抑制剂（nivolumab + ipilimumab）。供体聚类基于 shotgun metagenomic sequencing 数据，使用 Bray-Curtis 指数进行无监督聚类，并通过 PERMANOVA 评估组间差异。AEs分级依据 CTCAE v5.0。\\\", \\\"reference_ids\\\": []}, {\\\"attribution\\\": \\\"本研究\\\", \\\"use_in_review\\\": \\\"展示供体微生物组特征与免疫相关不良反应（irAEs）之间的机制性联系，特别是普雷沃菌属定植与特定T细胞亚群变化的关联，用于解释为何某些供体会增加毒性风险。\\\", \\\"finding\\\": \\\"通过无监督聚类分析，健康供体的肠道微生物组被分为两个 distinct clusters (P = 0.001)。Cluster B（包含供体5和11）以高丰度的普雷沃菌属（如 Segatella copri, Prevotella sp. Marseille-P4119, P. stercorea）为特征。在黑色素瘤患者中，接受 Cluster B 供体FMT后，出现3级+ AEs的患者中这些菌属显著富集（LDA score > 2, P < 0.05）。进一步分析显示，在接受双免疫检查点抑制剂治疗的患者中，S. copri 的定植与外周血中 CD4+ T细胞亚群比例增加相关（P = 0.026），而这种关联在单药抗PD-1治疗中不存在。这表明普雷沃菌属的定植是双免疫检查点抑制背景下毒性增加的驱动因素。\\\", \\\"conditions\\\": \\\"分析对象包括FMT-LUMINate黑色素瘤队列及之前发表的MIMIC试验（Phase 1, melanoma, anti-PD-1 monotherapy）数据。统计方法包括 Fisher's exact test 比较组间差异，LEfSe 进行线性判别分析效应大小，以及 Spearman's r 相关性分析微生物定植与免疫细胞频率的关系。\\\", \\\"reference_ids\\\": [\\\"R23\\\"]}], \\\"explanation\\\": \\\"本研究揭示了FMT联合ICI治疗的安全性与供体微生物组特征及ICI治疗方案之间的复杂相互作用。首先，FMT本身在NSCLC（单药抗PD-1）中表现出良好的耐受性，无3级以上AEs。然而，在黑色素瘤（双药抗PD-1/CTLA-4）中，虽然总体安全性被DSMC认可，但出现了加速发作的严重AEs，特别是心肌炎。这种毒性信号并非随机分布，而是与特定的供体微生物组特征紧密相关。通过供体聚类分析，研究发现富含普雷沃菌属（Prevotella spp.）的供体（Cluster B）与3级以上AEs的发生显著相关。机制上，这种关联依赖于ICI的治疗背景：普雷沃菌属的定植及其引发的CD4+ T细胞变化仅在双免疫检查点抑制（anti-PD-1 + anti-CTLA-4）条件下导致毒性，而在单药抗PD-1条件下不表现。这提示普雷沃菌属可能是双免疫检查点抑制背景下免疫相关不良反应的潜在驱动因子，强调了根据ICI方案选择合适供体的重要性。\\\", \\\"remaining_points\\\": [\\\"心肌炎的具体病理生理机制尚需进一步探索，尽管已将其列为特殊关注AE。\\\", \\\"供体筛选标准如何具体量化‘普雷沃菌属丰富度’阈值以排除高风险供体，文中未给出明确操作指南。\\\", \\\"长期随访中，这些早期AEs对最终肿瘤疗效是否有负面影响，文中提到数值上有关联但统计不显著，需更大样本验证。\\\"]}], \\\"plain_text\\\": \\\"\\\"}\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::163a7a8481c0223f6106b97e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"tool_supplement_materials\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": [\n          {\n            \"allowed_use\": [],\n            \"conditions\": [],\n            \"limits\": [],\n            \"question\": \"FMT-LUMINate 试验中 FMT 联合 ICI 的 ORR 数据是多少？供体菌群特征（如 Prevotella）与毒性（心肌炎）的关联机制是什么？\",\n            \"sources\": [\n              {\n                \"doi\": \"10.1038/s41591-025-04186-5\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"071823eff68d7dbea395490dd4643170131b5f6a\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n                \"title\": \"Fecal microbiota transplantation plus immunotherapy in non-small cell lung cancer and melanoma: the phase 2 FMT-LUMINate trial\",\n                \"year\": \"2026\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"still_missing\": \"FMT-LUMINate 试验中 FMT 联合 ICI 的 ORR 数据是多少？供体菌群特征（如 Prevotella）与毒性（心肌炎）的关联机制是什么？\",\n            \"usable_content\": \"{\\\"question_material\\\": [{\\\"question_id\\\": \\\"Q01\\\", \\\"examples\\\": [{\\\"attribution\\\": \\\"本研究\\\", \\\"use_in_review\\\": \\\"提供FMT联合ICI在NSCLC和黑色素瘤一线治疗中的客观缓解率（ORR）具体数据，以及安全性特征。\\\", \\\"finding\\\": \\\"在FMT-LUMINate试验中，接受健康供体FMT联合抗PD-1单药治疗的非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者（n=20），其客观缓解率（ORR）为80%（16/20），超过了预设的64%主要终点阈值。在黑色素瘤队列中，接受FMT联合抗PD-1加抗CTLA-4双免疫检查点抑制剂治疗的患者（n=20），ORR为75%（15/20）。\\\", \\\"conditions\\\": \\\"NSCLC队列：一线治疗，无驱动基因突变，PD-L1 TPS ≥ 50%，使用帕博利珠单抗（pembrolizumab）。黑色素瘤队列：一线或既往辅助治疗后复发>6个月，使用纳武利尤单抗（nivolumab）联合伊匹木单抗（ipilimumab）。\\\", \\\"reference_ids\\\": []}, {\\\"attribution\\\": \\\"本研究\\\", \\\"use_in_review\\\": \\\"揭示供体菌群特征（Prevotella富集）与特定毒性（心肌炎、3级及以上AEs）的关联机制，强调治疗背景（双免疫抑制 vs 单药）的关键调节作用。\\\", \\\"finding\\\": \\\"供体微生物组聚类显示，Cluster B（包含供体5和11）以高丰度的普雷沃菌属（Prevotella spp.，如Segatella copri, Prevotella sp. Marseille-P4119, P. stercorea）为特征。在黑色素瘤队列中，接受Cluster B供体（特别是供体5）FMT的患者发生了严重的免疫相关不良事件（irAEs），包括3例心肌炎（发生率15%），且发病时间显著提前（中位40天，而文献报道通常为60天）。其中2例心肌炎患者均接受了供体5的FMT，发病迅速（分别为第22天和第25天）。统计分析显示，Cluster B供体的粪便仅在双PD-1和CTLA-4阻断背景下导致毒性（P=0.051），而在抗PD-1单药治疗背景下未观察到此类毒性。此外，S. copri的定植与这些严重AEs患者外周血中CD4+ T细胞亚群增加相关。\\\", \\\"conditions\\\": \\\"比较对象：接受不同供体FMT的患者；治疗背景对比：黑色素瘤队列（双ICI）vs NSCLC队列及既往MIMIC试验（均为抗PD-1单药）。供体5在MIMIC试验（抗PD-1单药）中提供的7次FMT均未导致3级及以上AEs，而在本试验黑色素瘤队列中导致的FMT均伴随严重AEs。\\\", \\\"reference_ids\\\": []}], \\\"explanation\\\": \\\"该研究阐明了FMT增强ICI疗效的机制并非主要依赖于供体菌株的定植或供主微生物组的相似度，而是取决于患者基线有害菌群的清除。具体来说，响应者（Responders）在接受FMT后表现出比非响应者更显著的基线细菌物种丢失（SGB loss），特别是那些已知与ICI耐药相关的有害菌属（如Enterocloster, Clostridium, Streptococcus等）。这种有害菌的消除导致了色氨酸代谢途径的减弱，降低了血浆中喹啉酸（quinolinic acid）和犬尿氨酸（kynurenine）的水平，从而改善了免疫代谢微环境（增加效应CD8+ T细胞，减少调节性T细胞）。关于毒性机制，研究发现特定的供体菌群特征（富含Prevotella spp.）与双免疫检查点抑制剂（抗PD-1 + 抗CTLA-4）背景下的严重免疫相关不良事件（如心肌炎）存在情境依赖性关联。这种毒性风险在单药抗PD-1治疗中并未出现，提示供体选择需根据具体的ICI治疗方案进行优化。\\\", \\\"remaining_points\\\": [\\\"Prevotella spp. 诱导心肌炎的具体分子机制（如通过何种抗原或代谢物激活特定T细胞亚群）在本研究中仅表现为相关性，未深入解析其下游信号通路。\\\", \\\"虽然发现了基线有害菌丢失是疗效的关键预测因子，但哪些特定的丢失菌种组合对疗效贡献最大，以及是否可以通过定向清除而非全菌群移植来实现这一效果，仍需进一步研究。\\\"]}], \\\"plain_text\\\": \\\"\\\"}\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"allowed_use\": [],\n            \"conditions\": [],\n            \"limits\": [],\n            \"question\": \"FMT-LUMINate 试验的详细安全性数据及供体聚类分析是 Ch5/Ch6 核心证据，需深入解读其统计方法及毒性事件的具体临床特征。\",\n            \"sources\": [\n              {\n                \"doi\": \"10.1038/s41591-025-04186-5\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"071823eff68d7dbea395490dd4643170131b5f6a\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n                \"title\": \"Fecal microbiota transplantation plus immunotherapy in non-small cell lung cancer and melanoma: the phase 2 FMT-LUMINate trial\",\n                \"year\": \"2026\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"still_missing\": \"FMT-LUMINate 试验的详细安全性数据及供体聚类分析是 Ch5/Ch6 核心证据，需深入解读其统计方法及毒性事件的具体临床特征。\",\n            \"usable_content\": \"{\\\"question_material\\\": [{\\\"question_id\\\": \\\"Q01\\\", \\\"examples\\\": [{\\\"attribution\\\": \\\"本研究\\\", \\\"use_in_review\\\": \\\"提供FMT-LUMINate试验中安全性数据的详细统计结果、毒性事件的具体临床特征（如心肌炎发生率、起病时间）以及与供体微生物组相关的因果关联分析，作为核心证据支持关于FMT安全性的讨论。\\\", \\\"finding\\\": \\\"在NSCLC队列中，接受FMT联合抗PD-1治疗的患者未出现3级或更高不良事件（AEs），仅15%患者因2级AE使用皮质类固醇；而在黑色素瘤队列中，65%患者经历3级或更高AEs，其中腹泻/结肠炎占20%，心肌炎发生率为15%（3例），显著高于文献报道的<1%。独立数据和安全监测委员会（DSMC）判定该组合总体安全，但指出黑色素瘤队列中的严重AEs起病更早（中位40天 vs 文献60天）。聚类分析显示，来自富含普雷沃菌属（Prevotella spp.）的供体（特别是供体5）与3级及以上AEs的发生密切相关：所有由供体5提供的粪便导致黑色素瘤患者出现3级+ AEs，且2/3例心肌炎患者接受了供体5的FMT。这些毒性仅在双免疫检查点抑制剂（anti-PD-1 + anti-CTLA-4）背景下观察到，而在单药抗PD-1治疗中未出现。\\\", \\\"conditions\\\": \\\"研究对象为FMT-LUMINate试验中的NSCLC（n=20）和黑色素瘤（n=20）患者。NSCLC组接受单药抗PD-1（pembrolizumab），黑色素瘤组接受双免疫检查点抑制剂（nivolumab + ipilimumab）。供体聚类基于 shotgun metagenomic sequencing 数据，使用 Bray-Curtis 指数进行无监督聚类，并通过 PERMANOVA 评估组间差异。AEs分级依据 CTCAE v5.0。\\\", \\\"reference_ids\\\": []}, {\\\"attribution\\\": \\\"本研究\\\", \\\"use_in_review\\\": \\\"展示供体微生物组特征与免疫相关不良反应（irAEs）之间的机制性联系，特别是普雷沃菌属定植与特定T细胞亚群变化的关联，用于解释为何某些供体会增加毒性风险。\\\", \\\"finding\\\": \\\"通过无监督聚类分析，健康供体的肠道微生物组被分为两个 distinct clusters (P = 0.001)。Cluster B（包含供体5和11）以高丰度的普雷沃菌属（如 Segatella copri, Prevotella sp. Marseille-P4119, P. stercorea）为特征。在黑色素瘤患者中，接受 Cluster B 供体FMT后，出现3级+ AEs的患者中这些菌属显著富集（LDA score > 2, P < 0.05）。进一步分析显示，在接受双免疫检查点抑制剂治疗的患者中，S. copri 的定植与外周血中 CD4+ T细胞亚群比例增加相关（P = 0.026），而这种关联在单药抗PD-1治疗中不存在。这表明普雷沃菌属的定植是双免疫检查点抑制背景下毒性增加的驱动因素。\\\", \\\"conditions\\\": \\\"分析对象包括FMT-LUMINate黑色素瘤队列及之前发表的MIMIC试验（Phase 1, melanoma, anti-PD-1 monotherapy）数据。统计方法包括 Fisher's exact test 比较组间差异，LEfSe 进行线性判别分析效应大小，以及 Spearman's r 相关性分析微生物定植与免疫细胞频率的关系。\\\", \\\"reference_ids\\\": [\\\"R23\\\"]}], \\\"explanation\\\": \\\"本研究揭示了FMT联合ICI治疗的安全性与供体微生物组特征及ICI治疗方案之间的复杂相互作用。首先，FMT本身在NSCLC（单药抗PD-1）中表现出良好的耐受性，无3级以上AEs。然而，在黑色素瘤（双药抗PD-1/CTLA-4）中，虽然总体安全性被DSMC认可，但出现了加速发作的严重AEs，特别是心肌炎。这种毒性信号并非随机分布，而是与特定的供体微生物组特征紧密相关。通过供体聚类分析，研究发现富含普雷沃菌属（Prevotella spp.）的供体（Cluster B）与3级以上AEs的发生显著相关。机制上，这种关联依赖于ICI的治疗背景：普雷沃菌属的定植及其引发的CD4+ T细胞变化仅在双免疫检查点抑制（anti-PD-1 + anti-CTLA-4）条件下导致毒性，而在单药抗PD-1条件下不表现。这提示普雷沃菌属可能是双免疫检查点抑制背景下免疫相关不良反应的潜在驱动因子，强调了根据ICI方案选择合适供体的重要性。\\\", \\\"remaining_points\\\": [\\\"心肌炎的具体病理生理机制尚需进一步探索，尽管已将其列为特殊关注AE。\\\", \\\"供体筛选标准如何具体量化‘普雷沃菌属丰富度’阈值以排除高风险供体，文中未给出明确操作指南。\\\", \\\"长期随访中，这些早期AEs对最终肿瘤疗效是否有负面影响，文中提到数值上有关联但统计不显著，需更大样本验证。\\\"]}], \\\"plain_text\\\": \\\"\\\"}\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"allowed_use\": [],\n            \"conditions\": [],\n            \"limits\": [],\n            \"question\": \"FMT-LUMINate 试验的详细安全性数据及供体聚类分析是本章核心证据，需深入解读其统计方法及毒性事件的具体临床特征。\",\n            \"sources\": [\n              {\n                \"doi\": \"10.1038/s41591-025-04186-5\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"071823eff68d7dbea395490dd4643170131b5f6a\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n                \"title\": \"Fecal microbiota transplantation plus immunotherapy in non-small cell lung cancer and melanoma: the phase 2 FMT-LUMINate trial\",\n                \"year\": \"2026\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"still_missing\": \"FMT-LUMINate 试验的详细安全性数据及供体聚类分析是本章核心证据，需深入解读其统计方法及毒性事件的具体临床特征。\",\n            \"usable_content\": \"{\\\"question_material\\\": [{\\\"question_id\\\": \\\"Q01\\\", \\\"examples\\\": [{\\\"attribution\\\": \\\"本研究\\\", \\\"use_in_review\\\": \\\"提供FMT-LUMINate试验中关于安全性数据的具体统计结果、毒性事件临床特征（特别是心肌炎和腹泻/结肠炎的发作时间），以及供体微生物组聚类分析与免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）关联的详细机制证据。\\\", \\\"finding\\\": \\\"在黑色素瘤队列中，19名患者（95%）出现任何级别的与治疗相关的不良事件（AEs），其中12名（60%）出现3级或更高级别的AEs，1名出现4级AEs。最常见的3级或以上AE是腹泻或结肠炎（20%的患者）。有3名患者（15%）发生心肌炎，这高于文献报道的<1%的发生率。严重毒性的中位发作时间为开始抗PD-1和抗CTLA-4治疗后的40天，早于文献报告的60天。独立数据和安全监测委员会（DSMC）认为这些严重AEs比既往文献报道的发作更早。在NSCLC队列中，没有患者出现3级或更高级别的AEs。通过非监督聚类分析，健康供体的肠道微生物组被分为两个截然不同的簇（P = 0.001）。B簇（包含供体5和供体11）以高丰度的Prevotella spp.为特征。差异丰度分析证实，P. sp. Marseille-P4119、P. stercorea和Prevotellaceae GGB1146 SGB1472在接受双免疫检查点抑制剂治疗的黑色素瘤患者中，若发生3级或以上AEs则显著富集。后FMT定植的P. sp. Marseille-P4119、P. stercorea和Prevotellaceae SGB1472与3级或以上AEs显著相关（P < 0.001, P = 0.023, P < 0.001）。供体5提供的粪便在所有接受双ICI治疗的黑色素瘤患者中均导致3级或以上AEs，且两名发生快速发作心肌炎的患者均接受了来自供体5的FMT。然而，当仅使用抗PD-1单药治疗时（如之前的MIMIC试验中的供体5数据或本研究的NSCLC队列），来自Cluster B的供体并未引起毒性。综合所有经历3级或以上AEs的患者（包括当前研究和之前的MIMIC试验），来自Cluster B供体的粪便仅在联合PD-1和CTLA-4阻断的患者中引起毒性（P = 0.051）。\\\", \\\"conditions\\\": \\\"研究对象为FMT-LUMINate试验中的非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC, n=20）和黑色素瘤（n=20）患者。黑色素瘤患者接受FMT联合抗PD-1（nivolumab）和抗CTLA-4（ipilimumab）治疗；NSCLC患者接受FMT联合抗PD-1（pembrolizumab）治疗。供体聚类基于41个来自9名供体的样本进行Bray-Curtis不相似度分析。AEs分级依据CTCAE v5.0。\\\", \\\"reference_ids\\\": []}], \\\"explanation\\\": \\\"本研究揭示了FMT结合不同免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）背景下的安全性差异及其潜在的微生物机制。首先，FMT联合抗PD-1在NSCLC中表现出良好的安全性，无3级或以上AEs；而在联合抗PD-1和抗CTLA-4的黑色素瘤中，虽然总体安全性被DSMC判定为可接受，但出现了加速发作的严重免疫相关不良事件（irAEs），特别是心肌炎和中位发作时间提前至40天。其次，供体微生物组的组成决定了这种毒性风险。通过非监督聚类，供体被分为富含Prevotella spp.的Cluster B和其他Cluster A。Cluster B供体（特别是供体5）与严重的irAEs（包括心肌炎）密切相关，但这种关联具有严格的上下文依赖性：它仅在抗CTLA-4存在的情况下显现，而在抗PD-1单药治疗背景下不引发毒性。这表明特定的微生物类群（如Prevotella spp.）与ICI骨架之间存在情境依赖性的相互作用，可能驱动了双重阻断下的过度免疫反应。因此，供体选择对于未来FMT试验的安全性至关重要，特别是当联合使用抗CTLA-4时。\\\", \\\"remaining_points\\\": [\\\"心肌炎的具体病理生理机制尚需进一步探索，尽管观察到其与特定菌属定植及CD4+ T细胞亚群变化的关联。\\\", \\\"供体筛选标准如何具体量化以避免Cluster B供体，目前仅指出需排除此类供体。\\\"]}], \\\"plain_text\\\": \\\"\\\"}\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"allowed_use\": [],\n            \"conditions\": [],\n            \"limits\": [],\n            \"question\": \"FMT-LUMINate 试验中 FMT 联合 ICI 的 ORR 数据是多少？供体菌群特征（如 Prevotella）与毒性（心肌炎）的关联机制是什么？\",\n            \"sources\": [\n              {\n                \"doi\": \"10.1038/s41591-025-04186-5\",\n                \"material_depth\": \"\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"071823eff68d7dbea395490dd4643170131b5f6a\",\n                \"reading_role\": \"\",\n                \"section_path\": [],\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n                \"title\": \"Fecal microbiota transplantation plus immunotherapy in non-small cell lung cancer and melanoma: the phase 2 FMT-LUMINate trial\",\n                \"year\": \"2026\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"still_missing\": \"FMT-LUMINate 试验中 FMT 联合 ICI 的 ORR 数据是多少？供体菌群特征（如 Prevotella）与毒性（心肌炎）的关联机制是什么？\",\n            \"usable_content\": \"{\\\"question_material\\\": [{\\\"question_id\\\": \\\"Q01\\\", \\\"examples\\\": [{\\\"attribution\\\": \\\"本研究\\\", \\\"use_in_review\\\": \\\"提供FMT联合ICI在NSCLC和黑色素瘤一线治疗中的客观缓解率（ORR）具体数据，以及安全性特征。\\\", \\\"finding\\\": \\\"在FMT-LUMINate试验中，接受健康供体FMT联合抗PD-1单药治疗的非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者（n=20），其客观缓解率（ORR）为80%（16/20），超过了预设的64%主要终点阈值。在黑色素瘤队列中，接受FMT联合抗PD-1加抗CTLA-4双免疫检查点抑制剂治疗的患者（n=20），ORR为75%（15/20）。\\\", \\\"conditions\\\": \\\"NSCLC队列：一线治疗，无驱动基因突变，PD-L1 TPS ≥ 50%，使用帕博利珠单抗（pembrolizumab）。黑色素瘤队列：一线或既往辅助治疗后复发>6个月，使用纳武利尤单抗（nivolumab）联合伊匹木单抗（ipilimumab）。\\\", \\\"reference_ids\\\": []}, {\\\"attribution\\\": \\\"本研究\\\", \\\"use_in_review\\\": \\\"揭示供体菌群特征（Prevotella富集）与特定毒性（心肌炎、3级及以上AEs）的关联机制，强调治疗背景（双免疫抑制 vs 单药）的关键调节作用。\\\", \\\"finding\\\": \\\"供体微生物组聚类显示，Cluster B（包含供体5和11）以高丰度的普雷沃菌属（Prevotella spp.，如Segatella copri, Prevotella sp. Marseille-P4119, P. stercorea）为特征。在黑色素瘤队列中，接受Cluster B供体（特别是供体5）FMT的患者发生了严重的免疫相关不良事件（irAEs），包括3例心肌炎（发生率15%），且发病时间显著提前（中位40天，而文献报道通常为60天）。其中2例心肌炎患者均接受了供体5的FMT，发病迅速（分别为第22天和第25天）。统计分析显示，Cluster B供体的粪便仅在双PD-1和CTLA-4阻断背景下导致毒性（P=0.051），而在抗PD-1单药治疗背景下未观察到此类毒性。此外，S. copri的定植与这些严重AEs患者外周血中CD4+ T细胞亚群增加相关。\\\", \\\"conditions\\\": \\\"比较对象：接受不同供体FMT的患者；治疗背景对比：黑色素瘤队列（双ICI）vs NSCLC队列及既往MIMIC试验（均为抗PD-1单药）。供体5在MIMIC试验（抗PD-1单药）中提供的7次FMT均未导致3级及以上AEs，而在本试验黑色素瘤队列中导致的FMT均伴随严重AEs。\\\", \\\"reference_ids\\\": []}], \\\"explanation\\\": \\\"该研究阐明了FMT增强ICI疗效的机制并非主要依赖于供体菌株的定植或供主微生物组的相似度，而是取决于患者基线有害菌群的清除。具体来说，响应者（Responders）在接受FMT后表现出比非响应者更显著的基线细菌物种丢失（SGB loss），特别是那些已知与ICI耐药相关的有害菌属（如Enterocloster, Clostridium, Streptococcus等）。这种有害菌的消除导致了色氨酸代谢途径的减弱，降低了血浆中喹啉酸（quinolinic acid）和犬尿氨酸（kynurenine）的水平，从而改善了免疫代谢微环境（增加效应CD8+ T细胞，减少调节性T细胞）。关于毒性机制，研究发现特定的供体菌群特征（富含Prevotella spp.）与双免疫检查点抑制剂（抗PD-1 + 抗CTLA-4）背景下的严重免疫相关不良事件（如心肌炎）存在情境依赖性关联。这种毒性风险在单药抗PD-1治疗中并未出现，提示供体选择需根据具体的ICI治疗方案进行优化。\\\", \\\"remaining_points\\\": [\\\"Prevotella spp. 诱导心肌炎的具体分子机制（如通过何种抗原或代谢物激活特定T细胞亚群）在本研究中仅表现为相关性，未深入解析其下游信号通路。\\\", \\\"虽然发现了基线有害菌丢失是疗效的关键预测因子，但哪些特定的丢失菌种组合对疗效贡献最大，以及是否可以通过定向清除而非全菌群移植来实现这一效果，仍需进一步研究。\\\"]}], \\\"plain_text\\\": \\\"\\\"}\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2bb6ad04fca560d182cec1f4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::23b203078daf59896544114b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\",\n          \"snapshot::2796f4a95907dc27585d9be6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f68ab6ce48799e6ca1058cd3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用单臂、开放标签的IIa期篮子试验设计。纳入标准包括ICI治疗后疾病进展、ECOG评分0-1及可测量病灶。供体需为ICI长期响应者（>12个月响应）。干预措施包括基线后第1周和第5周通过结肠镜进行两次FMT，随后在第14、30、78周可通过灌肠进行最多三次补充FMT。ICI治疗保持不变或重新引入。主要终点评估安全性和ORR（基于iRECIST）。次要终点包括可行性、临床获益率、无进展生存期（PFS）、总生存期（OS）、微生物定植（16S rRNA测序）、免疫反应（质谱流式细胞术分析PBMCs）及生物标志物（血清细胞因子）。统计分析采用描述性统计、Kaplan-Meier生存分析及Cox比例风险模型探索免疫特征与预后的关联，未进行多重检验校正。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\",\n          \"snapshot::2796f4a95907dc27585d9be6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::35e4bb77f5eebd2aa771b705\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"证实了在ICI耐药的晚期实体瘤患者中，使用ICI响应者供体的FMT是安全和可行的。提供了关于FMT后微生物定植动力学（短暂性）和系统性免疫景观（髓系抑制与T细胞活化）的详细生物标志物数据。\",\n          \"limits\": \"样本量小（n=12），试验因入组缓慢提前终止。单臂设计无法确立因果关系，缺乏对照组。未能实现预期的临床疗效（无ORR），限制了对其机制解释的确定性。结果可能受到快速进展性疾病背景的影响，未能在足够长的时间内观察FMT的潜在延迟效应。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\",\n          \"snapshot::2796f4a95907dc27585d9be6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::59a3a7b73308240f96ffb39c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"12名ICI耐药晚期实体瘤患者，接受来自ICI响应者的FMT联合ICI治疗\",\n          \"finding\": \"FMT安全性良好，无严重FMT相关不良事件导致停药，但50%患者出现免疫相关不良事件（irAEs），多数为轻度。客观缓解率（ORR）为0%，中位PFS为1.5个月，中位OS为10.1个月。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\",\n          \"snapshot::2796f4a95907dc27585d9be6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::da136020eae35e8a2dfc6af1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"微生物组分析\",\n          \"finding\": \"首次FMT后一周，大多数受体的微生物组向供体方向偏移（定植成功），但这种相似性在后续时间点大多下降，表明定植多为暂时性。仅1名获得临床获益的患者实现了持久的供体-受体微生物相似性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\",\n          \"snapshot::2796f4a95907dc27585d9be6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0836a8c74dab91d3a0b4f4ce\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"免疫微环境分析\",\n          \"finding\": \"基线时高度分化的T细胞环境（CD8+效应记忆T细胞和TEMRA）与改善的PFS和OS相关；而髓系偏倚环境和幼稚T细胞表型预后较差。CD14+单核细胞和血清IL-8水平随时间增加，高水平的CD14+单核细胞与较短的PFS和OS相关。这些免疫特征与预后的关联在使用ICI治疗起始日期重新计算时依然成立，提示其反映的是宿主对免疫治疗的固有反应能力，而非FMT的直接因果效应。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\",\n          \"snapshot::2796f4a95907dc27585d9be6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::aa9a46960936e1395aed9137\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\",\n          \"snapshot::2796f4a95907dc27585d9be6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bbf51165ebd9be173e979c8e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"早期研究表明FMT可能逆转ICI耐药，但其适用性在其他肿瘤类型中尚不明确，且关于患者选择、供体选择及给药方案的问题仍未解决。本研究试图回答：在ICI耐药的晚期实体瘤患者中，重复FMT是否安全可行，以及是否能通过微生物定植和免疫重塑来恢复ICI的疗效。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\",\n          \"snapshot::2796f4a95907dc27585d9be6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3fb7c28aa6d5a8423ece0135\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"针对晚期实体瘤（黑色素瘤、头颈部鳞癌、肾细胞癌、微卫星不稳定性高胰腺癌）中免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）耐药或进展的患者，评估来自ICI长期响应者的粪菌移植（FMT）联合ICI治疗的安全性和有效性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\",\n          \"snapshot::2796f4a95907dc27585d9be6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b0ae5567370b869d8e867f54\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究是一项单臂IIa期篮子试验（MITRIC），旨在验证通过FMT调节肠道微生物群能否克服已建立的ICI耐药性。研究纳入了12名在转移性阶段对ICI治疗进展的患者，使用ICI长期响应者作为供体，给予患者最多五次FMT（前两次通过结肠镜，后续通过灌肠），并继续原有ICI治疗。主要终点为FMT相关不良事件和客观缓解率（ORR）。结果显示FMT安全性良好，但未能观察到客观肿瘤反应（ORR为0%），仅5名患者达到疾病稳定。尽管缺乏总体疗效证据，研究发现FMT诱导了短暂的微生物定植，且外周血中的免疫细胞特征（如分化T细胞与髓系细胞的平衡）与生存期显著相关，但这些免疫特征似乎更多反映疾病本身状态而非FMT的特异性干预效果。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\",\n          \"snapshot::2796f4a95907dc27585d9be6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3fb862a9266fa81e78d243db\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅适用于ICI耐药/进展人群，不能外推至一线治疗场景。样本量极小，结果可能存在偶然性，但趋势明确。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了FMT在广泛ICI耐药实体瘤队列中的真实世界疗效数据：ORR为0%，中位PFS仅为1.5个月。这表明在非选择性、快速进展的耐药人群中，FMT联合ICI并非有效的挽救疗法。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\",\n          \"snapshot::2796f4a95907dc27585d9be6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b6331b5c08533653c791a8b8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"免疫关联分析为探索性，未校正多重检验，且缺乏对照组，无法证明FMT改变了这些免疫特征从而改善了预后。仅描述了相关性，未证明因果机制。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"揭示了FMT干预后系统性免疫景观的变化及其与预后的关联：(1) FMT诱导的微生物定植多为暂时性，仅持久定植者与临床获益相关；(2) 基线高分化T细胞表型预示更好预后，而高髓系细胞（CD14+）和高IL-8水平预示不良预后；(3) 这些免疫特征似乎反映了宿主固有的免疫反应能力，而非FMT直接重塑的结果。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\",\n          \"snapshot::2796f4a95907dc27585d9be6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::38d60665b7ae5ef0786b2453\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"研究讨论了使用ICI响应者作为供体的局限性（微生物组成差异大），以及不同研究间供体数量（单供体vs多供体）对结果的潜在影响。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\",\n          \"snapshot::2796f4a95907dc27585d9be6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fd300138b8a38b7318335545\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"比较了结肠镜给药（前两次）和灌肠给药（后续）的可行性及耐受性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\",\n          \"snapshot::2796f4a95907dc27585d9be6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d1c0f5c1558648ba8264b5ed\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究的阴性结果主要归因于患者群体的快速进展特性和小样本量，不应将其解读为FMT在所有情况下均无效，而应视为特定情境下的失败尝试。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\",\n          \"snapshot::2796f4a95907dc27585d9be6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::602293d8d060926ae50da0a3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"免疫生物标志物的发现是探索性的，且可能与ICI治疗本身的效应混淆，需谨慎解读其作为FMT特异性机制的作用。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\",\n          \"snapshot::2796f4a95907dc27585d9be6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d04d310196a133922df7cbd6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"微生物定植的暂时性并不必然意味着临床无效，因为唯一获益患者的持久定植提示了两者间的潜在联系，但这仅是个案观察。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\",\n          \"snapshot::2796f4a95907dc27585d9be6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::224d056381af07f5414ea73a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"deep_read_material\",\n          \"current_question_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"attribution\": \"本研究 (MITRIC trial)\",\n              \"conditions\": \"研究对象为12名接受过多种治疗的晚期实体瘤患者（9例黑色素瘤，1例HNSCC，1例ccRCC，1例MSI-H胰腺癌），均处于ICI治疗后的疾病进展期。供体为3名长期ICI反应者。干预措施包括结肠镜给药的初始FMT和灌肠后续FMT。\",\n              \"finding\": \"在12名ICI耐药实体瘤患者中，FMT联合ICI治疗未观察到客观缓解（ORR 0%）。尽管FMT安全且可行，但临床获益有限。机制分析显示，基线时髓系偏倚环境和幼稚T细胞表型与较差预后相关；治疗后CD14+单核细胞和血清IL-8水平升高，这与较短的PFS和OS相关，表明FMT未能逆转这种不利的免疫微环境，甚至可能伴随髓系驱动的免疫抑制增加。\",\n              \"reference_ids\": [],\n              \"use_in_review\": \"提供阴性结果的详细解释，特别是关于患者选择（快速进展、晚期）、供体匹配（多供体 vs 单供体）及免疫微环境限制（髓系主导、IL-8升高），用于平衡Ch5中的阳性结果。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"attribution\": \"Baruch et al. (2021)\",\n              \"conditions\": \"研究对象为抗PD-1耐受的转移性黑色素瘤患者。所有反应者均接受来自单一供体的粪便。\",\n              \"finding\": \"在一项针对抗PD-1耐受的转移性黑色素瘤患者的概念验证试验中，使用粪便微生物移植（FMT）实现了3/10患者的客观缓解，另有3名患者获得持久的疾病稳定。\",\n              \"reference_ids\": [\n                \"R19\"\n              ],\n              \"use_in_review\": \"作为对比背景，展示阳性结果中使用的单一供体策略和特定患者群体，以突显MITRIC试验中多供体和不同患者选择带来的差异。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"attribution\": \"Davar et al. (2021)\",\n              \"conditions\": \"研究对象为抗PD-1耐受的转移性黑色素瘤患者。\",\n              \"finding\": \"在一项针对抗PD-1耐受的转移性黑色素瘤患者的试验中，FMT使3/15患者产生反应，另有3名患者获得持久的疾病稳定。响应者在FMT/抗PD-1治疗后表现出外周血中CD56+CD8+ T细胞水平升高，且这些细胞表达更高的激活标记物；同时，响应者体内循环IL-8降低，肿瘤内产生IL-8的髓系细胞频率减少。\",\n              \"reference_ids\": [\n                \"R18\"\n              ],\n              \"use_in_review\": \"作为对比背景，展示阳性结果中观察到的免疫学变化（如CD56+CD8+ T细胞增加、IL-8降低），与MITRIC试验中的阴性结果形成机制上的对比。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"attribution\": \"Kim et al. (2024)\",\n              \"conditions\": \"研究对象为抗PD-1抑制剂耐药的不可切除或转移性实体瘤患者，主要为上消化道癌症。\",\n              \"finding\": \"在抗PD-1抑制剂耐药的不可切除或转移性实体瘤患者中，FMT改善了1/13名上消化道癌症患者的抗PD-1抑制剂疗效。\",\n              \"reference_ids\": [\n                \"R20\"\n              ],\n              \"use_in_review\": \"作为对比背景，展示在其他实体瘤（上消化道癌）中FMT的潜在疗效，说明癌症类型和疾病状态对结果的影响。\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"explanation\": \"MITRIC试验的阴性结果提示，FMT在克服ICI耐药方面并非普遍有效，其效果受到患者选择、供体匹配和免疫微环境状态的严格限制。\\n\\n首先，患者选择是关键因素。与之前报告阳性结果的试验（如Baruch等和Davar等）相比，MITRIC试验中的患者大多患有扩散迅速、生长快速的疾病，这可能没有给予FMT足够的时间来发挥有意义的生物学效应。此外，MITRIC试验纳入了原发性和继发性ICI耐药患者，而之前的研究主要关注继发性耐药或特定类型的耐药，这可能导致了结果的异质性。\\n\\n其次，供体匹配和多样性可能影响疗效。MITRIC试验使用了三名不同的供体，而Baruch等人的研究中所有反应者均来自单一供体。这表明，使用多名供体可能导致供体-受体匹配次优，或者缺乏对特定获益至关重要的微生物群落。供体的微生物组成存在显著差异，且目前尚不清楚使用ICI反应者作为供体是否优于健康供体。\\n\\n最后，免疫微环境的限制是重要的机制解释。MITRIC试验发现，基线时髓系偏倚环境和幼稚T细胞表型与较差的预后相关。治疗后，CD14+单核细胞和血清IL-8水平升高，这与较短的PFS和OS相关。相比之下，Davar等人的研究发现响应者体内IL-8降低，且髓系细胞产生的IL-8减少。这表明，在MITRIC试验的患者群体中，FMT未能逆转由髓系驱动的免疫抑制微环境，甚至可能伴随着这种抑制的增加，从而限制了临床获益。因此，FMT可能仅在具有特定免疫特征（如高分化T细胞环境、低髓系浸润）的选定人群中有效，而可靠的生物标志物尚未建立。\",\n          \"question_id\": \"Q01\",\n          \"remaining_points\": [\n            \"MITRIC试验样本量小，且为单臂研究，无法进行因果推断或多重检验校正，因此关于免疫微环境和生物标志物的发现应谨慎解读。\",\n            \"长期定植的效果难以评估，因为大多数患者在疾病进展后无法收集后续的粪便样本。\",\n            \"需要进一步的研究来确定FMT的最佳给药方案、供体选择标准以及能够预测获益的患者亚群。\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::49d98c7f1b143d31120d9835\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"deep_read_material\",\n          \"paper_title\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Safety and efficacy of fecal microbiota transplantation in solid cancers resistant to immune checkpoint inhibitors: results of the MITRIC trial\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::74660f9101b72ae9aef33244\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"deep_read_material\",\n          \"plain_text\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::474c7e797e5493a25ea68330\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"deep_read_material\",\n          \"prior_question_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"attribution\": \"本研究\",\n              \"conditions\": \"研究对象为 ICI 治疗期间或治疗后进展的晚期实体瘤患者；供体为长期 ICI 响应者；干预措施为结肠镜和灌肠给予的重复 FMT 联合持续或重新引入的 ICI 治疗；评估标准采用 iRECIST。\",\n              \"finding\": \"MITRIC 试验为一项单臂 IIa 期篮子试验，纳入 12 名对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）耐药的晚期实体瘤患者（黑色素瘤 n=9, ccRCC n=1, HNSCC n=1, MSI-H 胰腺癌 n=1）。主要终点客观缓解率（ORR）为 0/12（0%），未观察到任何客观缓解（部分或完全缓解）。5 名患者达到最佳稳定疾病（SD），7 名患者进展（PD）。中位无进展生存期（PFS）为 1.5 个月，中位总生存期（OS）为 10.1 个月。仅 1 名黑色素瘤患者获得协议定义的临床获益（SD >6 个月），另 2 名患者出现混合反应（部分病灶消退）。\",\n              \"reference_ids\": [],\n              \"use_in_review\": \"提供 FMT 在 ICI 耐药/难治性实体瘤患者中的具体疗效数据（ORR, PFS, OS），并展示阴性结果的具体表现，作为该人群疗效局限性的直接证据。\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"explanation\": \"作者对 MITRIC 试验结果为阴性的解释主要集中在患者选择、疾病特征及供体匹配等方面：\\n1. **患者选择与疾病进展速度**：既往研究（如 Baruch et al., Davar et al.）中的响应往往发生较晚，且有时 preceded by pseudo-progression（假性进展）。而 MITRIC 中的大多数患者表现为弥漫性、快速生长的疾病，可能没有足够的时间让 FMT 发挥有意义的生物学效应。\\n2. **供体匹配与异质性**：虽然既往研究中所有响应者均接受单一供体的粪便，而本试验使用了三名供体，可能存在次优的供体-受体匹配或缺乏产生获益所需的特定微生物群落。此外，ICI 响应者之间的微生物组成差异很大，使用健康供体是否更优尚不清楚。\\n3. **免疫微环境限制**：基线时髓系偏倚环境和幼稚 T 细胞表型与较差预后相关，且 FMT 未能逆转这种不利的髓系主导免疫环境（事实上 CD14+ 单核细胞和 IL-8 随时间增加，这与较短的 PFS 和 OS 相关）。这表明 FMT 可能仅在选定的具有特定免疫特征的人群中有效。\\n4. **样本量与异质性**：小样本量是重要局限性，且不同研究在供体选择、FMT 制备、给药途径和治疗方案上的异质性也可能影响结果。\",\n          \"question_id\": \"Q01\",\n          \"remaining_points\": [\n            \"FMT 在 ICI 耐药人群中的最佳生物标志物筛选标准尚未确立。\",\n            \"供体选择（ICI 响应者 vs 健康供体）及个体化匹配策略对疗效的具体影响仍需进一步研究。\",\n            \"FMT 是否能通过改变外周血免疫表型（如减少髓系抑制）来增强疗效，目前数据不支持其诱导了显著的全身免疫改变。\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f6a147f41d39b13a9ab869ee\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"deep_read_material\",\n          \"question_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"attribution\": \"本研究\",\n              \"conditions\": \"研究对象为 ICI 治疗期间或治疗后进展的晚期实体瘤患者；供体为长期 ICI 响应者；干预措施为结肠镜和灌肠给予的重复 FMT 联合持续或重新引入的 ICI 治疗；评估标准采用 iRECIST。\",\n              \"finding\": \"MITRIC 试验为一项单臂 IIa 期篮子试验，纳入 12 名对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）耐药的晚期实体瘤患者（黑色素瘤 n=9, ccRCC n=1, HNSCC n=1, MSI-H 胰腺癌 n=1）。主要终点客观缓解率（ORR）为 0/12（0%），未观察到任何客观缓解（部分或完全缓解）。5 名患者达到最佳稳定疾病（SD），7 名患者进展（PD）。中位无进展生存期（PFS）为 1.5 个月，中位总生存期（OS）为 10.1 个月。仅 1 名黑色素瘤患者获得协议定义的临床获益（SD >6 个月），另 2 名患者出现混合反应（部分病灶消退）。\",\n              \"reference_ids\": [],\n              \"use_in_review\": \"提供 FMT 在 ICI 耐药/难治性实体瘤患者中的具体疗效数据（ORR, PFS, OS），并展示阴性结果的具体表现，作为该人群疗效局限性的直接证据。\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"explanation\": \"作者对 MITRIC 试验结果为阴性的解释主要集中在患者选择、疾病特征及供体匹配等方面：\\n1. **患者选择与疾病进展速度**：既往研究（如 Baruch et al., Davar et al.）中的响应往往发生较晚，且有时 preceded by pseudo-progression（假性进展）。而 MITRIC 中的大多数患者表现为弥漫性、快速生长的疾病，可能没有足够的时间让 FMT 发挥有意义的生物学效应。\\n2. **供体匹配与异质性**：虽然既往研究中所有响应者均接受单一供体的粪便，而本试验使用了三名供体，可能存在次优的供体-受体匹配或缺乏产生获益所需的特定微生物群落。此外，ICI 响应者之间的微生物组成差异很大，使用健康供体是否更优尚不清楚。\\n3. **免疫微环境限制**：基线时髓系偏倚环境和幼稚 T 细胞表型与较差预后相关，且 FMT 未能逆转这种不利的髓系主导免疫环境（事实上 CD14+ 单核细胞和 IL-8 随时间增加，这与较短的 PFS 和 OS 相关）。这表明 FMT 可能仅在选定的具有特定免疫特征的人群中有效。\\n4. **样本量与异质性**：小样本量是重要局限性，且不同研究在供体选择、FMT 制备、给药途径和治疗方案上的异质性也可能影响结果。\",\n          \"question_id\": \"Q01\",\n          \"remaining_points\": [\n            \"FMT 在 ICI 耐药人群中的最佳生物标志物筛选标准尚未确立。\",\n            \"供体选择（ICI 响应者 vs 健康供体）及个体化匹配策略对疗效的具体影响仍需进一步研究。\",\n            \"FMT 是否能通过改变外周血免疫表型（如减少髓系抑制）来增强疗效，目前数据不支持其诱导了显著的全身免疫改变。\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6597e99daf38ab354bfeeb09\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"deep_read_material\",\n          \"question_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"attribution\": \"本研究 (MITRIC trial)\",\n              \"conditions\": \"研究对象为12名接受过多种治疗的晚期实体瘤患者（9例黑色素瘤，1例HNSCC，1例ccRCC，1例MSI-H胰腺癌），均处于ICI治疗后的疾病进展期。供体为3名长期ICI反应者。干预措施包括结肠镜给药的初始FMT和灌肠后续FMT。\",\n              \"finding\": \"在12名ICI耐药实体瘤患者中，FMT联合ICI治疗未观察到客观缓解（ORR 0%）。尽管FMT安全且可行，但临床获益有限。机制分析显示，基线时髓系偏倚环境和幼稚T细胞表型与较差预后相关；治疗后CD14+单核细胞和血清IL-8水平升高，这与较短的PFS和OS相关，表明FMT未能逆转这种不利的免疫微环境，甚至可能伴随髓系驱动的免疫抑制增加。\",\n              \"reference_ids\": [],\n              \"use_in_review\": \"提供阴性结果的详细解释，特别是关于患者选择（快速进展、晚期）、供体匹配（多供体 vs 单供体）及免疫微环境限制（髓系主导、IL-8升高），用于平衡Ch5中的阳性结果。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"attribution\": \"Baruch et al. (2021)\",\n              \"conditions\": \"研究对象为抗PD-1耐受的转移性黑色素瘤患者。所有反应者均接受来自单一供体的粪便。\",\n              \"finding\": \"在一项针对抗PD-1耐受的转移性黑色素瘤患者的概念验证试验中，使用粪便微生物移植（FMT）实现了3/10患者的客观缓解，另有3名患者获得持久的疾病稳定。\",\n              \"reference_ids\": [\n                \"R19\"\n              ],\n              \"use_in_review\": \"作为对比背景，展示阳性结果中使用的单一供体策略和特定患者群体，以突显MITRIC试验中多供体和不同患者选择带来的差异。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"attribution\": \"Davar et al. (2021)\",\n              \"conditions\": \"研究对象为抗PD-1耐受的转移性黑色素瘤患者。\",\n              \"finding\": \"在一项针对抗PD-1耐受的转移性黑色素瘤患者的试验中，FMT使3/15患者产生反应，另有3名患者获得持久的疾病稳定。响应者在FMT/抗PD-1治疗后表现出外周血中CD56+CD8+ T细胞水平升高，且这些细胞表达更高的激活标记物；同时，响应者体内循环IL-8降低，肿瘤内产生IL-8的髓系细胞频率减少。\",\n              \"reference_ids\": [\n                \"R18\"\n              ],\n              \"use_in_review\": \"作为对比背景，展示阳性结果中观察到的免疫学变化（如CD56+CD8+ T细胞增加、IL-8降低），与MITRIC试验中的阴性结果形成机制上的对比。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"attribution\": \"Kim et al. (2024)\",\n              \"conditions\": \"研究对象为抗PD-1抑制剂耐药的不可切除或转移性实体瘤患者，主要为上消化道癌症。\",\n              \"finding\": \"在抗PD-1抑制剂耐药的不可切除或转移性实体瘤患者中，FMT改善了1/13名上消化道癌症患者的抗PD-1抑制剂疗效。\",\n              \"reference_ids\": [\n                \"R20\"\n              ],\n              \"use_in_review\": \"作为对比背景，展示在其他实体瘤（上消化道癌）中FMT的潜在疗效，说明癌症类型和疾病状态对结果的影响。\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"explanation\": \"MITRIC试验的阴性结果提示，FMT在克服ICI耐药方面并非普遍有效，其效果受到患者选择、供体匹配和免疫微环境状态的严格限制。\\n\\n首先，患者选择是关键因素。与之前报告阳性结果的试验（如Baruch等和Davar等）相比，MITRIC试验中的患者大多患有扩散迅速、生长快速的疾病，这可能没有给予FMT足够的时间来发挥有意义的生物学效应。此外，MITRIC试验纳入了原发性和继发性ICI耐药患者，而之前的研究主要关注继发性耐药或特定类型的耐药，这可能导致了结果的异质性。\\n\\n其次，供体匹配和多样性可能影响疗效。MITRIC试验使用了三名不同的供体，而Baruch等人的研究中所有反应者均来自单一供体。这表明，使用多名供体可能导致供体-受体匹配次优，或者缺乏对特定获益至关重要的微生物群落。供体的微生物组成存在显著差异，且目前尚不清楚使用ICI反应者作为供体是否优于健康供体。\\n\\n最后，免疫微环境的限制是重要的机制解释。MITRIC试验发现，基线时髓系偏倚环境和幼稚T细胞表型与较差的预后相关。治疗后，CD14+单核细胞和血清IL-8水平升高，这与较短的PFS和OS相关。相比之下，Davar等人的研究发现响应者体内IL-8降低，且髓系细胞产生的IL-8减少。这表明，在MITRIC试验的患者群体中，FMT未能逆转由髓系驱动的免疫抑制微环境，甚至可能伴随着这种抑制的增加，从而限制了临床获益。因此，FMT可能仅在具有特定免疫特征（如高分化T细胞环境、低髓系浸润）的选定人群中有效，而可靠的生物标志物尚未建立。\",\n          \"question_id\": \"Q01\",\n          \"remaining_points\": [\n            \"MITRIC试验样本量小，且为单臂研究，无法进行因果推断或多重检验校正，因此关于免疫微环境和生物标志物的发现应谨慎解读。\",\n            \"长期定植的效果难以评估，因为大多数患者在疾病进展后无法收集后续的粪便样本。\",\n            \"需要进一步的研究来确定FMT的最佳给药方案、供体选择标准以及能够预测获益的患者亚群。\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fe5e2b03a837721c9a331e97\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"deep_read_material\",\n          \"questions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"gap_key\": \"MITRIC 试验阴性结果需详细提取其关于患者选择、供体匹配及免疫微环境限制的解释，以平衡 Ch5 中的阳性结果。\",\n          \"purpose\": \"Supply a concrete, attributed case for the coordinated review.\",\n          \"question\": \"MITRIC 试验阴性结果需详细提取其关于患者选择、供体匹配及免疫微环境限制的解释，以平衡 Ch5 中的阳性结果。\",\n          \"question_id\": \"Q01\",\n          \"required_output_ids\": [\n            \"O01\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5b8ed4ce6c977fbd7aecee5c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"supplement_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"auxiliary_material\": \"The study provides mechanistic insights into why efficacy may be limited in certain contexts. It found that microbiota engraftment from donors was transient in most recipients, with durable engraftment observed only in the single patient who achieved clinical benefit. Mass cytometry analysis revealed that a baseline myeloid-dominant environment (high CD14+ monocytes) and high serum IL-8 were associated with poorer outcomes, while an activated T-cell signature was favorable. These immune features appeared to reflect the host's underlying disease state rather than being directly modified by FMT to improve outcomes. Additionally, the review planning material notes that this study highlights challenges in donor selection (using ICI responders vs healthy donors) and patient heterogeneity (rapidly progressive disease vs stable disease), suggesting that FMT efficacy is highly context-dependent.\",\n          \"evidence\": [],\n          \"gap_id\": \"large_scale_rct_results\",\n          \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\progressive_review_plan\\\\20260924_microbiome\\\\run01\\\\level1\\\\supplements\\\\large_scale_rct_results\\\\source_units\\\\SU02_search_candidate_fc8af41423\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n          \"limitations\": [],\n          \"material_ready\": true,\n          \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n          \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n          \"remaining_gap\": \"The gap question asks for confirmation of completed large-scale Phase III randomized controlled trials confirming microbiome intervention efficacy. This study is explicitly identified as a 'single-arm phase IIa' trial. It is neither Phase III nor randomized. Therefore, it does not fulfill the success criterion of providing data from a completed Phase III RCT.\",\n          \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n          \"status\": \"unmet\",\n          \"useful_material\": \"This study reports the results of the MITRIC trial (NCT05286294), a single-arm, phase IIa basket trial evaluating Fecal Microbiota Transplantation (FMT) from immune checkpoint inhibitor (ICI) responders in patients with advanced cancers progressing on ICIs. The trial enrolled 12 patients across melanoma, head and neck squamous cell carcinoma (HNSCC), renal cell carcinoma (RCC), and microsatellite instability-high pancreatic cancer. The co-primary endpoints were safety and objective response rate (ORR). The study found that FMT was safe and feasible but demonstrated limited clinical activity: no objective responses were observed (ORR 0%), median progression-free survival was 1.5 months, and median overall survival was 10.1 months. Clinical benefit (stable disease >6 months) was achieved in only one patient. The authors conclude that FMT does not support efficacy as a salvage therapy in this non-biomarker-driven, heavily pretreated population.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::648ccd951a6ed0f6c928cb17\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"supplement_materials\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": [\n          {\n            \"auxiliary_material\": \"The study provides mechanistic insights into why efficacy may be limited in certain contexts. It found that microbiota engraftment from donors was transient in most recipients, with durable engraftment observed only in the single patient who achieved clinical benefit. Mass cytometry analysis revealed that a baseline myeloid-dominant environment (high CD14+ monocytes) and high serum IL-8 were associated with poorer outcomes, while an activated T-cell signature was favorable. These immune features appeared to reflect the host's underlying disease state rather than being directly modified by FMT to improve outcomes. Additionally, the review planning material notes that this study highlights challenges in donor selection (using ICI responders vs healthy donors) and patient heterogeneity (rapidly progressive disease vs stable disease), suggesting that FMT efficacy is highly context-dependent.\",\n            \"evidence\": [],\n            \"gap_id\": \"large_scale_rct_results\",\n            \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\progressive_review_plan\\\\20260924_microbiome\\\\run01\\\\level1\\\\supplements\\\\large_scale_rct_results\\\\source_units\\\\SU02_search_candidate_fc8af41423\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n            \"limitations\": [],\n            \"material_ready\": true,\n            \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n            \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"remaining_gap\": \"The gap question asks for confirmation of completed large-scale Phase III randomized controlled trials confirming microbiome intervention efficacy. This study is explicitly identified as a 'single-arm phase IIa' trial. It is neither Phase III nor randomized. Therefore, it does not fulfill the success criterion of providing data from a completed Phase III RCT.\",\n            \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"status\": \"unmet\",\n            \"useful_material\": \"This study reports the results of the MITRIC trial (NCT05286294), a single-arm, phase IIa basket trial evaluating Fecal Microbiota Transplantation (FMT) from immune checkpoint inhibitor (ICI) responders in patients with advanced cancers progressing on ICIs. The trial enrolled 12 patients across melanoma, head and neck squamous cell carcinoma (HNSCC), renal cell carcinoma (RCC), and microsatellite instability-high pancreatic cancer. The co-primary endpoints were safety and objective response rate (ORR). The study found that FMT was safe and feasible but demonstrated limited clinical activity: no objective responses were observed (ORR 0%), median progression-free survival was 1.5 months, and median overall survival was 10.1 months. Clinical benefit (stable disease >6 months) was achieved in only one patient. The authors conclude that FMT does not support efficacy as a salvage therapy in this non-biomarker-driven, heavily pretreated population.\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::748f5657e9b651a2113dca8f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756e\",\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\",\n          \"snapshot::2796f4a95907dc27585d9be6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::acc00d9cd4f644b83ac0cda1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"tool_supplement_materials\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": [\n          {\n            \"allowed_use\": [],\n            \"conditions\": [],\n            \"limits\": [],\n            \"question\": \"MITRIC 试验中 FMT 在 ICI 耐药患者中的 ORR 及 PFS 数据是多少？为何结果为阴性？\",\n            \"sources\": [\n              {\n                \"doi\": \"10.1136/jitc-2026-015122\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"d9577b3a29bd8aec60c9e27c6a56a63faf3f4a27\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n                \"title\": \"Safety and efficacy of fecal microbiota transplantation in solid cancers resistant to immune checkpoint inhibitors: results of the MITRIC trial\",\n                \"year\": \"2026\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"still_missing\": \"MITRIC 试验中 FMT 在 ICI 耐药患者中的 ORR 及 PFS 数据是多少？为何结果为阴性？\",\n            \"usable_content\": \"{\\\"question_material\\\": [{\\\"question_id\\\": \\\"Q01\\\", \\\"examples\\\": [{\\\"attribution\\\": \\\"本研究\\\", \\\"use_in_review\\\": \\\"提供 FMT 在 ICI 耐药/难治性实体瘤患者中的具体疗效数据（ORR, PFS, OS），并展示阴性结果的具体表现，作为该人群疗效局限性的直接证据。\\\", \\\"finding\\\": \\\"MITRIC 试验为一项单臂 IIa 期篮子试验，纳入 12 名对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）耐药的晚期实体瘤患者（黑色素瘤 n=9, ccRCC n=1, HNSCC n=1, MSI-H 胰腺癌 n=1）。主要终点客观缓解率（ORR）为 0/12（0%），未观察到任何客观缓解（部分或完全缓解）。5 名患者达到最佳稳定疾病（SD），7 名患者进展（PD）。中位无进展生存期（PFS）为 1.5 个月，中位总生存期（OS）为 10.1 个月。仅 1 名黑色素瘤患者获得协议定义的临床获益（SD >6 个月），另 2 名患者出现混合反应（部分病灶消退）。\\\", \\\"conditions\\\": \\\"研究对象为 ICI 治疗期间或治疗后进展的晚期实体瘤患者；供体为长期 ICI 响应者；干预措施为结肠镜和灌肠给予的重复 FMT 联合持续或重新引入的 ICI 治疗；评估标准采用 iRECIST。\\\", \\\"reference_ids\\\": []}], \\\"explanation\\\": \\\"作者对 MITRIC 试验结果为阴性的解释主要集中在患者选择、疾病特征及供体匹配等方面：\\\\n1. **患者选择与疾病进展速度**：既往研究（如 Baruch et al., Davar et al.）中的响应往往发生较晚，且有时 preceded by pseudo-progression（假性进展）。而 MITRIC 中的大多数患者表现为弥漫性、快速生长的疾病，可能没有足够的时间让 FMT 发挥有意义的生物学效应。\\\\n2. **供体匹配与异质性**：虽然既往研究中所有响应者均接受单一供体的粪便，而本试验使用了三名供体，可能存在次优的供体-受体匹配或缺乏产生获益所需的特定微生物群落。此外，ICI 响应者之间的微生物组成差异很大，使用健康供体是否更优尚不清楚。\\\\n3. **免疫微环境限制**：基线时髓系偏倚环境和幼稚 T 细胞表型与较差预后相关，且 FMT 未能逆转这种不利的髓系主导免疫环境（事实上 CD14+ 单核细胞和 IL-8 随时间增加，这与较短的 PFS 和 OS 相关）。这表明 FMT 可能仅在选定的具有特定免疫特征的人群中有效。\\\\n4. **样本量与异质性**：小样本量是重要局限性，且不同研究在供体选择、FMT 制备、给药途径和治疗方案上的异质性也可能影响结果。\\\", \\\"remaining_points\\\": [\\\"FMT 在 ICI 耐药人群中的最佳生物标志物筛选标准尚未确立。\\\", \\\"供体选择（ICI 响应者 vs 健康供体）及个体化匹配策略对疗效的具体影响仍需进一步研究。\\\", \\\"FMT 是否能通过改变外周血免疫表型（如减少髓系抑制）来增强疗效，目前数据不支持其诱导了显著的全身免疫改变。\\\"]}], \\\"plain_text\\\": \\\"\\\"}\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"allowed_use\": [],\n            \"conditions\": [],\n            \"limits\": [],\n            \"question\": \"MITRIC 试验阴性结果需详细提取其关于患者选择、供体匹配及免疫微环境限制的解释，以平衡 Ch5 中的阳性结果。\",\n            \"sources\": [\n              {\n                \"doi\": \"10.1136/jitc-2026-015122\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"d9577b3a29bd8aec60c9e27c6a56a63faf3f4a27\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n                \"title\": \"Safety and efficacy of fecal microbiota transplantation in solid cancers resistant to immune checkpoint inhibitors: results of the MITRIC trial\",\n                \"year\": \"2026\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"still_missing\": \"MITRIC 试验阴性结果需详细提取其关于患者选择、供体匹配及免疫微环境限制的解释，以平衡 Ch5 中的阳性结果。\",\n            \"usable_content\": \"{\\\"question_material\\\": [{\\\"question_id\\\": \\\"Q01\\\", \\\"examples\\\": [{\\\"attribution\\\": \\\"本研究 (MITRIC trial)\\\", \\\"use_in_review\\\": \\\"提供阴性结果的详细解释，特别是关于患者选择（快速进展、晚期）、供体匹配（多供体 vs 单供体）及免疫微环境限制（髓系主导、IL-8升高），用于平衡Ch5中的阳性结果。\\\", \\\"finding\\\": \\\"在12名ICI耐药实体瘤患者中，FMT联合ICI治疗未观察到客观缓解（ORR 0%）。尽管FMT安全且可行，但临床获益有限。机制分析显示，基线时髓系偏倚环境和幼稚T细胞表型与较差预后相关；治疗后CD14+单核细胞和血清IL-8水平升高，这与较短的PFS和OS相关，表明FMT未能逆转这种不利的免疫微环境，甚至可能伴随髓系驱动的免疫抑制增加。\\\", \\\"conditions\\\": \\\"研究对象为12名接受过多种治疗的晚期实体瘤患者（9例黑色素瘤，1例HNSCC，1例ccRCC，1例MSI-H胰腺癌），均处于ICI治疗后的疾病进展期。供体为3名长期ICI反应者。干预措施包括结肠镜给药的初始FMT和灌肠后续FMT。\\\", \\\"reference_ids\\\": []}, {\\\"attribution\\\": \\\"Baruch et al. (2021)\\\", \\\"use_in_review\\\": \\\"作为对比背景，展示阳性结果中使用的单一供体策略和特定患者群体，以突显MITRIC试验中多供体和不同患者选择带来的差异。\\\", \\\"finding\\\": \\\"在一项针对抗PD-1耐受的转移性黑色素瘤患者的概念验证试验中，使用粪便微生物移植（FMT）实现了3/10患者的客观缓解，另有3名患者获得持久的疾病稳定。\\\", \\\"conditions\\\": \\\"研究对象为抗PD-1耐受的转移性黑色素瘤患者。所有反应者均接受来自单一供体的粪便。\\\", \\\"reference_ids\\\": [\\\"R19\\\"]}, {\\\"attribution\\\": \\\"Davar et al. (2021)\\\", \\\"use_in_review\\\": \\\"作为对比背景，展示阳性结果中观察到的免疫学变化（如CD56+CD8+ T细胞增加、IL-8降低），与MITRIC试验中的阴性结果形成机制上的对比。\\\", \\\"finding\\\": \\\"在一项针对抗PD-1耐受的转移性黑色素瘤患者的试验中，FMT使3/15患者产生反应，另有3名患者获得持久的疾病稳定。响应者在FMT/抗PD-1治疗后表现出外周血中CD56+CD8+ T细胞水平升高，且这些细胞表达更高的激活标记物；同时，响应者体内循环IL-8降低，肿瘤内产生IL-8的髓系细胞频率减少。\\\", \\\"conditions\\\": \\\"研究对象为抗PD-1耐受的转移性黑色素瘤患者。\\\", \\\"reference_ids\\\": [\\\"R18\\\"]}, {\\\"attribution\\\": \\\"Kim et al. (2024)\\\", \\\"use_in_review\\\": \\\"作为对比背景，展示在其他实体瘤（上消化道癌）中FMT的潜在疗效，说明癌症类型和疾病状态对结果的影响。\\\", \\\"finding\\\": \\\"在抗PD-1抑制剂耐药的不可切除或转移性实体瘤患者中，FMT改善了1/13名上消化道癌症患者的抗PD-1抑制剂疗效。\\\", \\\"conditions\\\": \\\"研究对象为抗PD-1抑制剂耐药的不可切除或转移性实体瘤患者，主要为上消化道癌症。\\\", \\\"reference_ids\\\": [\\\"R20\\\"]}], \\\"explanation\\\": \\\"MITRIC试验的阴性结果提示，FMT在克服ICI耐药方面并非普遍有效，其效果受到患者选择、供体匹配和免疫微环境状态的严格限制。\\\\n\\\\n首先，患者选择是关键因素。与之前报告阳性结果的试验（如Baruch等和Davar等）相比，MITRIC试验中的患者大多患有扩散迅速、生长快速的疾病，这可能没有给予FMT足够的时间来发挥有意义的生物学效应。此外，MITRIC试验纳入了原发性和继发性ICI耐药患者，而之前的研究主要关注继发性耐药或特定类型的耐药，这可能导致了结果的异质性。\\\\n\\\\n其次，供体匹配和多样性可能影响疗效。MITRIC试验使用了三名不同的供体，而Baruch等人的研究中所有反应者均来自单一供体。这表明，使用多名供体可能导致供体-受体匹配次优，或者缺乏对特定获益至关重要的微生物群落。供体的微生物组成存在显著差异，且目前尚不清楚使用ICI反应者作为供体是否优于健康供体。\\\\n\\\\n最后，免疫微环境的限制是重要的机制解释。MITRIC试验发现，基线时髓系偏倚环境和幼稚T细胞表型与较差的预后相关。治疗后，CD14+单核细胞和血清IL-8水平升高，这与较短的PFS和OS相关。相比之下，Davar等人的研究发现响应者体内IL-8降低，且髓系细胞产生的IL-8减少。这表明，在MITRIC试验的患者群体中，FMT未能逆转由髓系驱动的免疫抑制微环境，甚至可能伴随着这种抑制的增加，从而限制了临床获益。因此，FMT可能仅在具有特定免疫特征（如高分化T细胞环境、低髓系浸润）的选定人群中有效，而可靠的生物标志物尚未建立。\\\", \\\"remaining_points\\\": [\\\"MITRIC试验样本量小，且为单臂研究，无法进行因果推断或多重检验校正，因此关于免疫微环境和生物标志物的发现应谨慎解读。\\\", \\\"长期定植的效果难以评估，因为大多数患者在疾病进展后无法收集后续的粪便样本。\\\", \\\"需要进一步的研究来确定FMT的最佳给药方案、供体选择标准以及能够预测获益的患者亚群。\\\"]}], \\\"plain_text\\\": \\\"\\\"}\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::de6856b325f938438220cbe8\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4d15b90b1b4387e8af2a1be3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2796f4a95907dc27585d9be6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e6c26d84a16f2a929d0235ad\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::681007cc53abdcfcc8cd089d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3ee898ac21789411a52117b5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用PRISMA指南指导的系统综述方法。检索策略覆盖PubMed、ClinicalTrials.gov及主要肿瘤学会议摘要。纳入标准限定为接受ICI联合FMT治疗的实体瘤患者，排除仅关注免疫微环境变化或无具体数据的回顾性研究。使用Cochrane ROB 2.0和ROBINS-I工具评估偏倚风险。统计分析使用Stata 18和R语言，以ORR为主要终点，CR、PR、PFS、OS及不良事件为次要终点。对于生存数据，因多数研究未报告风险比（HR），采用加权平均中位数进行初步评估。亚组分析基于ICI策略、供体来源、给药途径和肿瘤类型进行。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::119ebc43a2985e2a4447adb7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了FMT联合ICI治疗实体瘤的汇总疗效数据（ORR 43%），并量化了不同ICI策略（特别是双药联合）对疗效的显著影响。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给材料未交代具体的微生物组测序深度、特定菌株定植率的长期追踪数据，以及FMT对ICI耐药性的逆转机制的直接实验证据。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fe78db4b46d3dbef7d9279bd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"明确了FMT联合治疗的安全性特征，指出其不显著增加严重不良事件风险，甚至可能在某些情况下降低irAEs。\",\n          \"limits\": \"安全性数据主要来自短期随访，缺乏长期安全性监测，无法评估迟发性不良反应或微生物组改变的持久性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ef62572c2550368d6d7be5ad\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"识别了关键的方法学异质性来源，如供体选择（ICI反应者vs健康人）和给药途径对结果的潜在影响。\",\n          \"limits\": \"纳入研究多为单臂或小样本RCT，缺乏大规模多中心对照，导致效应估计可能存在选择偏倚，且无法确立因果关系。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8c63451a85ee66b9f1eb5f8b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"所有纳入的10项研究（n=164），混合ICI方案\",\n          \"finding\": \"总体客观缓解率（ORR）为43% (95% CI: 0.35–0.51)，存在中度异质性 (I² = 59%)。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::df7528cb4eaf951099448813\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"亚组：抗PD-1联合抗CTLA-4双药治疗 vs 抗PD-1单药\",\n          \"finding\": \"双药治疗ORR显著更高（60% vs 37%, P=0.01），且双药组内异质性低 (I² = 0)。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7484febb7596aa2dc9f5d798\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"亚组：供体来源为ICI反应者 vs 健康人或商业制剂\",\n          \"finding\": \"ICI反应者供体的ORR较高（46%），但组间差异无统计学意义；该亚组内存在显著异质性 (I² = 66%)。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::30fe18ce8132f66ab3ac68b5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"亚组：口服粪菌胶囊 vs 内镜移植\",\n          \"finding\": \"口服胶囊ORR较高（49% vs 34%），但组间差异无统计学意义；该亚组内存在显著异质性 (I² = 68%)。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a37818ba99c42a167452781b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"安全性评估：所有研究\",\n          \"finding\": \"1-2级不良事件发生率42% (95% CI: 0.32–0.52)，3-4级为37% (95% CI: 0.28–0.46)。双药治疗组的3-4级AE发生率高于单药组。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f70ea71f79c1728e17d292d8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"生存分析：部分研究提供的中位数据\",\n          \"finding\": \"加权平均中位无进展生存期（mPFS）为8.32个月，中位总生存期（mOS）为12.67个月。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e6bef402b84076e2fc312e73\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bb50d6fc7d72546d3b0b14c5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"解决FMT在增强ICI疗效方面的临床证据碎片化问题，明确其有效性、安全性以及不同治疗策略（如ICI组合、供体来源、给药途径）对疗效的影响，为未来临床试验设计提供依据。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e9b62844e5031ff35428cc56\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"针对晚期或难治性实体瘤患者，评估粪便微生物群移植（FMT）联合免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的临床疗效与安全性。纳入的研究包括随机对照试验（RCT）、单臂干预研究和前瞻性队列研究，涵盖黑色素瘤、肾细胞癌（RCC）、微卫星稳定型结直肠癌（MSS-CRC）等多种肿瘤类型。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::92021fb9971ea3e4766af23f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"这是一篇系统综述与荟萃分析，旨在综合现有证据以评估FMT作为增强ICI疗效辅助策略的临床价值。研究通过系统检索PubMed及临床试验注册库，筛选出10项涉及164名患者的研究进行定量合成。主要发现显示，FMT联合ICI的总体客观缓解率（ORR）为43%，其中抗PD-1联合抗CTLA-4双药治疗的ORR显著高于单药治疗（60% vs 37%）。安全性方面，1-2级不良事件发生率为42%，3-4级为37%。尽管结果呈现初步积极信号，但作者指出由于纳入研究多为早期小样本试验且缺乏长期随访数据，结论尚需大规模RCT进一步验证。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3b7b7af558c58a4499ecb4c3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅反映临床终点（ORR/PFS/OS），未直接测量微生物群的具体组成变化与疗效之间的因果链条。异质性较高，不能代表所有患者群体。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了FMT联合ICI在实体瘤中的汇总临床疗效数据（ORR 43%），证实了微生物干预对ICI疗效的正向调节作用。特别指出抗PD-1/CTLA-4双药联合时疗效显著提升（ORR 60%），提示微生物群可能增强双重阻断的协同效应。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::baeffd11973b8117fbd94bc8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这些是作者基于已有文献提出的假设，并非本荟萃分析直接验证的机制。缺乏直接的分子生物学证据（如单细胞测序、代谢组学数据）来证实这些机制在FMT患者中的实际运作路径。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提出了FMT增强ICI疗效的潜在机制假说：(1) 增加有益菌（如Akkermansia muciniphila, Bifidobacterium）；(2) 提高肠道微生物α多样性；(3) 调节肿瘤微环境（TME），促进效应T细胞浸润并抑制调节性T细胞。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::70a1fbb4ae53658675f13905\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"亚组分析样本量小，异质性大，结果仅为趋势性观察，不能作为确定性的指导原则。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"揭示了供体来源（ICI反应者 vs 健康人）和给药途径（口服胶囊 vs 内镜）对疗效的潜在影响趋势，尽管统计上不显著，但提示了个性化FMT策略的重要性。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d96c70c917d3a596edfbe6ea\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"1-2级AE发生率42%，3-4级为37%。双药治疗组3-4级AE更高。FMT可能具有减轻某些irAEs（如结肠炎）的潜力。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5e662876d721f40ab5d1373e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"纳入研究多为早期小样本试验，缺乏大规模RCT，长期疗效和安全性未知。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5e8191023314ee620d1ad57b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究为荟萃分析，其结论依赖于纳入的10项研究的质量和设计。大部分研究为单臂或小样本RCT，存在较高的选择偏倚风险，因此其报告的疗效提升不能完全归因于FMT，也可能受患者选择等因素影响。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1203040411132c25753f80e1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"亚组分析（如供体来源、给药途径）的结果虽显示趋势，但因样本量小和异质性高，不具备统计显著性，解读时应谨慎，避免过度推断。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::31cc722c4896a75ea0043c36\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"机制部分仅为作者基于文献的推测，非本研究直接验证，引用时需明确区分观察性关联与因果机制。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e1f1f9e8dbb36c4251377288\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"supplement_materials\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": [\n          {\n            \"auxiliary_material\": \"The study provides detailed safety data (42% grade 1–2 adverse events, 37% grade 3–4 adverse events) and mechanistic hypotheses (e.g., increasing beneficial bacteria like Akkermansia muciniphila, modulating tumor microenvironment) which, while not validating the Phase III gap, offer context on why such trials are being pursued. It also notes heterogeneity in FMT protocols (donor sources, administration routes) as a barrier that large-scale trials need to standardize.\",\n            \"evidence\": [],\n            \"gap_id\": \"phase_iii_rct_evidence\",\n            \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\body_full_staged_acceptance_20261004_40cny\\\\planning\\\\level2\\\\external\\\\N48436b3aa73aea86f35f-f45b87be8e30256e\\\\round_1\\\\supplements\\\\phase_iii_rct_evidence\\\\attempt-c7j_i2fn\\\\source_units\\\\SU01_search_candidate_d1c4b32e8c\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n            \"limitations\": [],\n            \"material_ready\": true,\n            \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n            \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"remaining_gap\": \"The specific evidence requested—completed large-scale randomized controlled Phase III clinical trials confirming efficacy—is not present in the literature covered by this study. The 164 patients across 10 studies do not constitute a large-scale Phase III dataset, and the authors explicitly state the need for such trials to validate efficacy and safety.\",\n            \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"status\": \"unmet\",\n            \"useful_material\": \"This study is a systematic review and meta-analysis (search up to September 30, 2024) that included 10 studies involving 164 patients with solid tumors treated with FMT combined with ICIs. The authors report that the included studies comprised 5 phase I trials, 4 phase II–III trials, and 3 randomized controlled trials (RCTs), but note that most were early-phase clinical trials with small sample sizes. The pooled objective response rate (ORR) was 43%, with subgroup analysis showing higher ORR (60%) for anti-PD-1 combined with anti-CTLA-4 therapy compared to monotherapy (37%). Crucially, the authors conclude in both the Abstract and Discussion that 'larger-scale randomized controlled trials with long-term follow-up are required to confirm and optimize treatment protocols' and highlight the 'absence of randomized controlled trials' (referring to large-scale/definitive ones) as a limitation. This material directly addresses the gap question by confirming that while preliminary RCT data exists, completed large-scale Phase III evidence is currently lacking and identified as a necessary future step.\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5f29fcf1f0241716fc0bbb3d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1a130d7f1a3d34e9fd6dac0f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0040\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::76807d6c2149bba15010313b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0040\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d85047c537211385cef39384\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0040\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用叙述性综述方法。通过梳理文献，从基础生物学背景（肠道菌群功能、癌症微环境）出发，过渡到临床观察（益生菌对胃肠道毒性的缓解作用），再深入到分子机制层面（特定菌株对免疫检查点抑制剂的调节）。文章综合了体外实验、动物模型（FMT移植）和人体临床试验的结果，并对特定菌株LGG进行了专题深入分析。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::edb4f97c95ad6d197c44f501\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0040\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"系统综述了肠道微生物群调节免疫检查点抑制剂疗效的最新证据，并提供了益生菌缓解抗癌治疗胃肠道毒性的临床数据汇总。\",\n          \"limits\": \"作为综述，其结论依赖于所引用的原始研究；对于益生菌增强免疫治疗疗效的机制多为相关性描述或动物模型推断，缺乏大规模前瞻性人体干预试验的直接因果证据；未提供具体的荟萃分析统计结果。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bba8ee6803b73e5fdd19167b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0040\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"黑色素瘤患者接受抗PD-1/PD-L1免疫治疗\",\n          \"finding\": \"作者转述了Routy等人和Gopalakrishnan等人的研究，发现响应者肠道中富集Akkermansia、Alistipes、Clostridiales等菌属；粪菌移植（FMT）至无菌小鼠可改善PD-1阻断疗效，表明特定肠道菌群能增强免疫检查点抑制剂的抗肿瘤效果。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d35f3c7fa718acde685707ba\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0040\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"接受化疗或放疗的结直肠癌及其他实体瘤患者\",\n          \"finding\": \"多项随机对照试验显示，口服益生菌（如L. johnsonii, L. acidophilus, B. longum, S. boulardii）能显著减少治疗相关的腹泻、黏膜炎和术后感染，改善肠道菌群组成和局部免疫功能。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e143d0e94eb670b6a7e529de\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0040\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"接受放化疗的胃肠道肿瘤患者\",\n          \"finding\": \"模型菌株LGG被证实能通过释放脂磷壁酸（LTA）激活隐窝周围巨噬细胞，从而选择性保护正常肠上皮干细胞免受辐射诱导的凋亡，而不影响肿瘤细胞，起到“时间释放胶囊”般的放射保护作用。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::589f7e8c39230005464d987f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0040\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::be22e5b25492a3fed5d88a29\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0040\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"探究肠道微生物群如何影响癌症治疗的结局，特别是益生菌能否作为安全有效的辅助手段来减轻抗癌治疗（化疗、放疗、免疫治疗）的胃肠道副作用，并增强免疫检查点抑制剂的疗效。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e8acf565078abc3a85bacad5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0040\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"人类肠道微生物群（gut microbiota）与癌症及其治疗的关系，重点聚焦于益生菌作为抗癌治疗辅助手段的临床应用及机制。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b6c9e01d144ad53cb1611b26\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0040\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"这是一篇2019年发表的综述文章，旨在总结肠道微生物群在癌症发生发展中的作用，以及益生菌作为辅助疗法在减轻抗癌治疗副作用和改善免疫检查点抑制剂疗效方面的最新临床进展。文章首先阐述了肠道菌群失调与癌症风险及治疗毒性的关联，随后回顾了多项临床试验，证明特定益生菌（如乳酸杆菌和双歧杆菌）能有效缓解化疗、放疗引起的腹泻和黏膜炎。特别地，文章详细讨论了模型菌株鼠李糖乳杆菌GG（LGG）的保护机制，并列举了大量正在进行的临床试验以评估其安全性和有效性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b14e80f9a7f421e778a5ee90\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0040\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这些发现主要基于黑色素瘤患者的观察性研究和动物FMT实验，尚未在广泛的其他实体瘤中普遍验证；且未说明这些菌群是原因还是结果。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了肠道菌群组成与免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效关联的临床证据。指出黑色素瘤ICI响应者肠道中富集Akkermansia, Alistipes, Clostridiales等菌属，而非响应者则不同。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2d4cbfba6e3c600e35d0bafc\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0040\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"机制细节主要来自小鼠模型（FMT实验），人体内的确切分子通路尚不完全清楚；不同研究识别出的关键菌种存在差异（如有的强调Akkermansia，有的强调Bifidobacterium），提示情境依赖性。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"揭示了特定细菌介导ICI疗效增强的潜在机制线索。例如，Akkermansia muciniphila可增加肿瘤内细胞毒性T细胞浸润；Bifidobacterium longum等也被认为能改善PD-L1疗效。同时提出了抗生素使用破坏菌群导致ICI疗效下降的反面证据。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b520a3be90c3e52e0e98c71a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0040\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这是间接效应，不直接回答菌群如何生物化学地调节ICI靶点或免疫通路。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了益生菌（非特定共生菌，而是补充剂）可能间接影响治疗结局的背景。虽然主要关注副作用缓解，但指出维持健康的肠道平衡可能防止因严重副作用导致的停药，从而间接保证ICI疗程的完成。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fee4e8bf5f4ec766e01a8391\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0040\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"将益生菌的作用分为两类：1) 缓解胃肠道毒性（腹泻、黏膜炎）以提高生活质量/依从性；2) 作为免疫调节剂增强ICI疗效。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::79cab45f7e4752c2bb82585a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0040\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"LGG通过释放LTA激活巨噬细胞保护正常肠细胞的机制。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7e5917ce1d1f8f5876a84c76\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0040\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"癌症患者常处于免疫抑制状态，使用益生菌可能存在机会性感染和抗生素耐药基因转移的风险。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::db497ebde7996862e20e5599\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0040\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该综述主要基于2019年之前的文献，后续可能有更多更新的研究出现。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f5418f50017f7bc5c7b7ebf4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0040\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"文中提到的ICI疗效增强证据多来自黑色素瘤，外推到其他实体瘤需谨慎。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::69c82aa40e101f1d3f0618ef\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0040\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"区分“特定肠道共生菌”（如Akkermansia，自然存在于体内）与“外源性益生菌补充剂”（如LGG，作为药物/补充剂给予）的不同作用模式和证据等级。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f6037a1d0608677fe5924a2f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0040\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"不要将动物模型（FMT）的结果直接等同于人体临床疗效，需注明这是机制探索阶段的证据。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1928e0bebb19a7525279d13c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0040\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-b5c2e925a4132b88eff6\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9657b936db0a7f07c540e430\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0088\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef\",\n          \"snapshot::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::452f72bf00e6cbde567cdd37\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0088\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef\",\n          \"snapshot::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a6a50b7a14ceb80c9c4da435\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0088\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"1. 数据来源：提取FAERS数据库中2014年Q1至2023年Q4的数据。2. 分组策略：将报告分为三组索引（仅ICI、仅PPI、ICI+PPI）及参考组（无ICI无PPI）。3. 统计方法：使用ROR进行非比例性信号检测；通过无条件逻辑回归计算调整后的ROR（RORadj）以控制混杂；利用加法模型（风险相加）和乘法模型（风险相乘）验证相互作用的稳健性。4. 分层分析：针对阳性信号的SOC，进一步按PD-1、PD-L1、CTLA-4亚型进行子集分析。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef\",\n          \"snapshot::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::63e5b9b86574b43cffded3c3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0088\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"首次利用大规模自发报告系统数据，量化了ICIs与PPIs联用的四种主要DDI信号，并按ICI亚型细化了风险谱。\",\n          \"limits\": \"依赖FAERS自发报告数据，存在报告偏倚、缺失数据、无法计算确切发生率、缺乏临床严重程度分级细节以及未控制所有潜在混杂因素（如肿瘤类型、合并用药复杂性）的限制。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef\",\n          \"snapshot::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::160ea0e9ab1a2ab450b4134f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0088\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"ICI + PPI vs 其他组合\",\n          \"finding\": \"发现四个SOC存在显著的DDI信号：先天性/家族性/遗传性疾病（RORadj=2.66）、肝胆疾病（RORadj=7.10）、代谢与营养障碍（RORadj=2.66）、皮肤及皮下组织疾病（RORadj=1.53）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef\",\n          \"snapshot::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::48ee81d57dc07f1ddb0e1914\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0088\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"PD-1 + PPI\",\n          \"finding\": \"与先天性/家族性/遗传性疾病、肝胆疾病、皮肤及皮下组织疾病相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef\",\n          \"snapshot::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::529009be7ea84d2125c5221a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0088\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"PD-L1 + PPI\",\n          \"finding\": \"与代谢与营养障碍相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef\",\n          \"snapshot::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::62979be5b3594c97c14b39ce\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0088\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"CTLA-4 + PPI\",\n          \"finding\": \"与先天性/家族性/遗传性疾病、皮肤及皮下组织疾病相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef\",\n          \"snapshot::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ee80e5ef799af9b113c457ad\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0088\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef\",\n          \"snapshot::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6692a76d1f610d5d9cf5ba75\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0088\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管ICIs和PPIs在癌症治疗中常联合使用，但两者之间的药物相互作用及其潜在的不良后果尚不清楚。研究试图回答：ICIs与PPIs联用是否会增强特定类型不良反应的发生频率？不同亚型的ICI与PPI联用是否存在差异化的风险模式？\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef\",\n          \"snapshot::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::205512a5abda225e13ef4a6c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0088\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"基于美国FDA不良事件报告系统（FAERS）2014-2023年的真实世界数据，研究免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs，包括PD-1、PD-L1、CTLA-4抑制剂）与质子泵抑制剂（PPIs）联合使用时的药物相互作用信号。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef\",\n          \"snapshot::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::52a5725b3c17473da57c0224\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0088\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在评估ICIs与PPIs联用是否会产生特定的药物相互作用（DDI）。作者利用FAERS数据库，通过非比例性分析计算报告比值比（ROR），并采用逻辑回归调整混杂因素（年龄、性别、报告年份），同时结合加法和乘法模型验证信号稳健性。研究识别出四个存在显著交互作用的标准化MedDRA查询系统器官分类（SOC），并进一步按ICI亚型进行了子集分析。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef\",\n          \"snapshot::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::56b6a2551c1289a1bb4d82d3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0088\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这是基于自发报告系统的关联性信号，不能直接证明PPI降低了ICI的抗肿瘤疗效，也不能确定具体的生物学机制。样本主要来自老年患者（中位年龄66岁），结果可能受年龄相关共病影响。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了ICIs与PPIs联用导致特定不良反应增加的流行病学证据。数据显示联用组在肝胆、皮肤、代谢及遗传类疾病上的报告率显著高于单药组，提示PPI的使用可能与ICI相关的毒性增强有关。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef\",\n          \"snapshot::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::34b2e27f63ea6bdc24ff032c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0088\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这些机制解释是作者基于文献的综合推断，并非本研究的实验结果。研究本身未测量肠道菌群或生物标志物。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"在讨论部分提出了潜在的机制假说：PPI通过抑制胃酸分泌改变肠道菌群组成（减少多样性、改变特定菌属丰度），进而影响全身免疫反应和ICI介导的毒性。此外，还讨论了药代动力学和药效学相互作用的可能性。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef\",\n          \"snapshot::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::160dba95b43812e8687a0ded\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0088\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"FAERS数据库中ICIs与PPIs联用的病例特征（中位年龄66岁，男性略多，欧洲报告最多），以及时间趋势（报告量逐年增加）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef\",\n          \"snapshot::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e488cc310f94f6a967c30e4a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0088\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"不同ICI亚型（PD-1, PD-L1, CTLA-4）与PPI联用的差异化信号分布。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef\",\n          \"snapshot::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1f1b8684bf857df33a7b095a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0088\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究结果为信号检测（Signal Detection），表明的是报告频率的异常升高，而非确证的因果关系或临床发生率。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef\",\n          \"snapshot::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fccf35e3d9d7deccf4c47a4d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0088\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"FAERS数据存在严重的报告偏倚（Underreporting）和信息不完整，尤其是关于既往病史和合并用药的详细记录缺失，可能导致混杂因素控制不足。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef\",\n          \"snapshot::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::dbfc2c12979fbda7d85214ef\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0088\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"机制部分（如菌群改变）仅为讨论中的文献回顾和推测，本研究未提供直接的微生物组测序或分子机制证据，不可将其作为机制确定的事实引用。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef\",\n          \"snapshot::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a2cc3549477f5dc5e1558e8e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0088\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"研究对象为广泛癌症患者，未限定于特定实体瘤，外推至特定固体瘤时需考虑肿瘤类型特异性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef\",\n          \"snapshot::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cf3687e9f624b396df724df5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0088\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef\",\n          \"snapshot::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6cd3dab5c001b6d49a4bb5e8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0310\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"abstract\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::743653689385e4f085f6397e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0310\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6188d154a319812b35e4b48c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0310\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用回顾性队列研究设计。利用机构数据库筛选出2004-2019年间接受首次ICI治疗的III/IV期黑色素瘤患者。定义暴露组（Abx+）为在ICI开始前3个月内使用过抗生素的患者，对照组（Abx-）为未使用者。通过多变量分析（MV analysis）和Fine-Grey竞争风险模型评估抗生素暴露对总生存期（OS）和免疫介导性结肠炎的影响。此外，进行了敏感性分析以排除重症感染住院患者的干扰。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::16ecfa4d3b7f0bc775571a06\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0310\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了在真实世界临床实践中，近期抗生素暴露与黑色素瘤患者ICI治疗疗效（OS）及安全性（结肠炎）之间关联的实证数据，支持了抗生素可能负面调节ICI疗效的假设。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给摘要未交代具体的混杂因素列表、统计模型的具体协变量选择过程、抗生素种类分布及微生物组测序数据。作为回顾性观察研究，无法确立因果关系，仅能证明关联。结论仅限于黑色素瘤人群，且受限于单中心数据。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0f1adc856e63ef2b3eac0882\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0310\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"IV期黑色素瘤患者，经多变量分析调整基线特征后\",\n          \"finding\": \"抗生素暴露组（Abx+）的总生存期显著差于非暴露组，风险比（HR）为1.6（95% CI 1.1-2.2）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b0ae20fcaa95bd0597b3930b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0310\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"III期黑色素瘤患者，经多变量分析调整基线特征后\",\n          \"finding\": \"抗生素暴露组（Abx+）的总生存期显著差于非暴露组，风险比（HR）为2.8（95% CI 1.3-5.9）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::eec2b77994e394a2fefd9cff\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0310\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"敏感性分析：排除接受静脉注射抗生素或因感染住院的患者后\",\n          \"finding\": \"抗生素暴露组（Abx+）的生存劣势依然存在，HR为1.7（95% CI 1.2-2.4）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e06c32fa02d9124b8d3bd715\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0310\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"使用Fine-Grey竞争风险多变量模型分析免疫介导性结肠炎发生率\",\n          \"finding\": \"抗生素暴露组发生需要静脉注射类固醇治疗的免疫介导性结肠炎的风险更高，HR为2.1（95% CI 1.02-4.5）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0e7c0014df5eddddf9003735\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0310\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7461ad3c4c0c2a31011107c3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0310\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"基于肠道微生物群可能调节癌症治疗反应的假设，以及广谱抗生素已知会导致菌群失调的事实，本研究试图验证近期抗生素暴露是否会恶化接受ICI治疗的黑色素瘤患者的临床结局（生存率和免疫相关不良反应）。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f4b855dc46eb6cf5882b401b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0310\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"研究对象为接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的III期和IV期黑色素瘤患者。研究情境为单中心机构数据库回顾性分析，时间跨度为2004年至2019年。主要关注抗生素暴露与ICI治疗结局之间的关联。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c5cb1f53f3ca4d8fdfb3bff2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0310\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在探讨近期抗生素暴露是否会影响黑色素瘤患者对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）的治疗反应。研究团队从机构数据库中识别了接受首次ICI治疗的患者，定义抗生素暴露为在首次ICI输注前3个月内使用过抗生素。主要终点为总生存期（OS），次要终点为需要静脉注射类固醇治疗的免疫介导性结肠炎。研究分别对III期和IV期患者进行了独立分析，并通过多变量分析调整了基线特征差异。结果显示，抗生素暴露与较差的生存预后及更高的结肠炎风险相关。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::28c627cde2bc02253af2e056\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0310\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅限黑色素瘤；未提供微生物组直接证据；关联不等于因果；未区分抗生素类型或具体菌群变化。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了抗生素暴露作为负面调节因子影响ICI疗效的具体临床数据。数据显示，在III期和IV期黑色素瘤中，近期抗生素使用均与OS降低显著相关（HR分别为2.8和1.6），并增加了严重结肠炎风险（HR 2.1）。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::47907cfa1f0dc904c801a146\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0310\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"缺乏直接的微生物组数据或机制通路验证；不能单独证明机制，需结合其他微生物组学研究。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"虽然未直接阐明分子机制，但通过展示抗生素暴露与不良临床结局（OS下降、结肠炎增加）的强关联，为“微生物群介导的ICI疗效调节”这一机制假说提供了间接的支持性临床背景。其敏感性分析排除了重症感染本身的直接影响，增强了抗生素本身（而非伴随疾病）作用的合理性。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2b7f0708ccb2944b9f85dc1f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0310\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"抗生素暴露导致OS风险增加1.6-2.8倍，结肠炎风险增加2.1倍的统计数据。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b2a1d9834cb883ad2f9be332\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0310\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"研究专门分析了III期和IV期黑色素瘤，发现两期别均有显著负面影响，但III期的HR更高（2.8 vs 1.6）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::346848d789c8afc9b21ef58d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0310\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究为观察性关联，不能推断抗生素必然导致疗效下降，可能存在未测量的混杂因素（尽管已调整多项基线特征）。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ee9290b766872c91edb7c21a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0310\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"结果仅适用于黑色素瘤患者，外推至其他实体瘤需谨慎。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1a7f6ea250253d8f35605ddb\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0310\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"抗生素定义为“3个月内使用”，未区分抗生素种类、疗程或给药途径（除敏感性分析排除静脉用药外），不同抗生素对菌群的影响差异巨大，此处视为整体暴露。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fcea8fd55aaa119633dde462\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0310\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"结肠炎风险的增加可能与生存期缩短有关（竞争风险），Fine-Grey模型已部分处理此问题，但仍需注意解释。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8f5123a924945b6cba49c0a7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0310\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"所给材料未提供微生物组测序数据，因此不能直接用于描述具体的菌群变化，只能作为菌群失调后果的临床代理指标。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6e407241e5fc60e333d9a89a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0310\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"identity\",\n              \"reason\": \"source identity was not independently verified\",\n              \"status\": \"input_attributed\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"no complete research body was indexed\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"only abstract or non-title snippets were available\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"abstract_only\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1f6436d467e7e0b57e2f07b2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e1cc78c58c16c3bbdbbf2ee2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::00a19ae4aaf57c17faf6d44e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用系统性文献综合路线。首先梳理肠道微生物组调节局部及全身免疫的基础生物学机制（受体信号通路、表观遗传调控）。其次，分类汇总临床前研究（主要是小鼠模型），分析特定菌株对树突状细胞、T细胞极化及肿瘤微环境的影响。再次，系统检索并归纳人类临床研究数据，包括回顾性队列、前瞻性观察研究及I/II期临床试验，按癌种（肺癌、肾癌、黑色素瘤等）和治疗类型进行分层分析。最后，结合专家观点与现有文献缺口，提出整合多组学、体外功能 assay 及标准化临床试验的未来研究框架。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::71d806cb03a92d98e2986d9d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了益生菌增强ICI疗效的多层次机制全景图，连接了微生物代谢物、免疫细胞亚群及肿瘤微环境重塑。\",\n          \"limits\": \"机制部分主要基于小鼠模型，其外推至人类的适用性受限；人类数据多为观察性，存在选择偏倚和混杂因素。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9d832b25167ebcddca09a6b4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"系统整理了截至2025年的临床前及早期临床证据，揭示了不同癌种和益生菌类型的响应差异。\",\n          \"limits\": \"临床数据异质性高，难以得出统一的疗效结论；缺乏长期安全性和长期定植效果的数据。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::33a9645f6cef26721b0123d6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"明确了当前领域的关键瓶颈（标准化缺失、监管障碍、因果推断困难），并为未来研究设计了方法论框架。\",\n          \"limits\": \"作为综述，未提供新的原始实验数据；提出的未来方向需后续实证研究验证。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::302a80f9ec357636e98d3b23\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"临床前小鼠模型（黑色素瘤、结直肠癌等）\",\n          \"finding\": \"特定益生菌（如双歧杆菌、乳酸杆菌、Clostridium butyricum、Akkermansia muciniphila）可通过激活树突状细胞、促进MHC-I抗原呈递、调节细胞因子谱（增加IFN-γ, TNF-α）、诱导巨噬细胞向M1型极化以及产生SCFAs等代谢物，增强CD8+ T细胞浸润和活性，从而协同ICI发挥抗肿瘤作用。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0ff7bc74c4a0e8a80d1f6f4d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"人类回顾性及前瞻性观察研究（非小细胞肺癌、转移性肾细胞癌、黑色素瘤）\",\n          \"finding\": \"多项研究显示，使用益生菌（尤其是Clostridium butyricum MIYAIRI 588或多种混合菌株）与改善无进展生存期（PFS）和总生存期（OS）相关。例如，在一项NSCLC回顾性研究中，益生菌使用者中位PFS显著延长；在mRCC的前瞻性研究中，CBM588联合nivolumab/ipilimumab显示出更高的客观缓解率（ORR）和PFS。然而，部分商业益生菌补充剂在非标准化使用时可能无效甚至有害。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3126473c4fbc3a92dfe180c6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）管理\",\n          \"finding\": \"某些益生菌株（如Bifidobacterium spp., Lactobacillus spp.）在动物模型中可减轻ICI诱导的结肠炎。在人类观察性研究中，较高的有益菌丰度或与irAEs风险降低相关，但临床数据不一致，部分研究显示益生菌使用并未增加irAEs发生率，而在联合化疗时可能增加特定毒性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::30453997df29189781838b94\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"方法学与标准化现状\",\n          \"finding\": \"大多数临床证据来自回顾性研究，缺乏随机对照试验（RCT）。使用的益生菌制剂高度异质化（单株vs多株，商业补充剂vs定义明确的菌株），且受饮食、抗生素使用、种族等混杂因素影响严重。目前尚无法确定最佳菌株、剂量及给药方案。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::717397c1cb049347f7f2933f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8c94036e7aec735063a13814\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管肠道微生物组已知能调节ICI疗效，但基于微生物组的干预措施（特别是益生菌）在临床实施中面临挑战。本研究旨在解决：1）益生菌如何通过具体免疫机制增强ICI疗效？2）目前关于益生菌在人类癌症患者中应用的临床证据质量如何？3）该领域存在哪些主要障碍（如标准化、安全性、混杂因素），需要何种研究设计来克服？\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7182dbc1a8c2edca834f2177\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"聚焦于肠道微生物组（gut microbiome）与癌症免疫治疗，特别是免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）之间的相互作用。研究对象包括益生菌（probiotics）、益生元、后生元及粪便微生物移植等微生物靶向策略，涵盖从基础机制到临床前模型及早期临床试验的证据。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2e70d09ab215c701a9eb32bc\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本文是一篇综述，旨在批判性评估益生菌作为癌症免疫治疗辅助手段的现有证据。文章首先概述了肠道微生物组通过代谢物（如短链脂肪酸、色氨酸衍生物、胆汁酸）和分子模式调节宿主免疫系统的机制，进而阐述这些机制如何影响ICI疗效。随后，重点讨论了特定益生菌菌株在临床前小鼠模型中增强抗肿瘤免疫反应的潜力，并汇总了来自回顾性队列、前瞻性观察研究及早期临床试验的人类数据，探讨益生菌对ICI疗效及免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）的影响。最后，文章指出了当前研究的局限性，如菌株标准化缺失、混杂因素干扰及因果关系的未确定性，并提出了整合纵向多组学、体外共培养及类器官模型等未来研究方向，以推动益生菌从膳食补充剂向经过验证的临床辅助疗法转化。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ebf057532e81f91a3c1deb34\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"所有临床数据均为回顾性或早期前瞻性观察研究，存在显著的混杂因素（如基线微生物组成、饮食、合并用药）。不能直接证明因果关系，仅能提供关联证据。样本量和随访时间有限，长期疗效未知。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了益生菌在多种实体瘤（NSCLC, mRCC, 黑色素瘤）中与ICI联用的临床观察结果，包括PFS、OS和ORR的变化趋势。特别指出了Clostridium butyricum MIYAIRI 588在肺癌和肾癌中的积极信号，以及商业混合益生菌在某些情况下的无效性。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2151952a4c6ff4b033e7e506\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"大部分机制细节源自小鼠模型（germ-free mice, gnotobiotic models）。人类体内确切的因果链条尚未完全确立，许多通路在人体中的确切贡献度和主导性尚不明确。不同菌株的作用机制可能存在显著差异，综述中的机制概括可能掩盖菌株特异性。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"详细描述了益生菌调节免疫的具体分子和细胞机制：1）通过SCFAs激活GPCRs并抑制HDAC，促进Treg分化或增强CD8+ T细胞功能；2）通过AhR通路调节色氨酸代谢；3）通过STING通路激活DC和巨噬细胞，促进M1极化；4）通过分子模拟（molecular mimicry）交叉激活T细胞。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4e3e5363e3b1e6060c91a4ba\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"临床数据矛盾且不充分。动物模型结果不能直接外推至人类。缺乏大规模RCT数据支持益生菌对irAEs的确切保护作用。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"分析了益生菌对ICI诱导的免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）的双向影响，指出某些菌株可能减轻结肠炎，而其他情况下可能增加毒性或无显著影响。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bd22fb14494e0354503b38df\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"介绍了肠道微生物组作为“第二基因组”的概念，及其通过GALT、代谢物和MAMPs调节全身免疫的基础理论。定义了益生菌、益生元、后生元和FMT的区别。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6830f3216aaff9dac057e352\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"强调了当前临床研究中益生菌制剂的非标准化、商业产品的标签准确性问题、以及饮食/抗生素/种族等混杂因素的复杂性。提出了整合纵向多组学、ex vivo assays和gut-on-a-chip模型的必要性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::114f3b3942444b88c43854a5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"引用Spencer等人的研究，显示非标准化的商业益生菌补充剂在小鼠模型和人类队列中可能损害ICI反应，减少IFN-γ阳性T细胞。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::960d60a84711ed898ae3e67f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该综述主要关注肠道微生物组，虽然提及皮肤、肺等其他部位微生物，但核心证据集中在肠道。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d798c8e48d06d32471513b4a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"临床数据主要来自回顾性研究和早期试点试验，缺乏大型III期RCT结果，因此任何关于疗效的结论都带有强烈的观察性关联性质，而非确证性因果证据。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::61e55c65ca40d7a2eecea481\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"机制描述多基于小鼠模型，直接应用于人类需谨慎，因为人鼠微生物组和免疫系统存在差异。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::31ab31711e6241723cdfa314\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"文中提到的“益生菌”涵盖从商业混合补充剂到定义明确的单一菌株（如CBM588），两者在成分、质量控制和潜在效果上截然不同，比较时需严格区分。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c16be694b7f8f95168cc4cea\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-d48cd64bd12b302ad2ba\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-76a4a344a1a9861e53c5\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-95bd9a77b14edf06222c\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"assets\",\n              \"reason\": \"supplementaryFiles_fetch_transport_TimeoutError\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c3f7025f5aaf7b16f46e7943\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0217\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b1a5341367d4fe3983fade90\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0217\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6324c354c13d7e2ed705c1c9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0217\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"作为一篇综述，本文通过系统梳理免疫学、分子病理学和放射组学的多学科证据，构建了一个整合性的“骨骼肌-肌动蛋白-肠道损伤-修复”调控网络。具体路线包括：1. 描述直肠癌TME的组成及其在免疫治疗下的动态重塑；2. 详细分析ICI诱导肠道损伤的核心机制（T细胞毒性、炎症风暴、菌群失调、血管/代谢紊乱、基质纤维化）；3. 引入骨骼肌作为非肿瘤因素，解析关键肌动蛋白（IL-6, IL-15, Irisin）的信号通路及其双向调节作用；4. 总结多模态影像技术在量化监测黏膜、血管和纤维化病变中的应用；5. 提出基于肌动蛋白稳态恢复的分层修复与管理方案。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2d5162d6cd233004604796a7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0217\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"构建了以肌动蛋白为核心的“骨骼肌-肠道”交互调控网络，将全身性肌肉状态与局部肠道免疫毒性联系起来，超越了以往仅关注局部肠道损伤的视角。\",\n          \"limits\": \"主要基于现有文献的理论综合和机制推演，缺乏大规模前瞻性临床队列数据验证肌动蛋白作为预测生物标志物的特异性截断值和多中心标准化协议。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b2d7496150d88e8dc1579990\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0217\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了从分子机制到多模态影像表型再到分层干预策略的完整转化链条，为临床精准干预提供了系统性框架。\",\n          \"limits\": \"许多提出的干预策略（如肌动蛋白靶向药物、特定运动营养方案）仍处于临床前研究或早期临床试验阶段，尚未成为标准护理流程。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ae370a00b74f470391e6b856\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0217\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"在dMMR/MSI-H直肠癌TME中\",\n          \"finding\": \"ICI通过阻断PD-1/PD-L1和CTLA-4通路解除免疫抑制，但过度激活的CD8+ T细胞会错误识别肠上皮细胞抗原，导致黏膜溃疡和穿孔。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::dc967120324ff4312b8260e3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0217\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"骨骼肌健康状态良好时\",\n          \"finding\": \"分泌保护性肌动蛋白IL-15和Irisin，分别通过JAK/STAT5和CSF-1/STAT3通路增强抗肿瘤免疫并抑制M2型巨噬细胞极化，从而保护肠黏膜屏障。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::68f1f7fb0220bd4f57d34afe\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0217\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"存在肌肉萎缩（Sarcopenia）时\",\n          \"finding\": \"病理性高浓度IL-6持续激活NF-κB和JAK/STAT3通路，引发炎症风暴并促进成纤维细胞活化，加剧肠道炎症和纤维化，形成“肌肉萎缩-肠道损伤”恶性循环。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::796aaea2ba6098e425ca1a27\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0217\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"应用多模态影像技术时\",\n          \"finding\": \"NBI可早期发现黏膜糜烂和隐窝破坏；EUS-SWE可定量评估组织弹性以区分炎症水肿与不可逆纤维化；PET-CT可通过SUV值量化免疫细胞浸润和代谢活性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::32dbc1f152adbfb434a35f5a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0217\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::36524ce30e3a3dcf0584c6dc\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0217\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管ICI对dMMR/MSI-H直肠癌疗效显著，但过度激活的免疫系统会导致严重的ICI相关结直肠损伤（ICI-CRI），且现有研究往往孤立地关注肠道免疫毒性或肌肉萎缩。本研究旨在阐明ICI-CRI的复杂病理机制，特别是骨骼肌-肌动蛋白轴在其中的核心调控作用，并整合影像学评估与分层修复策略，以解决免疫治疗中疗效与毒性平衡的临床难题。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2c5af816b476608df7b0cace\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0217\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"直肠癌（Rectal Cancer）免疫治疗，特别是针对dMMR/MSI-H亚型的免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）治疗；聚焦于ICI相关的结直肠损伤（ICI-CRI）及其与骨骼肌健康、肌动蛋白分泌的关联。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::29fbcbaf11332588955333ca\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0217\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该综述系统阐述了直肠癌肿瘤微环境（TME）的特征及免疫治疗引起的动态重塑，重点探讨了ICI诱导的结直肠损伤（ICI-CRI）的多重病理机制，包括CD8+ T细胞介导的细胞毒性、炎症因子风暴、肠道菌群失调导致的内毒素易位、微血管低灌注和基质纤维化。文章创新性地提出了“骨骼肌-肌动蛋白-肠道损伤”调控轴，指出骨骼肌分泌的肌动蛋白（IL-6, IL-15, Irisin）在调节抗肿瘤免疫与维持肠道稳态之间起核心作用：IL-15和Irisin具有保护作用，而过度分泌的IL-6则加剧炎症。此外，综述还介绍了结合多模态影像（如NBI结肠镜、EUS-SWE、PET-CT）和放射组学的定量监测方法，以及包括阶梯式免疫抑制、微生态重建、代谢支持和肌肉靶向运动/营养在内的分层修复策略，旨在为个性化直肠癌免疫治疗提供理论参考，以最大化疗效并减少胃肠道毒性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4b2107dd86fc8bcb2305e4ff\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0217\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"未直接提供菌群改变ICI抗肿瘤疗效的直接因果证据，而是侧重于其在毒性放大中的作用。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了肠道菌群失调（如Akkermansia muciniphila减少，致病菌增殖）导致LPS易位并激活TLR4/NF-κB通路的机制描述，解释了菌群变化如何加剧ICI引起的全身和局部炎症。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::164e8028853a939519cae127\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0217\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"主要关注肌动蛋白介导的机制，未深入探讨菌群代谢产物（如短链脂肪酸）对肌动蛋白分泌的直接调控细节，需结合其他文献完善菌群-肌肉互作机制。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"详细阐述了肌动蛋白（IL-6, IL-15, Irisin）信号通路如何调节免疫细胞功能（CD8+ T细胞、NK细胞、Tregs、巨噬细胞）和肠道屏障完整性，揭示了肌肉-肠道轴在介导ICI效应中的分子机制。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::adcbb36487e510b419a3f23e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0217\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"综述中关于直肠癌TME异质性（热肿瘤vs冷肿瘤）与免疫治疗响应关系的描述，以及骨骼肌作为全身免疫调节器官的概念。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::224903bcc9290c238b45be18\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0217\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"提到的肌肉萎缩患者更易发生严重ICI-Colitis，以及通过运动/营养改善肌动蛋白谱后可减轻损伤的案例。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cf32a97997422d3a95a713de\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0217\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"多模态影像（NBI, EUS-SWE, PET-CT）在评估ICI相关肠道损伤严重程度和纤维化阶段的临床应用价值。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f3c7290bcf33b550b4efd818\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0217\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该综述主要聚焦于直肠癌，特别是dMMR/MSI-H亚型，其结论外推至其他实体瘤或MSS型结直肠癌时需考虑TME异质性差异。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::906b28d3abb5c3b0d77174ec\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0217\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"肌动蛋白的作用多为机制推演和小型研究支持，尚缺乏大规模随机对照试验证实肌动蛋白靶向治疗的普适性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1793f9e7fa6bcfbb48823768\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0217\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"影像学生物标志物的标准化和外部验证仍在进行中，不同中心的阈值可能存在差异。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e66db4425b281195b80a0cf6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0217\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-d48cd64bd12b302ad2ba\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-1174ae9904050ba25888\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-cf2fc9e893310420ac34\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-2ff301984ba9cb234942\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-46db1207a4d1cf0f573f\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"assets\",\n              \"reason\": \"supplementaryFiles_fetch_transport_TimeoutError\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2620179246640ac636d56bd9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0284\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c66fbeaa280c108e014af7cc\",\n          \"snapshot::384337303cf1d585cd3ac32a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b79fd70d6332212f4813f1df\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0284\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c66fbeaa280c108e014af7cc\",\n          \"snapshot::384337303cf1d585cd3ac32a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::14e691e33244b8717f4d127f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0284\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The research design involves three main components: 1) Clinical Cohort Analysis: Retrospective and prospective analysis of three independent cohorts (melanoma and NSCLC) to assess the association between irAE grades and survival outcomes, correcting for immortal time bias. 2) Microbiome Profiling: Shotgun metagenomics and high-throughput culturomics were performed on fecal samples from patients at baseline and at the onset of ir-colitis to characterize taxonomic shifts and isolate viable bacteria. 3) Functional Validation: Fecal microbiota transplantation (FMT) from ir-colitis patients into antibiotic-treated mice to assess effects on tumor growth and inflammation. Specific isolates (P. bifermentans, C. paraputrificum, P. sordellii) were tested in vitro (Caco-2 co-culture for barrier integrity and cytokine expression) and in vivo (oral gavage in DSS colitis and MCA-205 tumor models) to determine direct effects. Cell-free supernatants and heat-killed bacteria were also tested to distinguish live-bacteria-dependent effects from metabolite-mediated effects.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c66fbeaa280c108e014af7cc\",\n          \"snapshot::384337303cf1d585cd3ac32a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7338e32444ea409cd35d5626\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0284\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"Provides empirical evidence linking specific gut bacteria (P. bifermentans) to both irAE pathogenesis and enhanced ICI efficacy through distinct mechanisms (barrier disruption vs. metabolite secretion).\",\n          \"limits\": \"The exact nature of the active < 3 kDa metabolite and its precise immune mechanism remain unidentified. The study relies on a limited number of matched longitudinal samples and mouse models that may not fully recapitulate human ir-colitis complexity.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c66fbeaa280c108e014af7cc\",\n          \"snapshot::384337303cf1d585cd3ac32a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ad228a9a09cf1bde833cd70d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0284\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Three independent cohorts of melanoma and NSCLC patients treated with ICI\",\n          \"finding\": \"Grade ≥ 2 irAEs are associated with significantly longer overall survival and progression-free survival, even after adjusting for immortal time bias.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c66fbeaa280c108e014af7cc\",\n          \"snapshot::384337303cf1d585cd3ac32a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f0f8a256e3b6de3f1f5a7dfd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0284\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Baseline stool samples from melanoma patients analyzed via shotgun metagenomics\",\n          \"finding\": \"Patients developing grade ≥ 2 irAEs exhibited lower alpha diversity and enrichment of pro-inflammatory taxa including Ruminococcus gnavus and Streptococcus vestibularis compared to those without irAEs.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c66fbeaa280c108e014af7cc\",\n          \"snapshot::384337303cf1d585cd3ac32a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::69d42911848667bdf02843e3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0284\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Stool samples from patients with ir-colitis analyzed via culturomics\",\n          \"finding\": \"Paraclostridium bifermentans was isolated and found to be enriched in patients with acute ir-colitis compared to baseline or non-ir-colitis controls.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c66fbeaa280c108e014af7cc\",\n          \"snapshot::384337303cf1d585cd3ac32a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4d3393b35296f0c4133f8239\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0284\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"In vivo mouse models receiving FMT from ir-colitis patients\",\n          \"finding\": \"FMT induced surrogate markers of intestinal inflammation (increased Lcn-2 and LPS) and enhanced the anti-tumor efficacy of dual anti-PD-1/CTLA-4 therapy.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c66fbeaa280c108e014af7cc\",\n          \"snapshot::384337303cf1d585cd3ac32a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e7e6394717aa4609a837b993\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0284\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"In vitro Caco-2 monolayer co-culture with P. bifermentans\",\n          \"finding\": \"Live P. bifermentans disrupted epithelial barrier integrity (reduced ZO-1 and Occludin signals) and increased pro-inflammatory cytokines (TNF-α and IL-1β); this effect was not observed with cell-free supernatant.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c66fbeaa280c108e014af7cc\",\n          \"snapshot::384337303cf1d585cd3ac32a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bd05dd22bf395b6bb6a493e0\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0284\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"In vivo murine tumor model with oral gavage of P. bifermentans derivatives\",\n          \"finding\": \"Oral administration of P. bifermentans enhanced anti-tumor response to dual ICI; this beneficial effect was retained by cell-free supernatant filtered to < 3 kDa, indicating mediation by a small-molecule metabolite rather than live bacteria.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c66fbeaa280c108e014af7cc\",\n          \"snapshot::384337303cf1d585cd3ac32a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::894d9adbbc30a71c986943d3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0284\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c66fbeaa280c108e014af7cc\",\n          \"snapshot::384337303cf1d585cd3ac32a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::de73fe9ade530a582fbcc4a4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0284\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The study aims to resolve the mechanism underlying the observed correlation between irAEs and improved ICI efficacy. Specifically, it seeks to determine if specific gut microbial signatures predict irAEs and efficacy, and to identify causal bacterial agents that might drive both inflammation and anti-tumor responses.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c66fbeaa280c108e014af7cc\",\n          \"snapshot::384337303cf1d585cd3ac32a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::70fc3918076487e962a70529\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0284\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The study focuses on patients with advanced melanoma and non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC) treated with immune checkpoint inhibitors (ICI). It investigates the relationship between gut microbiome composition, the development of immune-related adverse events (irAEs), and clinical outcomes (overall survival and progression-free survival). The research combines clinical cohort analysis with shotgun metagenomics and culturomics to identify specific bacterial taxa and their functional roles.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c66fbeaa280c108e014af7cc\",\n          \"snapshot::384337303cf1d585cd3ac32a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4ae76f027dd241b7100eeee0\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0284\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"This study addresses the paradoxical link between immune-related adverse events (irAEs) and improved efficacy in ICI therapy by dissecting the role of the gut microbiome. Using three independent cohorts totaling 589 patients with melanoma or NSCLC, the authors first validated that grade ≥ 2 irAEs are associated with significantly longer overall survival and progression-free survival, even after adjusting for immortal time bias. They then employed a combined approach of shotgun metagenomics and culturomics on fecal samples collected at baseline and during ir-colitis onset. Metagenomic analysis revealed that patients developing irAEs had lower alpha diversity and enrichment of pro-inflammatory taxa such as Ruminococcus gnavus and Streptococcus vestibularis. Culturomics identified Paraclostridium bifermentans as enriched in patients with acute ir-colitis. Functional validation in mice demonstrated that fecal microbiota transplantation from an ir-colitis patient induced subclinical colitis markers and enhanced anti-tumor activity of dual ICI. Specifically, P. bifermentans was shown to disrupt epithelial barrier integrity in vitro and exacerbate colitis in vivo via live bacteria interaction, while its anti-tumor benefit was mediated by a secreted low-molecular-weight metabolite (< 3 kDa). These findings provide a mechanistic link suggesting that specific pro-inflammatory bacteria can simultaneously drive toxicity and enhance therapeutic efficacy.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c66fbeaa280c108e014af7cc\",\n          \"snapshot::384337303cf1d585cd3ac32a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3aba09de1928023c017e60a8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0284\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Comparison of metagenomics and culturomics results showing that culturomics recovers live, low-abundance bacteria (like P. bifermentans) missed or less characterized by sequencing alone.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c66fbeaa280c108e014af7cc\",\n          \"snapshot::384337303cf1d585cd3ac32a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::68b54a3451f1ab3d7966a2e1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0284\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Discussion of immortal time bias in analyzing irAE-survival associations and the correction applied in this study.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c66fbeaa280c108e014af7cc\",\n          \"snapshot::384337303cf1d585cd3ac32a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e80331c46c052c7581ada8d5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0284\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"The association is observational; causality is inferred through subsequent mechanistic studies but not proven in the clinical cohort alone. Results may vary by cancer type and geography.\",\n          \"contribution\": \"Validates the clinical association between irAEs and improved ICI outcomes across multiple solid tumor cohorts (melanoma and NSCLC), confirming that higher-grade irAEs correlate with longer OS and PFS. Identifies specific microbial signatures (e.g., S. vestibularis, H. porci) associated with both irAE and response states.\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c66fbeaa280c108e014af7cc\",\n          \"snapshot::384337303cf1d585cd3ac32a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f5b77f6f89c89b517fbf6126\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0284\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"The mechanism is derived from mouse models and in vitro assays; the exact metabolite identity is unknown. The effect of live bacteria on barrier integrity is distinct from the metabolite's effect on tumor response, highlighting complex, context-dependent interactions.\",\n          \"contribution\": \"Demonstrates a specific mechanism where Paraclostridium bifermentans enhances ICI efficacy via a secreted low-molecular-weight metabolite (< 3 kDa), while simultaneously causing ir-colitis through live-bacteria-induced epithelial barrier disruption. Shows that FMT from ir-colitis patients transfers both inflammatory potential and enhanced ICI response.\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c66fbeaa280c108e014af7cc\",\n          \"snapshot::384337303cf1d585cd3ac32a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9964b8d843b952c18995daf5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0284\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The study identifies P. bifermentans as a key player, but the exact metabolite responsible for the anti-tumor effect is not characterized; do not overstate the specificity of the molecular mechanism.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c66fbeaa280c108e014af7cc\",\n          \"snapshot::384337303cf1d585cd3ac32a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1482d971688f8c6a45f4eb09\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0284\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Mouse models used (MCA-205, DSS) have limitations in fully recapitulating human ir-colitis; results should be framed as preclinical evidence supporting human observations.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c66fbeaa280c108e014af7cc\",\n          \"snapshot::384337303cf1d585cd3ac32a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c16c42850044684ec971f685\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0284\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The 'dual role' of P. bifermentans involves two different mechanisms (live bacteria for toxicity, metabolite for efficacy); ensure this distinction is clear when citing.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c66fbeaa280c108e014af7cc\",\n          \"snapshot::384337303cf1d585cd3ac32a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cafb8802dcc1f5812d97e5ec\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0284\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Clinical associations are based on retrospective/prospective cohorts with potential confounders; causality is established primarily through animal models, not clinical intervention.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c66fbeaa280c108e014af7cc\",\n          \"snapshot::384337303cf1d585cd3ac32a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6bf40b4009f92b8ad4a0426c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0284\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-7974b6c4dd5220685baa\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-95bd9a77b14edf06222c\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-5c752c0f8036d5742e42\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-a7194a689f46f19f0fc9\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-5f82ba52a99d38e52a55\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"assets\",\n              \"reason\": \"supplementaryFiles_fetch_body_too_large\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c66fbeaa280c108e014af7cc\",\n          \"snapshot::384337303cf1d585cd3ac32a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4592207a67511b3fef7ce24a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0472\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b76c4adfad47d59dd2f7f125\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0472\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6e63b53d0ba24e85b6ba1c2e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0472\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"作为一篇综述，本文采用主题综合路线：1. 背景引入：阐述CIT的临床现状、耐药性及代谢组学在理解肿瘤-免疫互作中的价值。2. 微生物调控机制：综述微生物群对免疫过程的影响，比较益生菌干预的争议性结果（如小鼠模型 vs 人类数据）。3. 关键代谢物分析：分章节深入讨论SCFA（乙酸、丙酸、丁酸等）的作用机制（HDAC抑制、GPCR激活）、对T细胞分化/记忆的影响，以及色氨酸-犬尿氨酸通路的免疫抑制机制。4. 临床证据汇总：整合来自不同癌症类型（黑色素瘤、NSCLC等）的患者队列研究，列举特定代谢物水平与无进展生存期（PFS）或总生存期（OS）的相关性。5. 转化与挑战：讨论直接补充代谢物的可行性、纳米递送策略的前景，以及IDO抑制剂临床试验失败的原因分析。6. 展望：提出将代谢组学纳入临床实践以监测疗效和不良事件的建议。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5cb634b8325cfd02a65a8a73\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0472\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"系统梳理了肠道微生物代谢物（SCFA、色氨酸代谢物）在CIT疗效中的双重作用（促进效应T细胞 vs 诱导耐受/抑制），提供了从分子机制到临床生物标志物的全景视图。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给摘要未交代具体的文献检索策略、纳入排除标准及质量评价方法，属于叙述性综述而非系统性综述。部分结论基于小规模临床研究或动物模型，外推至人类需谨慎。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8abb75f525dd23cd11bc2152\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0472\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"指出了IDO抑制剂临床试验失败的潜在原因（剂量、患者选择、缺乏代谢物监测），为未来试验设计提供反思。\",\n          \"limits\": \"对于SCFA直接补充在肿瘤患者中的安全性及有效性，目前仅停留在理论推测和小规模自身免疫病数据支持阶段，缺乏大规模肿瘤临床试验证据。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ff180dbefd6306f9f063d425\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0472\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"黑色素瘤和肾癌患者接受CIT治疗\",\n          \"finding\": \"基线至第4周犬尿氨酸/色氨酸（Kyn/Trp）比率增加超过50%的患者，其总生存期显著低于比率降低的患者（黑色素瘤中位OS 15.7个月 vs >38个月；肾癌中16.7个月 vs 31.3个月）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::472b9e06c54aa635de7e36dc\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0472\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者接受二线Nivolumab治疗\",\n          \"finding\": \"粪便中丙酸、丁酸、赖氨酸和烟酸的升高水平与超过12个月的无进展生存期（PFS）相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::325542a47112ac639ab70471\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0472\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"黑色素瘤患者接受CIT治疗\",\n          \"finding\": \"响应者血浆中乳酸水平显著高于非响应者，而丙酮酸水平较低，提示响应者T细胞向糖酵解模式发生代谢重编程；而非响应者血清中丙酮酸和丙氨酸水平较高。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4f421cf3b56d28545ad0ddd8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0472\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"小鼠黑色素瘤模型\",\n          \"finding\": \"补充商业益生菌（如长双歧杆菌、鼠李糖乳杆菌）反而导致肿瘤增大，伴随浸润性IFN-γ产生CD8+ T细胞频率降低；而罗伊氏乳杆菌（L. reuteri）通过释放吲哚-3-甲醛（I3A）激活AhR受体，增强了抗肿瘤免疫。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f5cc992ca1f801835d1ca7de\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0472\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"自身免疫性疾病（如多发性硬化症、类风湿关节炎）\",\n          \"finding\": \"SCFA（如丙酸）补充可增加调节性T细胞（Tregs）数量和功能，表明其在免疫调节方面的潜力，但在肿瘤学中尚未系统应用。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7c0e2107b5b03c47befa9327\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0472\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e5b4ce3810bfd1ebf3668070\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0472\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管CIT是实体瘤治疗的常规手段，但存在显著的耐药性和进展问题，且缺乏可靠的预测性生物标志物。本研究旨在理解肿瘤-药物-免疫系统相互作用中的动态事件，特别是通过代谢组学视角，探索如何利用微生物衍生的代谢物来增强免疫反应、克服耐药性，并识别潜在的预测性生物标志物。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b644c59cb5947b8ca365930c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0472\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"免疫检查点抑制剂（CIT）治疗下的实体瘤患者；聚焦于肠道微生物群及其代谢产物（特别是短链脂肪酸SCFA和色氨酸代谢物）对免疫系统及肿瘤微环境（TME）的影响。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d3110b273e34a9383ac3de88\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0472\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"这是一篇2025年发表的综述文章，旨在探讨免疫代谢在优化CIT疗效中的作用。文章首先指出CIT面临耐药性和生物标志物缺乏的挑战，随后系统回顾了肠道微生物衍生的代谢物如何调节免疫反应。重点讨论了短链脂肪酸（SCFA）通过表观遗传和代谢重编程增强CD8+ T细胞功能及记忆形成，以及色氨酸分解代谢（IDO1/Kynurenine通路）作为原发性CIT失败预测因子的角色。此外，文章还分析了葡萄糖、氨基酸和脂质等其他代谢特征与CIT预后的关联，并评估了直接补充代谢物或靶向递送策略的潜力，同时指出了当前临床转化的局限性和未来方向。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7153f06a14631bf9868707e4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0472\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"样本量较小（如Botticelli et al. n=11, Nomura et al. n=52），且不同研究间代谢物测量部位（粪便vs血浆）和癌症类型不同，结果可能存在异质性。不能直接推断因果关系，仅为观察性关联。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了肠道微生物代谢物影响CIT疗效的具体临床关联证据。例如，粪便SCFA水平与NSCLC患者PFS的正相关性，以及色氨酸代谢异常与黑色素瘤/肾癌患者OS的负相关性。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::45f344091216d4c71eef5c6a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0472\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"许多机制细节源自小鼠模型（如germ-free mice, adoptive transfer），需注明物种差异限制。作者提到的“代谢重编程”多为假设性解释，需结合其他实验验证。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"详细阐述了微生物代谢物调节免疫细胞的分子机制。包括：1) SCFA通过抑制HDAC和激活GPCRs（如GPR43, GPR41）促进CD8+ T细胞效应功能和记忆形成；2) 色氨酸分解通过IDO1途径产生犬尿氨酸，抑制T细胞增殖并诱导Treg分化；3) 代谢重编程（如糖酵解增强）对T细胞功能的重要性。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9a856efced7c50c546f85e0c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0472\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"主要依据是小鼠预临床数据，人类数据有限且多为自我报告或小型观察性研究。不能据此推荐或反对通用的益生菌使用。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了关于益生菌干预效果的矛盾证据。指出某些商业益生菌在小鼠模型中损害抗肿瘤免疫，而特定菌株（L. reuteri）可能有益，强调了菌株特异性和情境依赖性。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6dbc35e5cf5535a7ebc5da63\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0472\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"综述提到血清代谢组学（LC-MS, GC-MS）可捕捉全身代谢改变，而单细胞/空间代谢组学可解析TME内的异质性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6b2af9ea78a9935c166d18ba\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0472\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"ECHO-301/Keynote 252试验显示Epacadostat联合Pembrolizumab无显著获益，原因可能包括剂量不足、缺乏患者分层（基于IDO表达或代谢物水平）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2d34be80767bef25aff627b6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0472\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"升高的Kyn/Trp比率与更高的irAEs风险相关；脂质代谢改变可区分结肠炎或肝炎患者。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a4976b183bc0da1823b2cb1f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0472\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该综述为叙述性综述，非系统性综述，其结论代表作者对现有文献的综合解读，而非经过严格统计合并的证据等级。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::301c565beaa0d2a05578fee4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0472\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"文中引用的多项临床研究样本量较小，且多为回顾性或横断面研究，因果推断能力有限。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3406fd57edb20293d70fa2d4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0472\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"动物模型（尤其是无菌小鼠）的结果不能直接外推到人类，需注意种属间免疫系统和微生物组的差异。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3ad20de80a3b89756f8f17e5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0472\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"关于SCFA补充剂的讨论主要基于自身免疫病数据和理论推导，在肿瘤患者中的安全性和有效性尚未经过大规模随机对照试验证实。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f8e3583a651a78554481cd0f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0472\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"IDO抑制剂临床试验的失败并不意味着IDO通路不重要，而是提示当前治疗策略或试验设计的局限性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cbf74d700e02472eb82c54b6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0472\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8e55a8c9d389564d56630951\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0462\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51342908369a3d1c46566ac3\",\n          \"snapshot::59aab1e2a170fac4e9fc15c6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::69b79394d0726b95b6065fa9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0462\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51342908369a3d1c46566ac3\",\n          \"snapshot::59aab1e2a170fac4e9fc15c6\",\n          \"snapshot::0e9c11fd9439a46e9f2334bc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1788373d25e3a170db3bb0aa\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0462\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"1. 队列设计：两项前瞻性非随机队列（宏基因组n=54，代谢组n=49），基于疗效（PFI≥1年）和irAE严重程度（≥2级）将患者分为获益组、严重irAE组和耐药组。采用地标分析（Landmark analysis）以1年为界评估irAE，减少 immortal time bias。2. 多组学分析：宏基因组测序鉴定物种丰度、共现网络、功能通路（如SCFA合成基因）；代谢组GC-MS定量SCFA。3. 分子模拟分析：将微生物序列与自身免疫疾病抗原库及肺癌抗原/抗癌肽数据库比对，识别交叉反应表位。4. 菌株水平分析：使用StrainPhlAn分析大肠杆菌和普拉梭菌的SGBs变异及系统发育信号。5. 外部验证：在McCulloch（黑色素瘤ICI）、Routy（NSCLC ICI）等公共数据集上验证SCFA预测值和抗原模拟结果。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51342908369a3d1c46566ac3\",\n          \"snapshot::59aab1e2a170fac4e9fc15c6\",\n          \"snapshot::0e9c11fd9439a46e9f2334bc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::27dd931bd58169567e4a4506\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0462\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"首次提供实证证据支持微生物组通过分子模拟驱动irAEs（自身免疫抗原模拟）和ICI疗效（肿瘤抗原模拟）的假设。揭示了长期获益者特有的紧凑微生物网络和丁酸高产能力。明确了菌株水平变异（而非仅物种丰度）对临床表型的决定性作用。\",\n          \"limits\": \"样本量较小（宏基因组n=54，代谢组n=49），可能限制统计效力。抗原模拟分析依赖于公共数据库中的已知表位，可能遗漏未表征的关键表位。菌株分析仅针对丰度较高的少数物种。所有样本为基线采集，无法反映治疗过程中的动态变化。外部验证队列的治疗方案和肿瘤类型不完全一致（如黑色素瘤vs肺癌）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51342908369a3d1c46566ac3\",\n          \"snapshot::59aab1e2a170fac4e9fc15c6\",\n          \"snapshot::0e9c11fd9439a46e9f2334bc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::48c7437a9bc25839f3746846\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0462\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"对比获益组与耐药组（宏基因组预测+代谢组验证）\",\n          \"finding\": \"获益组富集丙酸（P=0.01）和丁酸/异丁酸（P=0.12/0.02）。乙酸、丙酸、丁酸水平越高，PFS越长，肿瘤进展风险越低（HR<1, P<0.05）。丁酸生产主要受乙酰辅酶A途径介导。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51342908369a3d1c46566ac3\",\n          \"snapshot::59aab1e2a170fac4e9fc15c6\",\n          \"snapshot::0e9c11fd9439a46e9f2334bc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a4e6d4ef4b3160f0c43baaa5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0462\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"对比irAE组与非irAE组\",\n          \"finding\": \"irAE患者微生物中与系统性红斑狼疮（SLE）、皮肤/结缔组织自身免疫病相关的抗原表位对齐数量更多，特别是在免疫性结肠炎患者中SLE相关表位显著富集（P=0.04）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51342908369a3d1c46566ac3\",\n          \"snapshot::59aab1e2a170fac4e9fc15c6\",\n          \"snapshot::0e9c11fd9439a46e9f2334bc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f2e549ea2a38a11164f7f0ca\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0462\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"对比高疗效组与低疗效组\",\n          \"finding\": \"高疗效组微生物中与肺癌相关的抗原和抗癌肽（ACP）表位对齐数量更多（P=0.07/0.06），并在Routy队列中得到部分验证（P=0.02）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51342908369a3d1c46566ac3\",\n          \"snapshot::59aab1e2a170fac4e9fc15c6\",\n          \"snapshot::0e9c11fd9439a46e9f2334bc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7cfa37c4ed6bd29db16e931a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0462\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"特定物种（大肠杆菌、普拉梭菌）\",\n          \"finding\": \"菌株水平变异与临床表型强相关。例如，普拉梭菌SGB15342在获益组中富集，而SGB15323/332_group倾向出现在严重irAE组。不同组间存在高突变率，表明菌株特异性决定功能。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51342908369a3d1c46566ac3\",\n          \"snapshot::59aab1e2a170fac4e9fc15c6\",\n          \"snapshot::0e9c11fd9439a46e9f2334bc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bd986072923c2c8b143e0469\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0462\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51342908369a3d1c46566ac3\",\n          \"snapshot::59aab1e2a170fac4e9fc15c6\",\n          \"snapshot::0e9c11fd9439a46e9f2334bc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f1aa6ce49462b4fc36bf4e98\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0462\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管已知肠道微生物组影响ICI的初始疗效和irAEs，但其对长期生存获益的具体影响及底层机制（如代谢物、分子模拟、菌株变异）尚不清楚。特别是区分长期获益者与耐药者或仅发生irAE者的微生物特征差异。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51342908369a3d1c46566ac3\",\n          \"snapshot::59aab1e2a170fac4e9fc15c6\",\n          \"snapshot::0e9c11fd9439a46e9f2334bc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8723f2c5d07d798f6a11ec0f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0462\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"中国北京协和医院晚期非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者，接受抗PD-1/PD-L1免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗。研究聚焦于基线肠道微生物组与代谢组特征对长期疗效（无进展生存期PFI≥1年）及免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）的影响。样本分为长期获益组、严重irAE组和耐药组，并通过外部公共队列（McCulloch, Routy等）进行验证。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51342908369a3d1c46566ac3\",\n          \"snapshot::59aab1e2a170fac4e9fc15c6\",\n          \"snapshot::0e9c11fd9439a46e9f2334bc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6739f5f8fdd552af3ccd0592\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0462\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在阐明肠道微生物组如何影响肺癌患者ICI治疗的长期结局及其潜在机制。通过前瞻性收集基线粪便样本进行宏基因组和代谢组测序，结合临床随访数据，分析微生物组成、短链脂肪酸（SCFA）水平、分子模拟现象及菌株变异与临床表型的关系。研究发现，长期获益患者拥有更紧凑的微生物网络和高产丁酸/丙酸的能力；irAE患者的微生物中存在与自身免疫抗原相似的表位；响应患者的微生物中富含与肺癌抗原相似的表位；且特定物种（如大肠杆菌和普拉梭菌）的菌株水平变异与临床表型显著相关。这些发现为“智能”粪菌移植提供了理论依据。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51342908369a3d1c46566ac3\",\n          \"snapshot::59aab1e2a170fac4e9fc15c6\",\n          \"snapshot::0e9c11fd9439a46e9f2334bc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1853254a590326de7a98b136\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0462\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"数据主要来自肺癌患者，虽在黑色素瘤队列中验证了丙酸/丁酸趋势，但需注意肿瘤类型的异质性。关联性强，但因果链条需结合其他干预研究理解。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了SCFAs（乙酸、丙酸、丁酸）作为预测ICI长期疗效的生物标志物的实证数据。具体指出丁酸生产依赖乙酰辅酶A途径，且高水平SCFA与延长PFS和降低进展风险相关。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51342908369a3d1c46566ac3\",\n          \"snapshot::59aab1e2a170fac4e9fc15c6\",\n          \"snapshot::0e9c11fd9439a46e9f2334bc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9d439e44dd010530a60fd704\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0462\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"分子模拟的证据基于序列同源性比对，属于相关性/预测性证据，尚未通过体内实验直接证明T细胞交叉反应。抗原数据库可能存在偏差。菌株分析仅限于少数物种。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提出了并初步验证了“分子模拟”机制：1) 微生物抗原模拟宿主自身免疫抗原导致irAEs（特别是SLE相关表位在结肠炎患者中富集）；2) 微生物抗原模拟肿瘤抗原增强ICI疗效。同时强调了菌株特异性（如大肠杆菌毒力基因簇）在决定irAE或耐药中的作用。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51342908369a3d1c46566ac3\",\n          \"snapshot::59aab1e2a170fac4e9fc15c6\",\n          \"snapshot::0e9c11fd9439a46e9f2334bc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f9084d13af5236dab61bb354\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0462\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Co-occurrence networks showing compactness in benefit group; enrichment of butyrate producers like F. prausnitzii, Blautia.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51342908369a3d1c46566ac3\",\n          \"snapshot::59aab1e2a170fac4e9fc15c6\",\n          \"snapshot::0e9c11fd9439a46e9f2334bc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::12d03fe22e6c6021e4b4f5e8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0462\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Discussion section proposing 'smart' FMT based on strain dynamics and antigen mimicry profiles.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51342908369a3d1c46566ac3\",\n          \"snapshot::59aab1e2a170fac4e9fc15c6\",\n          \"snapshot::0e9c11fd9439a46e9f2334bc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fdc428f23c1a35942c603cdd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0462\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究的分子模拟结论是基于生物信息学预测（序列比对），并非直接的免疫学功能验证（如T细胞克隆追踪），在综述中应表述为“提示”或“初步证据”，而非确证机制。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51342908369a3d1c46566ac3\",\n          \"snapshot::59aab1e2a170fac4e9fc15c6\",\n          \"snapshot::0e9c11fd9439a46e9f2334bc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a15aad3974479b8ec5c7e50f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0462\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"菌株水平的发现仅适用于大肠杆菌和普拉梭菌等丰度较高的物种，不能推广到所有微生物。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51342908369a3d1c46566ac3\",\n          \"snapshot::59aab1e2a170fac4e9fc15c6\",\n          \"snapshot::0e9c11fd9439a46e9f2334bc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d73df87bb79df88cf488a874\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0462\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"外部验证队列（McCulloch, Routy）在肿瘤类型和治疗方案上与主队列存在差异，解读时需考虑肿瘤微环境异质性的影响。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51342908369a3d1c46566ac3\",\n          \"snapshot::59aab1e2a170fac4e9fc15c6\",\n          \"snapshot::0e9c11fd9439a46e9f2334bc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9d5f0d5e9220739bab7fe6fd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0462\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"irAE分析采用了地标分析以校正时间偏倚，这是该方法学上的优势，但在比较不同研究时需注意终点定义的一致性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51342908369a3d1c46566ac3\",\n          \"snapshot::59aab1e2a170fac4e9fc15c6\",\n          \"snapshot::0e9c11fd9439a46e9f2334bc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::dba1ca498c98136c62e2487b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0462\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"supplement_materials\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": [\n          {\n            \"auxiliary_material\": \"The study employed landmark analysis to minimize immortal time bias in irAE assessment and validated efficacy-related metabolite findings in external cohorts (Routy, McCulloch). The discussion proposes a 'smart' fecal microbiota transplantation concept based on strain dynamics and antigen mimicry profiles. The study design was a non-randomized, unblinded, prospective cohort with median follow-up of 1167 days.\",\n            \"evidence\": [],\n            \"gap_id\": \"Ch6_gap_5\",\n            \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\body_full_staged_acceptance_20261004_40cny\\\\planning\\\\chapters\\\\external\\\\N4452dfb25f491e9335fe-5a6b848383c152a3\\\\round_2\\\\supplements\\\\Ch6_gap_5\\\\attempt-u2gi65cq\\\\source_units\\\\SU01_search_candidate_4e312d3d88\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n            \"limitations\": [],\n            \"material_ready\": true,\n            \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n            \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"remaining_gap\": \"The specific request for large-scale microbiome association studies focused on non-colitis irAEs (such as myocarditis or neurotoxicity) is not fulfilled by this material. While this study includes some non-colitis irAE cases (e.g., cardiovascular, muscle) within a composite 'severe irAE' group, the total sample size (n=13 for severe irAE) is small, and there is no dedicated large-scale analysis for specific non-colitis subtypes. The authors' own admission of limited sample size confirms the ongoing evidence gap regarding statistical power for specific irAE subtypes.\",\n            \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"status\": \"unmet\",\n            \"useful_material\": \"This study investigated gut microbiome and metabolome associations with long-term ICI outcomes and immune-related adverse events (irAEs) in a prospective cohort of lung cancer patients (metagenome n=54, metabolome n=49). The authors grouped patients into benefit, severe irAE, and resistance categories. The severe irAE group (n=13 in metagenome cohort) included various irAE types such as cardiovascular toxicity (2 cases), muscle toxicity (1 case), endocrine, skin, and gastrointestinal toxicities, rather than focusing exclusively on colitis. Mechanistically, the authors reported that microbiota sequences from irAE patients aligned with autoimmune antigenic epitopes (molecular mimicry), particularly noting SLE-related epitopes enriched in colitis patients, and that beneficial outcomes correlated with higher short-chain fatty acids (SCFAs) like butyrate and propionate. Strain-level variations in Escherichia coli and Faecalibacterium prausnitzii were also associated with clinical phenotypes. The authors explicitly stated in the limitations that the sample size was relatively small due to strict quality control and long-term follow-up requirements.\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51342908369a3d1c46566ac3\",\n          \"snapshot::59aab1e2a170fac4e9fc15c6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::41eac1d693544443b3b7f8f8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0462\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::51342908369a3d1c46566ac3\",\n          \"snapshot::59aab1e2a170fac4e9fc15c6\",\n          \"snapshot::0e9c11fd9439a46e9f2334bc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a51e25fe21f9f078bc3908f8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0462\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::0e9c11fd9439a46e9f2334bc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a206618928461fac1bccda86\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0126\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::55e8883400f09867671b14c1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0126\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::593dd584fb31d25664549f76\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0126\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"作为一篇Perspective文章，本研究未进行新的实验，而是基于对Blake等人原始实证研究的解读、现有文献（如ICB治疗中微生物的作用）的综合分析以及临床转化视角的评议。文章通过对比不同免疫疗法（ICB vs IAA）中微生物作用的异同，构建关于微生物介导毒性的理论框架，并讨论未来研究方向。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9d4e88c5861adeacfba25b2b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0126\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了肠道微生物群介导免疫激动剂抗体（IAA）特异性毒性的机制解释（MyD88依赖性炎症通路），区分了不同IAA靶点（CD40 vs CD137）下的效应细胞差异（巨噬细胞/中性粒细胞 vs CD8+ T细胞）。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给材料为评论性综述，未提供新的原始数据；未深入探讨具体致病菌株或代谢物；未解决抗生素治疗可能削弱整体免疫疗效的两难困境。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::63ab8a170400cc8b52e2a04f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0126\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"在抗CD40免疫激动剂抗体（IAA）治疗背景下\",\n          \"finding\": \"肠道微生物群的存在导致MyD88依赖性的巨噬细胞激活，进而产生TNFα、IL-6和IFN-I等炎症因子，引起急性肝损伤（巨噬细胞和中性粒细胞依赖）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4ba8c40c966a55ac69fa5c46\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0126\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"在抗CD137免疫激动剂抗体（IAA）治疗背景下\",\n          \"finding\": \"毒性同样收敛于宿主MyD88被肠道微生物激活，但导致的是CD8+ T细胞依赖的肝损伤和IFNγ驱动的系统性炎症。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::94d67c6b60c901743600ca1d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0126\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"无菌小鼠或经抗生素处理的小鼠模型\",\n          \"finding\": \"IAA治疗相关的毒性显著降低，且未观察到抗肿瘤免疫力的有害影响。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4198643ca5be7b342caa6236\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0126\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"perspective\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f26edbe5015e9f0921d1d9cb\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0126\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管已知肠道微生物影响癌症治疗反应，但其介导免疫激动剂抗体（IAA）毒性的具体机制尚不清楚，且如何平衡疗效与毒性仍是一个关键挑战。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fbd72622ace5bb68d2208e8a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0126\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"癌症免疫治疗中的肠道微生物群，特别是针对免疫激动剂抗体（IAA）的毒性机制；涉及临床前模型（小鼠）与人类临床观察的联系。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::432c07c02c59977b879fe092\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0126\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本文是一篇评论性文章（Perspective），主要评述了Blake等人近期在《Cell Reports Medicine》发表的研究成果。该研究通过临床前模型发现，肠道微生物群通过MyD88依赖性途径激活宿主免疫系统，导致在使用抗CD40和抗CD137等免疫激动剂抗体（IAA）治疗时引发严重的系统性炎症和肝毒性。作者指出，虽然抗生素清除菌群可减轻毒性，但也会损害其他免疫疗法的效果，因此强调需要更精细地靶向微生物-宿主互作的具体分子机制，而非简单使用广谱抗生素。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::91578d82f6254e6e4980051e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0126\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"主要针对免疫激动剂抗体（IAA）的毒性机制，而非直接解释免疫检查点抑制剂（ICB）的疗效增强机制；机制细节基于临床前小鼠模型，需警惕外推到人体的复杂性。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"详细阐述了肠道微生物通过MyD88通路介导IAA毒性的具体机制：在抗CD40治疗中，微生物激活巨噬细胞产生TNFα/IL-6/IFN-I导致肝损伤；在抗CD137治疗中，激活导致CD8+ T细胞依赖的IFNγ炎症。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::60c245848565553f2f3e83d1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0126\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"主要关联毒性而非直接提升疗效的机制；未提供具体的预测性菌株列表。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"指出肠道微生物多样性与特定菌群组成是预测免疫治疗反应和毒性的潜在生物标志物；提示微生物群落作为一个整体（consortium）发挥作用，而非单一物种。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f5846f438b9593af16963b6b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0126\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"文中提到“microbiome depletion using broad-spectrum antibiotics... significantly worsens clinical outcomes”以及未来需识别“specific, druggable proteins”。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::542895e293716593a2d566b0\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0126\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"文中对比了Figure 1中灰色箭头（ICB的STING机制）和红色箭头（IAA的MyD88机制）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::81a29a1875006bbddf313f11\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0126\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本文重点在于解释IAA的毒性机制，而非直接证明其对ICB疗效的增强机制，需注意区分这两种不同的临床结局。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::24416fef43446153d7d0a0d3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0126\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"所有机制证据均来自临床前小鼠模型（无菌鼠、抗生素处理鼠），直接外推至人类患者需谨慎，人类微生物组的复杂性和个体差异未被充分涵盖。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::08ff82200c729eacf8d1b850\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0126\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"文章明确指出未进行具体致病菌株的深度表征，因此不能将其作为确定特定风险菌种的依据。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::daea9a934bc79b30b3aea6c1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0126\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::27c32f0cbdf6aaf9019107c6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0149\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"abstract\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::458437782a562f994cbafc81\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4dd8dc1dc0429cdd4fb80643\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0149\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::458437782a562f994cbafc81\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::81e1c5626dc89331329fdfef\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0149\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用小鼠模型进行体内实验。具体设计包括：1. 构建心肌细胞限制性抗原表达的小鼠模型，以模拟心脏自身免疫情境；2. 应用不同的免疫检查点阻断策略（单独αPD-1、单独αCTLA-4、联合αCTLA-4+αPD-1），观察对CD8 T细胞扩增、心肌炎症及心律失常的影响；3. 通过遗传学手段（基因敲除CD8 T细胞来源的TNF）或药理学手段（阻断TNFR2）验证特定信号通路在心肌损伤中的作用；4. 评估干预措施对心脏毒性和抗肿瘤疗效的双重影响。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::458437782a562f994cbafc81\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e962b12cc27bd595176c8762\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0149\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"揭示了ICI心肌炎的一个非细胞毒性依赖机制：即CD8 T细胞来源的TNF通过TNFR2信号轴驱动炎症和心律失常，而非传统的穿孔素/颗粒酶途径。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给摘要未交代该机制在人类患者中的直接验证情况；未提供具体的临床数据或不同肿瘤类型间的比较；未详细阐述TNF阻断剂的具体类型或给药方案是否已在临床前完全优化。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::458437782a562f994cbafc81\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3831ae27277fe4952a56af75\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0149\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"联合使用αCTLA-4和αPD-1阻断\",\n          \"finding\": \"特异性诱导抗原特异性CD8 T细胞的强烈扩增、心肌炎症和致死性心律失常。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::458437782a562f994cbafc81\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::15686099d8908c840b0782e6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0149\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"单独使用αPD-1阻断\",\n          \"finding\": \"允许初始自身反应性CD8 T细胞的致敏和效应分化。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::458437782a562f994cbafc81\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9aa52ba7c24a9513afdb33b6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0149\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"同时抑制CTLA-4\",\n          \"finding\": \"在PD-1阻断基础上，显著放大心脏病理损伤。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::458437782a562f994cbafc81\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7c90b549ce2ddff0d0a64474\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0149\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"心肌损伤机制分析\",\n          \"finding\": \"损伤独立于穿孔素介导的细胞毒性，但关键依赖于T细胞来源的TNF，该TNF促进髓系细胞招募、细胞因子产生和心律失常。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::458437782a562f994cbafc81\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2695e8d8f452ddee02e24874\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0149\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"基因敲除CD8 T细胞来源的TNF或阻断TNFR2\",\n          \"finding\": \"成功预防了心脏毒性，同时保留了抗肿瘤疗效。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::458437782a562f994cbafc81\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3b1dbb4dc5e9240fc44f5bc6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0149\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::458437782a562f994cbafc81\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b47a52095995e6cdd12dc8d1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0149\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）虽能改善癌症生存率，但常引发致命的免疫相关不良事件，特别是暴发性心肌炎，且目前缺乏有效疗法。本研究试图解决的关键问题是：ICIs究竟通过何种具体免疫机制驱动心脏自身免疫和心肌损伤？\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::458437782a562f994cbafc81\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::375670dffbb10dcb97c630f1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0149\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）诱导的致命性心肌炎机制；研究对象为小鼠模型，通过心肌细胞限制性抗原表达模拟心脏自身免疫反应。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::458437782a562f994cbafc81\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::90fa68dcb73e696281128b29\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0149\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在阐明ICIs引发致死性心肌炎的分子机制。研究团队开发了一种小鼠模型，利用心肌细胞限制性抗原表达来定义ICIs如何驱动心脏自身免疫。研究发现，联合使用抗CTLA-4和抗PD-1抗体可特异性诱导抗原特异性CD8 T细胞的强烈扩增、心肌炎症和致死性心律失常。其中，PD-1阻断单独允许初始自身反应性CD8 T细胞的致敏和效应分化，而同时抑制CTLA-4则放大了心脏病理损伤。出乎意料的是，心肌损伤不依赖于穿孔素介导的细胞毒性，而是关键性地依赖于T细胞来源的TNF，后者促进了髓系细胞招募、细胞因子产生和心律失常发生。基因敲除CD8 T细胞来源的TNF或阻断TNFR2可预防心脏毒性，同时保留抗肿瘤疗效。这些发现确立了一个由TNF-TNFR2驱动的炎症级联反应作为ICI心肌炎的核心机制，并提出了将心脏毒性与免疫治疗益处解耦的策略。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::458437782a562f994cbafc81\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6ec05039403b1e9e43316a69\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0149\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"该研究基于小鼠模型，其机制在人体中的普适性尚需确认。此外，该研究聚焦于心脏毒性，未涉及肠道菌群，因此不能直接回答菌群如何调节ICI疗效的问题，只能作为ICI全身免疫效应的一个侧面案例。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了ICI诱导心脏毒性的具体分子机制细节：CD8 T细胞来源的TNF通过TNFR2信号促进髓系细胞招募和炎症，导致心律失常。这一机制独立于穿孔素介导的直接杀伤。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::458437782a562f994cbafc81\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2524b8280e063efe94c2a411\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0149\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"ICI可导致暴发性心肌炎，其机制涉及CD8 T细胞活化和TNF信号通路。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::458437782a562f994cbafc81\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a17f82f767433f2f8669c5e9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0149\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"心肌损伤可由TNF介导的炎症驱动，而非仅由细胞毒性T细胞的直接杀伤引起。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::458437782a562f994cbafc81\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0649fd2cf2b24636e15937e2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0149\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究结果来自小鼠模型，不能直接外推至人类患者的临床疗效或安全性预测。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::458437782a562f994cbafc81\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e288f8e5544a91be2eaaa961\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0149\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"研究聚焦于心脏毒性机制，未涉及肠道菌群，因此不能直接用于回答菌群如何调节ICI疗效的问题，仅能提供机制层面的旁证或背景。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::458437782a562f994cbafc81\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a9b0af20662549bd10035d57\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0149\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"作者声称TNF阻断可保留抗肿瘤疗效，但这仅在特定小鼠模型中观察到，实际临床应用中需警惕TNF阻断对肿瘤微环境的潜在负面影响。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::458437782a562f994cbafc81\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0683d8680fc0be8cf6953633\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0149\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"identity\",\n              \"reason\": \"source identity was not independently verified\",\n              \"status\": \"input_attributed\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"no complete research body was indexed\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"html\",\n              \"reason\": \"html_not_scholarly_body\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"only abstract or non-title snippets were available\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"abstract_only\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::458437782a562f994cbafc81\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::908b08fe177a0263d4b6c01a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0597\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::403b70186842af42ce31ed58\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0795fe4760e84d1c7f439b36\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0597\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::403b70186842af42ce31ed58\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::793bf60ef299d402e03684dc\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0597\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"作为一篇综述，本研究未进行新的实验数据采集。其综合路线为：1. 文献回顾：汇总关于HLA与心肌炎/DCM关联的候选基因研究、GWAS信号、动物模型及转基因模型证据；2. 机制整合：将观察到的遗传关联与免疫学机制（如抗原呈递、T细胞激活、分子模拟、微生物组交叉反应）相结合，构建病理生理框架；3. 批判性评估：分析现有研究在效应大小、人群多样性和临床转化方面的不足；4. 提出建议：基于上述分析，提出未来研究优先事项（如多民族队列、免疫基因组整合）。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::403b70186842af42ce31ed58\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7a9996e802273453b370bbf6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0597\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"系统整合了HLA在心肌炎/DCM中的遗传关联与免疫机制，特别是强调了HLA-II类分子在打破免疫耐受和驱动自身免疫中的核心作用，以及微生物组作为潜在分子模拟源的新兴证据。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给摘要未交代具体的文献检索策略、纳入排除标准及质量评价方法；主要依赖已发表的研究结果进行叙述性综合，缺乏定量荟萃分析数据；对具体HLA等位基因与特定病毒表位的精确对应关系尚不明确。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::403b70186842af42ce31ed58\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f6a19cf0cb52e0209022dc5c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0597\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"特定HLA等位基因存在时\",\n          \"finding\": \"HLA-DR4、HLA-B27等风险等位基因与特发性DCM及心肌炎易感性增加相关；HLA-DR3可能具有保护作用。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::403b70186842af42ce31ed58\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::88079a6f8d092733e33eba9a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0597\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"病毒感染背景下\",\n          \"finding\": \"HLA多态性影响病毒清除效率；低效呈递可能导致病毒持续存在，而高效呈递可能引发旁观者损伤或分子模拟，触发针对心脏自身抗原（如肌球蛋白）的自身免疫反应。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::403b70186842af42ce31ed58\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e7d5b8c5926100b2134ee999\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0597\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"转基因小鼠模型中\",\n          \"finding\": \"表达人类HLA-DQ8的转基因小鼠在无感染情况下自发产生自身免疫性心肌炎，证明特定HLA等位基因可直接降低自身免疫阈值。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::403b70186842af42ce31ed58\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c5ad4c7bc248aa8aec498433\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0597\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"微生物组交互中\",\n          \"finding\": \"肠道共生菌（如拟杆菌属）产生的肽段可能与心脏肌球蛋白表位发生分子模拟，激活自体反应性CD4+ T细胞，且抗生素干预可预防该过程。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::403b70186842af42ce31ed58\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1a8dd8b1d40ce69592898531\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0597\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::403b70186842af42ce31ed58\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::79eed18f2d0fc11322a56381\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0597\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"明确HLA多态性如何决定心肌炎患者是清除病毒自愈，还是发展为持续性自身免疫损伤进而导致DCM；识别当前研究中的知识空白以指导临床转化。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::403b70186842af42ce31ed58\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c8074a4e4ec33b1d79d1156f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0597\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"心肌炎（Myocarditis）和扩张型心肌病（DCM）；人类白细胞抗原（HLA）系统多态性；适应性免疫、分子模拟、自身免疫机制。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::403b70186842af42ce31ed58\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b2cb4b4df74b55977a1a9e10\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0597\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本文是一篇综述，旨在阐明HLA多态性在心肌炎进展、抵抗及结局中的作用。文章梳理了HLA通过抗原呈递影响适应性免疫的机制，包括HLA-I类分子介导的抗病毒反应和HLA-II类分子驱动的自身免疫过程。重点讨论了分子模拟、病毒持续感染、微生物组相互作用等机制如何导致从急性炎症向慢性自身免疫性DCM的转变。同时，文章评估了现有遗传关联研究的局限性（如样本量小、人群单一），并提出了未来研究方向，包括多民族基因组研究、病毒表位映射及基于HLA分层的临床试验。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::403b70186842af42ce31ed58\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bcee5c45aeaa1785a0003ea4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0597\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"研究对象为心脏组织而非肿瘤组织；机制侧重于感染后自身免疫，而非肿瘤抗原识别。不能直接外推至ICI疗效预测。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了HLA限制性抗原呈递导致特异性T细胞激活的详细机制，包括HLA-I/II类分子在病毒清除与自身免疫启动中的不同角色。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::403b70186842af42ce31ed58\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d0ac2ec8e3533214f7adbefd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0597\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"直接因果链条是“微生物-心脏自身免疫”，而非“微生物-ICI疗效”。需明确这是跨体系的借鉴，而非直接回答ICI相关问题。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"详细阐述了微生物组来源的肽段如何通过分子模拟激活自体反应性T细胞，并指出抗生素干预可阻断这一过程。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::403b70186842af42ce31ed58\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ca0869648ee1c7d4fe289d9c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0597\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"HLA多态性影响胸腺阴性选择，导致自体反应性T细胞克隆逃逸；这些克隆在遇到抗原后被激活，释放穿孔素/颗粒酶或激活巨噬细胞，导致组织损伤。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::403b70186842af42ce31ed58\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::59057ef96980db153895c987\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0597\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"病毒或微生物肽段与宿主自身蛋白结构相似，导致交叉反应性T细胞或抗体产生。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::403b70186842af42ce31ed58\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e633699bbf118589ce784c9e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0597\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本文是综述而非原始研究，其结论基于对已有文献的综合，需注意引用文献的质量和一致性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::403b70186842af42ce31ed58\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3c45e88fa8096d539ff7a1a4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0597\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"HLA与心肌炎的关联多为中等效应值，且存在显著的人群异质性，不能简单推广到所有人群或疾病类型。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::403b70186842af42ce31ed58\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9753a02459dec942e5cf4d38\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0597\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"微生物组与自身免疫的联系主要在动物模型和部分人类研究中证实，其在ICI疗效中的具体作用仍需独立验证，不可混淆两者。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::403b70186842af42ce31ed58\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2f8d8673d83054261202a687\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0597\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"supplement_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"auxiliary_material\": \"文中总结了 HLA 类 I 和类 II 分子在心肌炎中的不同功能（类 I 呈递病毒肽给 CD8+ T 细胞，类 II 呈递外源肽给 CD4+ T 细胞），并列出了与心肌炎或扩张型心肌病（DCM）相关的具体 HLA 等位基因（如 HLA-DR4, HLA-B27, HLA-DR15 等）。此外，文章提出了心肌炎的三相模型（触发、免疫反应、慢性炎症），并指出 HLA 多态性影响胸腺阴性选择和 T 细胞克隆扩增，这些背景信息有助于构建宿主遗传与环境互作的整体病理生理图景。\",\n          \"evidence\": [],\n          \"gap_id\": \"Ch6_gap_4\",\n          \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\body_full_staged_acceptance_20261004_40cny\\\\planning\\\\chapters\\\\external\\\\N64e929a3f9de2888bd6a-5a6b848383c152a3\\\\round_1\\\\supplements\\\\Ch6_gap_4\\\\attempt-adnnjw8w\\\\source_units\\\\SU03_search_candidate_caa7d3faf8\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n          \"limitations\": [],\n          \"material_ready\": true,\n          \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n          \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n          \"remaining_gap\": \"本材料未提及 Prevotella spp. 具体诱导心肌炎的分子机制，也未涉及 FMT-LUMINate 研究或其后续跟进研究。文中关于微生物组诱导心肌炎的实证例子主要集中在拟杆菌属（Bacteroides）而非 Prevotella 属。关于具体的下游信号通路、特定的 Prevotella 抗原或代谢物、以及其激活的特定 T 细胞亚群（除了一般性的 CD4+ T 细胞外）的细节，在本综述中均未解析。因此，针对 Gap 中询问的 Prevotella 特异性机制及 FMT-LUMINate 后续研究证据，本材料无法直接提供。\",\n          \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n          \"status\": \"unmet\",\n          \"useful_material\": \"本综述提供了微生物组诱导自身免疫性心肌炎的通用机制框架，特别是“分子模拟”（molecular mimicry）概念。作者引用了 Gil-Cruz 等人的研究，指出共生细菌（如拟杆菌属 Bacteroides）可产生与心脏肌球蛋白表位结构相似的肽段模拟物，在肠道内激活自体反应性 CD4+ T 细胞，进而导致心肌炎。该材料详细描述了 HLA 限制性抗原呈递（HLA 类分子向 CD4+ T 细胞呈递外源性肽段）在打破免疫耐受中的核心作用，以及微生物抗原如何通过交叉反应激活针对心脏自身抗原的免疫应答。这为理解肠道菌群（包括潜在的 Prevotella spp.）如何通过抗原模拟激活特定 T 细胞亚群提供了理论模型和机制参考。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::403b70186842af42ce31ed58\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a185e7e743b999f7bb64970e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0597\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"supplement_materials\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": [\n          {\n            \"auxiliary_material\": \"文中总结了 HLA 类 I 和类 II 分子在心肌炎中的不同功能（类 I 呈递病毒肽给 CD8+ T 细胞，类 II 呈递外源肽给 CD4+ T 细胞），并列出了与心肌炎或扩张型心肌病（DCM）相关的具体 HLA 等位基因（如 HLA-DR4, HLA-B27, HLA-DR15 等）。此外，文章提出了心肌炎的三相模型（触发、免疫反应、慢性炎症），并指出 HLA 多态性影响胸腺阴性选择和 T 细胞克隆扩增，这些背景信息有助于构建宿主遗传与环境互作的整体病理生理图景。\",\n            \"evidence\": [],\n            \"gap_id\": \"Ch6_gap_4\",\n            \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\body_full_staged_acceptance_20261004_40cny\\\\planning\\\\chapters\\\\external\\\\N64e929a3f9de2888bd6a-5a6b848383c152a3\\\\round_1\\\\supplements\\\\Ch6_gap_4\\\\attempt-adnnjw8w\\\\source_units\\\\SU03_search_candidate_caa7d3faf8\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n            \"limitations\": [],\n            \"material_ready\": true,\n            \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n            \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"remaining_gap\": \"本材料未提及 Prevotella spp. 具体诱导心肌炎的分子机制，也未涉及 FMT-LUMINate 研究或其后续跟进研究。文中关于微生物组诱导心肌炎的实证例子主要集中在拟杆菌属（Bacteroides）而非 Prevotella 属。关于具体的下游信号通路、特定的 Prevotella 抗原或代谢物、以及其激活的特定 T 细胞亚群（除了一般性的 CD4+ T 细胞外）的细节，在本综述中均未解析。因此，针对 Gap 中询问的 Prevotella 特异性机制及 FMT-LUMINate 后续研究证据，本材料无法直接提供。\",\n            \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"status\": \"unmet\",\n            \"useful_material\": \"本综述提供了微生物组诱导自身免疫性心肌炎的通用机制框架，特别是“分子模拟”（molecular mimicry）概念。作者引用了 Gil-Cruz 等人的研究，指出共生细菌（如拟杆菌属 Bacteroides）可产生与心脏肌球蛋白表位结构相似的肽段模拟物，在肠道内激活自体反应性 CD4+ T 细胞，进而导致心肌炎。该材料详细描述了 HLA 限制性抗原呈递（HLA 类分子向 CD4+ T 细胞呈递外源性肽段）在打破免疫耐受中的核心作用，以及微生物抗原如何通过交叉反应激活针对心脏自身抗原的免疫应答。这为理解肠道菌群（包括潜在的 Prevotella spp.）如何通过抗原模拟激活特定 T 细胞亚群提供了理论模型和机制参考。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"auxiliary_material\": \"文中提供了 HLA I 类和 II 类分子在心肌炎中的功能对比，包括抗原呈递对象（CD8+ vs CD4+ T 细胞）、表达细胞类型及在自身免疫中的具体角色。还涉及病毒持续感染与自身免疫的复杂关系，以及抗肌球蛋白自身抗体与β1-肾上腺素能受体的交叉反应机制。这些内容虽不直接针对 Prevotella，但构成了心肌炎免疫病理的基础背景。\",\n            \"evidence\": [],\n            \"gap_id\": \"Ch6_gap_4\",\n            \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\body_full_staged_acceptance_20261004_40cny\\\\planning\\\\chapters\\\\external\\\\N64e929a3f9de2888bd6a-5a6b848383c152a3\\\\round_2\\\\supplements\\\\Ch6_gap_4\\\\attempt-x8duln8o\\\\source_units\\\\SU01_search_candidate_caa7d3faf8\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n            \"limitations\": [],\n            \"material_ready\": true,\n            \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n            \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"remaining_gap\": \"该材料未提及 Prevotella spp. 的具体分子机制，也未涉及 FMT-LUMINate 研究或其后续分析。文中引用的微生物组相关证据主要集中在拟杆菌属（Bacteroides）与心脏肌球蛋白的分子模拟，而非 Prevotella 特有的抗原或代谢物。关于 Prevotella 激活特定 T 细胞亚群的具体下游信号通路（如特定受体、转录因子或代谢途径）在此文中完全缺失。\",\n            \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"status\": \"unmet\",\n            \"useful_material\": \"该综述阐述了微生物组通过分子模拟（molecular mimicry）诱导自身免疫性心肌炎的通用机制。文中指出，共生细菌（引用 Gil-Cruz 等人的研究，具体为拟杆菌属 Bacteroides species）可产生与心脏肌球蛋白表位结构相似的肽段模拟物，在肠道内启动自体反应性 CD4+ T 细胞，进而导致心肌炎。该研究还提到抗生素治疗可阻断这一过程，证实了微生物组衍生抗原模拟在疾病启动中的因果作用。此外，文中详细描述了 HLA 限制性抗原呈递如何决定特定 T 细胞亚群（CD4+ 或 CD8+）的激活，以及下游的细胞因子放大和免疫细胞浸润机制，为理解微生物 - 宿主互作提供了理论框架。\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::403b70186842af42ce31ed58\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ec91086ed0f491f8a58227e2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0597\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::403b70186842af42ce31ed58\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e827e82a1cdb2bfcba5171a4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0602\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::98a960a0340563f06718a990\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0f6a18a27a1f9bdafa653bdf\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0602\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::98a960a0340563f06718a990\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::aa09a6b97ddb3f9105b9ae11\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0602\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用动物实验设计：1. 建立B16-F10黑色素瘤小鼠模型；2. 分组处理：对照组（IgG）、PD-1抑制剂组（Anti）、肠道菌群清除组（FMR，使用广谱抗生素鸡尾酒）；3. 评估指标：心脏病理（H&E, IHC）、血清心肌损伤标志物（CK-MB, cTn-I）、心脏免疫细胞亚群（流式细胞术检测CD4+, CD8+, Tregs, Th17等）、心脏Treg相关基因表达（qPCR检测CD25, FOXP3, IL-10, TGF-β）、血清细胞因子（ELISA检测IL-10, IL-17）；4. 肠道菌群分析：粪便16S rRNA测序，进行Alpha/Beta多样性分析及LEfSe差异物种鉴定；5. 相关性分析：Spearman分析肠道菌群与心肌炎表型参数的相关性；6. 干预验证：通过FMR观察对心肌炎及免疫平衡的逆转效果。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::98a960a0340563f06718a990\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f73657d4b17d08cc978702bd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0602\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了PD-1抑制剂诱导心肌炎的一个潜在机制模型，即肠道菌群失调可能通过抑制心脏局部Treg的功能和数量来加剧心肌炎症。\",\n          \"limits\": \"研究仅在小鼠黑色素瘤模型中进行，结论外推到人类患者需谨慎；样本量较小（每组n=6）；缺乏针对特定细菌菌株的因果验证实验（如粪菌移植或单菌定植）；FMR组缺少单独的抗生素对照以排除抗生素本身对心肌的影响；16S测序无法精确到种水平，限制了具体致病菌的识别。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::98a960a0340563f06718a990\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7f6fd31e62f985b5d53fe923\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0602\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"黑色素瘤小鼠接受PD-1抑制剂治疗\",\n          \"finding\": \"PD-1抑制剂诱导了显著的心脏炎症（CD4+, CD8+ T细胞和巨噬细胞浸润增加），血清心肌损伤标志物升高；心脏内Treg比例下降，Th17/Treg比值升高；心脏组织中Treg相关基因（CD25, FOXP3, IL-10, TGF-β）转录水平下调；肠道菌群组成发生显著改变（Beta多样性差异），特定菌属（如Rikenellaceae, Ruminococcaceae, Flexispira等）丰度增加，且这些菌属与心肌损伤指标呈正相关，与保护性因子呈负相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::98a960a0340563f06718a990\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::49f942189d93f91542d51d20\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0602\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"在PD-1抑制剂治疗基础上进行肠道菌群清除（FMR）\",\n          \"finding\": \"FMR显著减轻了心肌损伤面积和炎症细胞浸润，降低了血清心肌损伤标志物；恢复了心脏内Treg的比例和Th17/Treg比值的平衡；上调了Treg相关基因的表达和血清IL-10水平；清除了与心肌炎表型相关的特定肠道菌群，表明肠道菌群的缺失缓解了PD-1抑制剂引起的心脏毒性，且不影响抗肿瘤疗效。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::98a960a0340563f06718a990\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0f415aa6f7a78f4146535ff9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0602\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::98a960a0340563f06718a990\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e748e3dac3ab2dbfcc0539a8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0602\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"PD-1抑制剂诱导的心肌炎的具体发病机制尚不清楚，尤其是肠道菌群是否参与以及其如何通过影响免疫细胞（如Treg）来介导心脏毒性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::98a960a0340563f06718a990\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c2eb51bc6982e0585c40454a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0602\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究以携带B16-F10黑色素瘤的小鼠为模型，研究PD-1抑制剂（Anti-PD1）诱导的心肌炎（irAEs的一种）。研究对象包括小鼠心脏组织、血清及粪便样本。情境涉及肿瘤免疫治疗背景下的免疫相关不良事件机制探索。范围限定在小鼠体内实验，未涉及人类临床数据直接验证。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::98a960a0340563f06718a990\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::80adee1c8926e7478ffad7f5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0602\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究旨在阐明PD-1抑制剂导致心肌炎的潜在机制，特别是肠道菌群与调节性T细胞（Treg）之间的关联。研究人员构建了黑色素瘤小鼠模型，给予PD-1抑制剂诱导心肌炎，并通过16S rRNA测序分析肠道菌群变化，流式细胞术和qPCR检测心脏免疫细胞及基因表达。研究发现PD-1抑制剂导致心脏内Treg数量减少和功能基因下调，同时改变肠道菌群组成。通过抗生素清除肠道菌群（FMR），发现可显著减轻心肌损伤并恢复Treg功能，提示肠道菌群在PD-1抑制剂诱导的心肌炎中起关键作用。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::98a960a0340563f06718a990\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7f4672cf172ce3226a15c08c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0602\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅限于小鼠模型中的观察和推断，尚未在人体中验证该特定通路；机制细节基于基因表达和相关性，非直接的因果链条证明（如未展示特定代谢物的作用）。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"详细描述了PD-1抑制剂通过改变肠道菌群组成，进而抑制心脏局部Treg数量和功能（下调FOXP3, IL-10, TGF-β等基因），打破Th17/Treg平衡，导致心肌炎症的具体分子和细胞机制。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::98a960a0340563f06718a990\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6552a2eebd1a3ff34c6222d4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0602\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"FMR使用的是广谱抗生素，非特异性清除，不能代表所有菌群变化的影响；未测试补充特定有益菌是否能增强疗效或进一步降低毒性。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"通过FMR实验证明，清除肠道菌群可以减轻PD-1抑制剂诱导的心肌炎，同时保持抗肿瘤效果，暗示肠道菌群是ICI疗效与毒性平衡中的一个可调节因素。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::98a960a0340563f06718a990\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d737339e5962d85a101793a2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0602\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"PD-1抑制剂在黑色素瘤小鼠中诱导心肌炎的组织病理学特征（纤维坏死、炎症细胞浸润）及血清标志物变化\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::98a960a0340563f06718a990\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b216d453cf24f6db586431eb\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0602\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"文中引用的关于肠道菌群失调与心血管及自身免疫疾病关联的既往研究\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::98a960a0340563f06718a990\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7e5ce8ffebf8757f56be95c5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0602\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"富集的菌属（如Ruminococcaceae, Flexispira）与其他炎症性疾病（IBD, 败血症等）的已知关联\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::98a960a0340563f06718a990\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::dc03f795b3de5d893b7ecb68\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0602\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究结果来自小鼠模型，不能直接等同于人类患者的生理反应。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::98a960a0340563f06718a990\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a4e13a48122f43a1ba23366d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0602\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"肠道菌群的变化与心肌炎表型的相关性不等于因果关系，尽管FMR实验提供了支持性证据，但缺乏对单一菌群或代谢物的直接因果验证。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::98a960a0340563f06718a990\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4ee8773f2c8d84caa1a2c4db\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0602\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"FMR实验中使用的抗生素鸡尾酒可能对宿主有其他非特异性影响，需考虑抗生素本身对心脏或免疫系统的可能作用。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::98a960a0340563f06718a990\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::30f869241f6095bbdf4f1149\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0602\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"16S rRNA测序分辨率有限，无法确定具体的致病菌株，因此不能将结论精确到特定菌种。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::98a960a0340563f06718a990\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e6119f67c0f49c7eec20e55f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0602\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"supplement_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"auxiliary_material\": \"The introduction and discussion cite general background on the association between gut dysbiosis and cardiovascular or autoimmune diseases, and the role of Tregs in maintaining immune homeostasis. The methods detail the 16S rRNA sequencing protocol and the antibiotic cocktail used for microbiota depletion, which may inform future experimental designs. The study also notes limitations such as the small number of experimental animals and the resolution limits of 16S sequencing.\",\n          \"evidence\": [],\n          \"gap_id\": \"Ch6_gap_5\",\n          \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\body_full_staged_acceptance_20261004_40cny\\\\planning\\\\chapters\\\\external\\\\N4452dfb25f491e9335fe-5a6b848383c152a3\\\\round_2\\\\supplements\\\\Ch6_gap_5\\\\attempt-u2gi65cq\\\\source_units\\\\SU02_search_candidate_65a7baa93c\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n          \"limitations\": [],\n          \"material_ready\": true,\n          \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n          \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n          \"remaining_gap\": \"The gap question specifically requests 'large-scale microbiome association studies' (implying human clinical cohorts) to verify issues of small sample size or insufficient evidence in non-colitis irAEs. This supplied material is a small-scale preclinical animal study (n=6 per group), not a large-scale human association study. Therefore, it does not provide the human epidemiological evidence required to resolve the gap regarding clinical sample sizes. The study itself acknowledges its limited sample size as a constraint, which ironically aligns with the concern raised in the gap question rather than resolving it.\",\n          \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n          \"status\": \"unmet\",\n          \"useful_material\": \"This study provides preclinical mechanistic evidence linking gut microbiota to PD-1 inhibitor-associated myocarditis, a non-colitis irAE. The authors established a melanoma mouse model (n=6 per group) showing that PD-1 inhibition induced myocarditis, reduced cardiac regulatory T cells (Tregs), and altered gut microbiota composition. Specific taxa (e.g., Ruminococcaceae, Flexispira) were correlated with cardiac injury markers (CK-MB, cTn-I) and Treg-related gene expression (FOXP3, IL-10). Fecal microbiota removal (antibiotic treatment) attenuated myocarditis and restored Treg levels without compromising antitumor efficacy in this model. These findings support the biological plausibility of a microbiome-immune axis in non-colitis irAEs.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::98a960a0340563f06718a990\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::36adbf1abd02f94fd7fd075a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0602\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"supplement_materials\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": [\n          {\n            \"auxiliary_material\": \"The introduction and discussion cite general background on the association between gut dysbiosis and cardiovascular or autoimmune diseases, and the role of Tregs in maintaining immune homeostasis. The methods detail the 16S rRNA sequencing protocol and the antibiotic cocktail used for microbiota depletion, which may inform future experimental designs. The study also notes limitations such as the small number of experimental animals and the resolution limits of 16S sequencing.\",\n            \"evidence\": [],\n            \"gap_id\": \"Ch6_gap_5\",\n            \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\body_full_staged_acceptance_20261004_40cny\\\\planning\\\\chapters\\\\external\\\\N4452dfb25f491e9335fe-5a6b848383c152a3\\\\round_2\\\\supplements\\\\Ch6_gap_5\\\\attempt-u2gi65cq\\\\source_units\\\\SU02_search_candidate_65a7baa93c\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n            \"limitations\": [],\n            \"material_ready\": true,\n            \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n            \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"remaining_gap\": \"The gap question specifically requests 'large-scale microbiome association studies' (implying human clinical cohorts) to verify issues of small sample size or insufficient evidence in non-colitis irAEs. This supplied material is a small-scale preclinical animal study (n=6 per group), not a large-scale human association study. Therefore, it does not provide the human epidemiological evidence required to resolve the gap regarding clinical sample sizes. The study itself acknowledges its limited sample size as a constraint, which ironically aligns with the concern raised in the gap question rather than resolving it.\",\n            \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"status\": \"unmet\",\n            \"useful_material\": \"This study provides preclinical mechanistic evidence linking gut microbiota to PD-1 inhibitor-associated myocarditis, a non-colitis irAE. The authors established a melanoma mouse model (n=6 per group) showing that PD-1 inhibition induced myocarditis, reduced cardiac regulatory T cells (Tregs), and altered gut microbiota composition. Specific taxa (e.g., Ruminococcaceae, Flexispira) were correlated with cardiac injury markers (CK-MB, cTn-I) and Treg-related gene expression (FOXP3, IL-10). Fecal microbiota removal (antibiotic treatment) attenuated myocarditis and restored Treg levels without compromising antitumor efficacy in this model. These findings support the biological plausibility of a microbiome-immune axis in non-colitis irAEs.\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"auxiliary_material\": \"作者明确指出该研究受限于实验动物数量有限（n=6），结论需更大样本量研究进一步确认；且 16S rRNA 测序无法精确到菌种水平，缺乏单一菌群或代谢物的直接因果验证。此外，文中引用了肠道菌群失调与心血管及自身免疫疾病关联的既往背景，为综述提供理论依据。\",\n            \"evidence\": [],\n            \"gap_id\": \"Ch6_gap_5\",\n            \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\body_full_staged_acceptance_20261004_40cny\\\\planning\\\\chapters\\\\external\\\\N4452dfb25f491e9335fe-5a6b848383c152a3\\\\round_3\\\\supplements\\\\Ch6_gap_5\\\\attempt-hpbnytrx\\\\source_units\\\\SU03_search_candidate_65a7baa93c\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n            \"limitations\": [],\n            \"material_ready\": true,\n            \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n            \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"remaining_gap\": \"该材料为动物实验且样本量小，无法提供针对人类非结肠炎 irAEs（如心肌炎、神经毒性）的大规模微生物组关联数据。 gap 中要求的‘大规模’临床证据以验证先前研究样本量不足的问题仍未得到解决，人类队列中的菌群特征与毒性关联尚缺乏统计效力足够的验证。\",\n            \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"status\": \"unmet\",\n            \"useful_material\": \"该研究在黑色素瘤小鼠模型中（每组 n=6）证实了 PD-1 抑制剂治疗会改变肠道菌群组成（如 Ruminococcaceae、Flexispira 等富集），并与心肌炎严重程度及心脏调节性 T 细胞（Treg）减少显著相关。研究通过粪便微生物清除实验（FMR）表明，抗生素干预可减轻 PD-1 抑制剂诱导的心肌炎，同时保持抗肿瘤效果，提示肠道菌群通过调节 Treg 功能参与非结肠炎 irAE（心肌炎）的发病机制。\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::98a960a0340563f06718a990\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8071a8e64681d16f4652d3f1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0602\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::98a960a0340563f06718a990\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0a23af0b63e18942fe134843\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0604\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::eaa5eb691eb7f9a7f497a261\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6e31587ee2f750a06f61ed94\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0604\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::eaa5eb691eb7f9a7f497a261\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d38dbbee702680001d276888\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0604\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用叙述性综述方法。综合现有的动物实验研究（主要是小鼠自身免疫性心肌炎模型）、体外细胞共培养实验数据以及部分人类临床研究结果。重点梳理TN-C的表达时空特征、其与树突状细胞的相互作用机制（特别是TLR4信号通路）、对T细胞极化（Th17）的影响，并结合其他免疫机制（如分子模拟、表位扩散、肠道菌群交叉反应）进行系统性解释。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::eaa5eb691eb7f9a7f497a261\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d877320ec8ce00aae1d70114\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0604\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"系统总结了TN-C作为局部炎症调节剂在心肌炎病理中的机制，提出了TN-C-TLR4-DCs-Th17轴的具体分子路径。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给摘要未交代具体的文献检索策略和筛选标准。主要证据来源于小鼠模型和部分体外实验，直接外推至人类的因果链条尚需更多临床干预研究验证。作者承认目前缺乏针对TN-C功能的抑制治疗尝试，且动物模型与人类疾病的差异仍是知识空白。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::eaa5eb691eb7f9a7f497a261\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ae47e582b3cd8ea73585d560\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0604\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"小鼠自身免疫性心肌炎模型及体外实验\",\n          \"finding\": \"TN-C在炎症细胞浸润和组织坏死前即可检测到，并在活动性炎症期强表达，愈合后消失。TN-C缺陷小鼠表现出较轻的心肌炎症状，且心脏中Th17细胞浸润减少。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::eaa5eb691eb7f9a7f497a261\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::63c6dec03dbbc08d397b1a9d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0604\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"体外树突状细胞（DCs）与T细胞共培养\",\n          \"finding\": \"TN-C通过激活DCs上的TLR4受体，诱导DCs分泌高水平的IL-6、IL-1β和GM-CSF。这些细胞因子共同作用，促使初始CD4+ T细胞分化为Th17细胞。阻断IL-6或TLR4信号可抑制这一过程。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::eaa5eb691eb7f9a7f497a261\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::920d3654c76386723acc3f47\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0604\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"人类心肌炎/炎症性心肌病患者\",\n          \"finding\": \"患者血清中TN-C水平升高，可作为评估疾病活动和预测预后的生物标志物，尤其在结合BNP时具有更高的预测价值。患者体内Th17相关细胞因子水平升高。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::eaa5eb691eb7f9a7f497a261\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::dc7f3663d96cf3cda7ff8355\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0604\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::eaa5eb691eb7f9a7f497a261\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::032de05398f456f491750002\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0604\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"阐明TN-C在心肌炎发病机制中的具体免疫调节功能，特别是其如何桥接先天免疫与适应性免疫反应，以及其在疾病诊断和治疗中的潜在价值。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::eaa5eb691eb7f9a7f497a261\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::37830cd3b19e48b57170b0aa\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0604\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"心肌炎（Myocarditis）和炎症性心肌病（Inflammatory Cardiomyopathy）的病理机制，重点聚焦于细胞外基质糖蛋白Tenascin-C (TN-C) 在其中的免疫调节作用。涉及小鼠自身免疫性心肌炎模型、人类临床观察及相关的免疫学机制（如树突状细胞、T细胞亚群）。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::eaa5eb691eb7f9a7f497a261\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1d784781d7f6e781f9dffeb2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0604\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本文是一篇综述文章，旨在探讨Tenascin-C (TN-C) 在心肌炎向炎症性心肌病进展中的免疫调节角色。文章首先回顾了心肌炎的触发因素（包括病毒、免疫检查点抑制剂等）及其向自身免疫反应的转化过程，特别强调了心脏自身抗原（如MyHC-α）和肠道微生物（如Bacteroides thetaiotaomicron）在打破免疫耐受中的作用。核心部分详细阐述了TN-C作为一种损伤相关分子模式（DAMP），在组织损伤后由成纤维细胞等产生，通过激活树突状细胞（DCs）上的TLR4受体，促进IL-6、IL-1β和GM-CSF等细胞因子的释放，进而诱导初始CD4+ T细胞向致病性的Th17细胞分化。这一过程连接了先天免疫与适应性免疫，导致心肌组织的自身免疫性损伤。文章最后指出TN-C可能作为生物标志物和治疗靶点的潜力，并承认目前关于动物模型与人类疾病差异的知识缺口。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::eaa5eb691eb7f9a7f497a261\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1bfe1c4bd8e93fec9a0d4cb9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0604\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅解释了ICIs引发心肌炎的免疫学基础（耐受丧失），未涉及实体瘤疗效。机制细节（如TN-C的作用）主要在心肌炎语境下，需谨慎类比到其他器官毒性。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了免疫检查点抑制剂可能导致心肌炎的一个潜在机制视角：即通过破坏免疫耐受，使得原本被控制的自身反应性T细胞（如抗MyHC-α T细胞）在组织损伤背景下被激活。文中提到免疫检查点分子（CTLA-4, PD-1/PD-L1）维持外周耐受，其缺失可导致心肌炎。这有助于解释ICIs为何会引发自身免疫样反应。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::eaa5eb691eb7f9a7f497a261\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d4b259f5e0f3e39b336b885a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0604\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这是心肌炎/炎症性心肌病的特定案例，而非实体瘤中微生物调节ICI疗效的直接证据。不同癌症类型和微生物群落差异巨大。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了肠道微生物（Bacteroides thetaiotaomicron）通过分子模拟（cross-immune response）触发心脏自身免疫反应的实例。展示了微生物抗原与宿主自身抗原（MyHC-α）的同源性如何导致T细胞交叉激活。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::eaa5eb691eb7f9a7f497a261\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7c1d5e83fd3cbb355512c0ee\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0604\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"文章详细描述了中枢耐受（胸腺阴性选择）和外周耐受（免疫检查点、Treg）的机制，以及MyHC-α因未在胸腺表达而逃逸选择的特殊性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::eaa5eb691eb7f9a7f497a261\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::157ad94e69545aa732568980\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0604\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"TN-C作为ECM成分，在组织损伤时释放并作为DAMP激活TLR4，进而驱动炎症。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::eaa5eb691eb7f9a7f497a261\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d39737aa74b8180654d7d4f8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0604\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"TN-C联合BNP预测心肌事件的价值。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::eaa5eb691eb7f9a7f497a261\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::215fc0a53cd384c65647af36\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0604\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本文是综述而非原始研究，其提出的TN-C机制主要基于小鼠模型和体外实验，直接应用于人类实体瘤ICI疗效的解释存在物种和疾病模型的差异风险。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::eaa5eb691eb7f9a7f497a261\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5fb9ba24eb45813c20f60177\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0604\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"文中关于肠道菌群的描述仅限于心肌炎中的交叉反应，不能直接推断该菌株在其他癌症类型中对ICI疗效的影响方向（促进或抑制）。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::eaa5eb691eb7f9a7f497a261\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c5449a2141fe4b2771f18779\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0604\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"不要将TN-C在心肌炎中的促炎作用简单等同于其在所有炎症环境中的作用；在某些慢性炎症或纤维化背景下，ECM成分的作用可能复杂多变。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::eaa5eb691eb7f9a7f497a261\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b42249dc742e718bbcb4786e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0604\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"作者声称TN-C是“关键”调节剂，但这基于有限的实验发现，需谨慎对待其普遍性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::eaa5eb691eb7f9a7f497a261\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3bd6bb2bbbc66d70dcfe4490\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0604\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"supplement_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"auxiliary_material\": \"General triggers of myocarditis including viruses (CVB3, SARS-CoV-2) and immune checkpoint inhibitors; description of central and peripheral immune tolerance mechanisms; TN-C as a biomarker for disease activity and prognosis.\",\n          \"evidence\": [],\n          \"gap_id\": \"Ch6_gap_4\",\n          \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\body_full_staged_acceptance_20261004_40cny\\\\planning\\\\chapters\\\\external\\\\N64e929a3f9de2888bd6a-5a6b848383c152a3\\\\round_3\\\\supplements\\\\Ch6_gap_4\\\\attempt-nf1aflvz\\\\source_units\\\\SU01_search_candidate_ec192008c0\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n          \"limitations\": [],\n          \"material_ready\": true,\n          \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n          \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n          \"remaining_gap\": \"The supplied text does not mention *Prevotella spp.*, the FMT-LUMINate study, or any specific antigens, metabolites, or downstream signaling pathways associated with *Prevotella*-induced myocarditis. The specific molecular mechanism requested in the gap question remains unidentified in this material.\",\n          \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n          \"status\": \"unmet\",\n          \"useful_material\": \"This study provides a mechanistic framework for how gut microbiota can trigger autoimmune myocarditis, specifically citing *Bacteroides thetaiotaomicron* where bacterial beta-galactosidase shares sequence homology with cardiac MyHC-α, inducing Th17 polarization. It also details a downstream signaling pathway in myocarditis involving Tenascin-C (TN-C) activating dendritic cells via TLR4 to produce IL-6, IL-1β, and GM-CSF, driving Th17 differentiation.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::eaa5eb691eb7f9a7f497a261\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b6178b0b87bd19c32a857037\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0604\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"supplement_materials\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": [\n          {\n            \"auxiliary_material\": \"General triggers of myocarditis including viruses (CVB3, SARS-CoV-2) and immune checkpoint inhibitors; description of central and peripheral immune tolerance mechanisms; TN-C as a biomarker for disease activity and prognosis.\",\n            \"evidence\": [],\n            \"gap_id\": \"Ch6_gap_4\",\n            \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\body_full_staged_acceptance_20261004_40cny\\\\planning\\\\chapters\\\\external\\\\N64e929a3f9de2888bd6a-5a6b848383c152a3\\\\round_3\\\\supplements\\\\Ch6_gap_4\\\\attempt-nf1aflvz\\\\source_units\\\\SU01_search_candidate_ec192008c0\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n            \"limitations\": [],\n            \"material_ready\": true,\n            \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n            \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"remaining_gap\": \"The supplied text does not mention *Prevotella spp.*, the FMT-LUMINate study, or any specific antigens, metabolites, or downstream signaling pathways associated with *Prevotella*-induced myocarditis. The specific molecular mechanism requested in the gap question remains unidentified in this material.\",\n            \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"status\": \"unmet\",\n            \"useful_material\": \"This study provides a mechanistic framework for how gut microbiota can trigger autoimmune myocarditis, specifically citing *Bacteroides thetaiotaomicron* where bacterial beta-galactosidase shares sequence homology with cardiac MyHC-α, inducing Th17 polarization. It also details a downstream signaling pathway in myocarditis involving Tenascin-C (TN-C) activating dendritic cells via TLR4 to produce IL-6, IL-1β, and GM-CSF, driving Th17 differentiation.\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::eaa5eb691eb7f9a7f497a261\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fae35bfda7669113b58cc0aa\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0604\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::eaa5eb691eb7f9a7f497a261\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::56674bed076a10a859598a71\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0598\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ce5771d0255e802db4f70946\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::512b360cce2032140ebe1f09\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0598\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ce5771d0255e802db4f70946\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9a22606753b19d93fc2deb50\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0598\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"As a narrative review, the authors conducted a literature search and synthesis of both preclinical (animal models) and clinical studies. They organized the discussion around three main themes: the general influence of gut microbiota on ICI efficacy, the relationship between microbiota and irAEs (specifically myocarditis), proposed molecular mechanisms (molecular mimicry, Treg suppression, cytokine networks), and therapeutic applications (antibiotics, other drugs like PPIs/statins). The approach relies on interpreting correlations and mechanistic hypotheses from cited works rather than conducting new primary experiments.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ce5771d0255e802db4f70946\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f25613981fd49fcc49b87542\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0598\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"Provides a structured synthesis of the 'gut-heart axis' in the context of cardio-oncology, linking specific microbial taxa (Flexispira, Ruminococcaceae, Bacteroides) to ICI-associated myocarditis pathology based on available preclinical and clinical data.\",\n          \"limits\": \"The review is narrative and does not present a systematic meta-analysis. Most mechanistic insights are inferred from animal models or other irAEs; direct clinical evidence for microbiota causality in myocarditis is limited. The therapeutic potential of microbiota modulation remains hypothetical and unvalidated in human trials.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ce5771d0255e802db4f70946\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4a2784cea5bf2f3e32cb2747\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0598\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"Highlights the critical trade-off between using antibiotics to prevent myocarditis and their potential to compromise ICI anti-tumor efficacy, identifying this as a key research gap.\",\n          \"limits\": \"Does not provide quantitative data on the magnitude of this trade-off across different cancer types or ICI regimens. The heterogeneity of cardiac adverse events across cancer types is noted but not analyzed.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ce5771d0255e802db4f70946\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::100b6b061df5e1bb7d2daeba\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0598\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Preclinical mouse models treated with PD-1 inhibitors\",\n          \"finding\": \"Depletion of specific gut bacteria (e.g., Flexispira, Ruminococcaceae) using antibiotics reduced inflammatory cell infiltration and myocardial injury area. Conversely, these bacteria showed positive correlations with cardiac injury markers and negative correlations with cardioprotective factors.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ce5771d0255e802db4f70946\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ac618138ef56a8024c332180\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0598\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Clinical observations of patients with irAEs\",\n          \"finding\": \"Patients developing severe irAEs, including myocarditis, exhibited higher abundance of pathobionts and decreased relative abundance of Ruminococcaceae. Bacteroides levels dynamically changed during irAE onset and remission.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ce5771d0255e802db4f70946\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::805f8088e2013333681d00a0\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0598\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Mechanistic hypotheses derived from preclinical and autoimmune data\",\n          \"finding\": \"Proposed mechanisms include molecular mimicry where microbial epitopes cross-react with heart tissue, and dysbiosis leading to suppressed Treg function and amplified pro-inflammatory cytokine responses (e.g., CXCL9/10, TNF-α).\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ce5771d0255e802db4f70946\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8c75664927d82127ac795f10\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0598\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ce5771d0255e802db4f70946\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::66bd0c3c3ac030702af2beb7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0598\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"To synthesize existing evidence on the link between gut microbiota and ICI-associated myocarditis, identify underlying molecular mechanisms, and evaluate the potential of modulating gut microbiota (e.g., via antibiotics, transplantation) as a therapeutic strategy, while addressing the balance between reducing irAEs and maintaining anti-tumor efficacy.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ce5771d0255e802db4f70946\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::340fd518cb652e91b8639951\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0598\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The review focuses on the association between gut microbiota and immune checkpoint inhibitor (ICI)-associated myocarditis, a severe immune-related adverse event (irAE). It synthesizes evidence from preclinical studies (primarily mouse models) and clinical observations to explore molecular mechanisms and potential therapeutic interventions involving microbiota modulation.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ce5771d0255e802db4f70946\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fa66804474ed79ee61b6a12b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0598\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"This narrative review aims to elucidate the role of gut microbiota in the pathogenesis of ICI-associated myocarditis. The authors hypothesize that gut microbiota influences this condition through mechanisms such as molecular mimicry, regulation of regulatory T cells (Tregs), and systemic inflammation. The paper discusses how specific microbial alterations correlate with cardiac injury markers and reviews preclinical evidence suggesting that antibiotic depletion or modulation of gut flora can mitigate myocardial damage. However, it highlights the controversy surrounding antibiotic use due to potential negative impacts on ICI efficacy and notes that clinical validation for microbiota-targeted therapies is still pending.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ce5771d0255e802db4f70946\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1bc5efdd3aa6539736d4af68\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0598\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"The review establishes myocarditis as a high-mortality (25%-50%) complication of ICIs and introduces the concept of the gut-heart axis in cardiovascular disease, extending it to cardio-oncology.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ce5771d0255e802db4f70946\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::281dd7fbe74ba7a82a0507d2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0598\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Associations between pathobiont abundance, decreased Ruminococcaceae, and dynamic changes in Bacteroides with irAE onset/remission.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ce5771d0255e802db4f70946\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3487ea8969aa0e0e421429c2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0598\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Long-term PPI use reduces diversity and may increase irAE risk; statins may mitigate inflammation.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ce5771d0255e802db4f70946\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::63181ed1d5e412e782ade90c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0598\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"These mechanisms are largely inferred from preclinical studies or other irAEs (colitis, dermatitis) and are explicitly stated as requiring further validation in myocarditis. The causal chain is not yet established in humans.\",\n          \"contribution\": \"Provides detailed mechanistic hypotheses for how gut microbiota might mediate immune-related adverse events, specifically focusing on molecular mimicry (cross-reactivity between microbial epitopes and cardiac tissues) and the suppression of Tregs by dysbiosis. It also outlines cytokine pathways (CXCL9/10, TNF-α) recruited by microbiota-derived signals.\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ce5771d0255e802db4f70946\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::741a102037a570cf1822c524\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0598\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"The review does not provide specific data on how microbiota modulation affects tumor response rates in solid tumors; its focus is on the adverse event aspect. The claim about antibiotic compromising efficacy is supported by retrospective studies cited, but the review itself does not generate new efficacy data.\",\n          \"contribution\": \"Discusses the dual role of gut microbiota in influencing ICI outcomes: enhancing anti-tumor immunity (via CD8+ T cell expansion) while simultaneously increasing the risk of irAEs. It notes that antibiotic use to mitigate irAEs may compromise ICI efficacy.\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ce5771d0255e802db4f70946\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2c5610619573e7cca590564c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0598\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The paper is a narrative review, not a systematic review or empirical study; findings represent synthesized interpretations rather than primary data.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ce5771d0255e802db4f70946\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9bdf5a11c188dff9149e485d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0598\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Mechanisms described (e.g., molecular mimicry, Treg suppression) are largely derived from preclinical models or extrapolated from other irAEs; direct causal evidence in human ICI-myocarditis is lacking.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ce5771d0255e802db4f70946\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7def4ce6d01d28e521abb86d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0598\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Therapeutic suggestions (antibiotics, transplantation) are presented as future possibilities based on preclinical success; clinical application is explicitly stated as distant and controversial.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ce5771d0255e802db4f70946\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d67218b9052c0db3fb7408f9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0598\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The review focuses on toxicity (myocarditis) rather than efficacy; do not infer conclusions about tumor response modulation from this text without caution.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ce5771d0255e802db4f70946\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c1ada2a687395496316a5157\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0598\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ce5771d0255e802db4f70946\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"source_identities\": {\n      \"P0017\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0017\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"DOP47 Gut microbiome contributes to the development of immune checkpoint inhibitor-related colitis\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1093/ecco-jcc/jjac190.0087\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"08d60ce7ff453c5ae2b4c3a47581b79e02b2b5a0\"\n      },\n      \"P0600\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0600\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Gut microbiota composition in patients with advanced malignancies experiencing immune-related adverse events\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.3389/fimmu.2023.1109281\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"CorpusId:257062954\"\n      },\n      \"P0011\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0011\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Correlation of the gut microbiome and immune-related adverse events in gastrointestinal cancer patients treated with immune checkpoint inhibitors\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.3389/fcimb.2023.1099063\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"042544f408b07e2d51c57f40f4df614d0c0960a7\"\n      },\n      \"P0308\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0308\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Gut microbiome for predicting immune checkpoint blockade-associated adverse events\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1186/s13073-024-01285-9\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"8524fbf4592e1ca625332b35344ad1a5d37aad93\"\n      },\n      \"P0312\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0312\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Biomarkers for immune-related adverse events in cancer patients treated with immune checkpoint inhibitors\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1093/jjco/hyad184\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"85e23d9e543859acdb7e57cd52f3d28495c0162e\"\n      },\n      \"P0049\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P004